\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para Carpinteros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se consiguen de jugadores con la profesión de Leñador. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Casa de Subastas.</rgb>'","Introducción a la carpintería","'Habla con el instructor de carpintería colina arriba hacia el este.'","Ahora tienes todos los ingredientes para fabricar un arma de serbal","Entrega el <rgb=#FF00FF00>arco, bastón, lanza, martillo, garrote, gran garrote o jabalina de serbal</rgb> al carpintero novato","Deberías hablar con un carpintero novato para aprender más sobre la carpintería.","La receta está completa. <rgb=#FF00FF00>¡No venda el arma de serbal!</rgb> Es hora de mostrar su trabajo a su mentor.","Se te han proporcionado ingredientes","El carpintero novato te ha proporcionado una <rgb=#FF00FF00>caja</rgb> llena de ingredientes que puedes usar para ejecutar una receta de arma de serbal. <rgb=#FF00FF00>Abre la caja</rgb> para obtener los ingredientes.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>Los ingredientes para carpinteros normalmente se compran a vendedores o se intercambian con jugadores que tengan profesión de leñador. También puedes encontrar ingredientes en la Sala de Subastas.</rgb>","Prensair puts the weapon through some rigorous tests before returning it to you with a smile.\
\
'I think that you have done very, very well, ${PLAYER}. I approve and declare you a novice woodworker.'"},
[7630]={"Introduction: Anórien (After Battle)","Imrahil can be found just outside the main gate of after-battle Minas Tirith. You can travel there from the Threshold of the City on the Pelennor battlefield and from pre-battle Minas Tirith. \
\
You have been summoned by Imrahil for an important task.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>The travel horses at pre-battle Minas Tirith are only available if you've completed Volume 4: Book 6, Chapter 8: On a Field of Red of the Epic. Alternatively you may get to the after-battle Minas Tirith from a Minas Tirith stable master.</rgb>","Habla con Aragorn","'It is good to see you again. A true ${RACE} of honour and nearly as fearless as I.'\
\
You relate Aragorn's request.\
\
'I have trusted Aragorn since the moment I saw Thorongil return to Linhir. Come, there is much to be done if we are to move an army.'","Even as the Men of Gondor and Rohan take stock of the devastation from yesterday's battle, the need to gather plans and press onwards cannot wait.","Imrahil can be found just outside the main gate of after-battle Minas Tirith. You can travel there from the Threshold of the City on the Pelennor battlefield and from pre-battle Minas Tirith.\
\
You have been summoned by Imrahil for an important task.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>The travel horses at pre-battle Minas Tirith are only available if you've completed Volume 4: Book 6, Chapter 8: On a Field of Red of the Epic. Alternatively you may get to the after-battle Minas Tirith from a Minas Tirith stable master.</rgb>","Habla con Éomer","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. I saw you speak with Aragorn and guess at what he asks.\
\
'Many Rohirrim have died this last day. If we were to stop now, their deaths would surely be for naught. I am rightful king of Rohan now and my men will do as I bid. Tell Aragorn I raise my sword with his and that when he blows his horns we will come to the call.'","Talk to Angbor","You have been summoned by Prince Imrahil, who stands just outside the main gate of after-battle Minas Tirith.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, I have need of your assistance. We have won the battle, but the Enemy is far from true defeat. You understand this as much as anyone.\
\
'We must act swiftly and decisively. We are soon to embark on our most arduous and perilous journey yet, I think. I hope you will come with me, but first I must ask you to bring word to Éomer and Angbor that our forces, such as they are, must be prepared to march.'","Aragorn can be found in his pavilion on after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should learn what plans Aragorn has and what help he might need.","Talk to Imrahil just outside of after-battle Minas Tirith","Angbor and Éomer can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion on after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should ask Angbor and Éomer whether their men are ready to march.","'${PLAYER}, I thank you for coming. While there is much work yet to be done in the City, you and I are now needed elsewhere: at Aragorn's pavilion upon the Pelennor, where we must take stock of the day and plan for the future.\
\
'Come, I will meet you there. We shall see what Aragorn has to say.'"},
[7631]={"Ethring can be found in the Ringló Vale to the south-east of Lamedon.\
\
Lothíriel has asked you to travel into Central Gondor and aid the people of Ringló Vale, Dor-en-Ernil, and Lebennin.","You have been summoned to Dol Amroth by Lothíriel, who seeks your aid in defending the lands of Central Gondor.\
\
You should meet Lothíriel in the Great Hall of the Prince in Dol Amroth.","Lothíriel can be found in the Great Hall of the Prince in Dol Amroth.\
\
You have been summoned to Dol Amroth by Lothíriel, who seeks your aid once more.","Talk to someone in Ethring in Ringló Vale about aiding Central Gondor","Introduction: Central Gondor","'You look as if you have travelled long this day, ${CLASS}. I hope your wits are still about you.\
\
'I have heard of your valour in the west, but dark times have come to our lands. We awoke to a dawn-less day, and found ourselves overrun by foes.\
\
'If you seek to aid us at the Lady's command, you both have chosen a fortuitous time.'","You have been summoned by Lothíriel in Dol Amroth, for Central Gondor is in need of your aid.","Speak with Lothíriel about Central Gondor","Talk to Lothíriel about Central Gondor","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for coming to my aid once more.\
\
'I grow concerned for the lands to the east... the lands of the Ringló Vale, Dor-en-Ernil, and Lebennin. Word has spread of war come to the shores in the east, and what folk remained behind are now beset by foes on all sides.\
\
'I would ask that you travel through Lamedon to the Ringló Vale. There you will find the settlement of Ethring, and I am certain the people there would benefit much from your presence, as we already have.'"},
[7632]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","'Notarás que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que tu habilidad de artesanía aumente, habrá más recetas disponibles, así que vuelve a visitarme con frecuencia.\
\
'Los objetos de comida se elaboran a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos objetos son los que puedes entregar a Aesseledh a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de obtener reputación. ¡Es mejor empezar temprano!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas ofrece las recetas que te permiten crear objetos de trueque únicos. Los objetos resultantes se canjean por reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","'¡Deberías hablar con Honestidad Buenavista inmediatamente!'","'Deberías hablar con Annie Henobosque de inmediato.'","Honestidad Buenavista ofrece numerosas recetas importantes","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Cocineros! Esta es una excelente facción para cocineros que buscan aprovechar su experiencia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, mi función es supervisar el avance de tu reputación cuando entregues tus objetos. ¡Con gusto recolectaré todo lo que prepares con nuestras propias recetas del gremio!\
\
'Para obtener las recetas que permiten fabricar los objetos que busco, debes hablar con Honesty Buenavista y, a continuación, con Annie Hayworst. Ellas te ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder del gremio es intercambiar objetos artesanales intercambiables a cambio de reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Cocineros, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar a los artesanos elegibles ventajas en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a mejores recetas de las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentas tu reputación, obtienes acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Cocineros. El líder se encuentra en la Comarca, en la localidad de Cavada Grande.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación se incrementa intercambiando objetos especialmente elaborados para ello.</rgb>","Annie Henobosque ofrece recompensas ventajosas a los miembros del Gremio de Cocineros","Aesseledh, el líder del Gremio de Cocineros, se encuentra en la sala del gremio en Cavada Grande.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía te ha indicado que hables con Aesseledh para conocer más sobre el Gremio de Cocineros.","Honesty Buenavista se encuentra en la sala del Gremio de Cocineros en Cavada Grande.\
\
Aesseledh te ha pedido que hables con Honesty Buenavista para ver las recetas que ella vende.","Introducción: Gremio de Cocineros","El Gremio de Cocineros es una sociedad que agrupa a los mejores cocineros de toda la Tierra Media.","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Cocineros, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar a los artesanos elegibles ventajas en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a mejores recetas de las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentas tu reputación, obtienes acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Cocineros. El líder se encuentra en la Comarca, en la localidad de Cavada Grande.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación se incrementa intercambiando objetos especialmente elaborados para ello.</rgb>","'¡Deberías hablar con el líder del Gremio de Cocineros inmediatamente!'","Habla con el vendedor de recetas para comidas","'Soy el vendedor al que debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para recibir tus recompensas. Puede que aún no tenga nada que puedas usar, pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez que aumentes tu reputación con nosotros.\
\
Los productos que puedes elaborar con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el mayor éxito en la creación. Asegúrate de volver una vez que alcances el nivel de Conocimiento en el Gremio de Cocineros.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Las recetas mejoradas vendidas por este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Habla con Aesseledh, el líder del Gremio de Cocineros","Annie Henobosque está en el salón del Gremio de Cocineros en Cavada Grande.\
\
Aesseledh te ha indicado que hables con Annie Henobosque para ver qué recetas vende.","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas"},
[7633]={"'We can delay no longer, my friend. My men and I must make our way to the east... to the aid of Minas Tirith.'\
\
Aragorn's voice suddenly grows quiet.\
\
'Many of our number shall sail upon the ships that survived the battle for Pelargir, but none are to know of this. ${PLAYER}, you must swear to me that you shall tell none of our passing up-river.\
\
'Lord Angbor shall travel overland and I would ask that you join his host as he passes through Upper Lebennin and Lossarnach. \
\
'Meet him and his men in Pelargir near the easternmost gates. I shall need every able warrior I can muster for the coming battle... may your journey be swift!'","Talk to Aragorn at his camp outside Pelargir","'I am glad you have come, ${PLAYER}. One of your skill would be a great boon to our cause... a boon we may well come to depend upon.\
\
'We have thrown up the gate to the east, and make ready to move through Upper Lebennin. Will you join us, my friend?'","Aragorn can be found at his camp to the north-west of Pelargir.\
\
You have been summoned by Aragorn to aid his forces as he presses eastward into Gondor.","You have been summoned by Aragorn, who requests your presence at his camp outside Pelargir.\
\
You should meet Aragorn and his host there as soon as you are able.","Meet Angbor at the eastern gates of Pelargir","You have been summoned by Aragorn to his camp near Pelargir where he hopes to set you and Lord Angbor upon new tasks.","Introducción: Gondor Oriental","Angbor can be found near the eastern gates of Pelargir.\
\
Aragorn has asked you to meet Lord Angbor in Pelargir before venturing into the lands of Upper Lebennin and Lossarnach."},
[7634]={"You have received a summons from Agátur the Boastful to join him at the fortress of Skarháld in Ered Mithrin. The Longbeard Dwarves have called for all their friends and allies to proceed to Skarháld as soon as they are able. The time to retake Gundabad is at hand.","You have been summoned to Skarháld in Ered Mithrin, for dwarves gathered there have need of your aid in their journey through Elderslade.","The Rushgate can be found on the border between Ered Mithrin and Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Rúzat at the Rushgate.","Introduction: Elderslade","Talk to Agátur the Boastful in Skarháld","'${PLAYER}, I am glad to see you! The march to Gundabad has begun! Many of us have set forth from Ered Mithin with our paths taking us through Elderslade. All sights are on Gundabad! I knew that you, one of our greatest allies, would march by our side. When you are ready, travel west to the Rushgate. I will meet you in Elderslade at Annâk-khurfu.'","The fortress of Skarháld can be found in Ered Mithrin.\
\
You should travel to Skarháld.","'Why the great ${CLASS} comes to the Rushgate! Humble Rúzat is very happy to see you again. You have done so much for the Zhélruka already! Now that you are here, Gundabad will certainly belong to the Zhélruka once more! Oh do not worry, other brave heroes are here too. I did not mean to put the weight of the entire march on your shoulders, my friend!'","The fortress of Skarháld can be found in Ered Mithrin.\
\
You should talk to Agátur the Boastful in Skarháld.","Talk to Rúzat at the Rushgate"},
[7635]={"Speak with Bregdal at Crithost in Talath Anor","You have been summoned by Lamlor to the First Circle of Minas Tirith, where he hopes you will be able to aid Gondor by searching out those who ride from Rohan.","You have found the hidden Wose village of Drû Bhûta. The village's inhabitants do not seem very concerned by your presence","Lamlor can be found at the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You have been summoned by Lamlor to aid Gondor on the eve of battle.","Speak with Lamlor at the First Circle of Minas Tirith","You have been summoned by Lamlor, who requests your presence at the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should meet with Lamlor as soon as you are able.","Introduction: Far Anórien","'The formalities of introductions can be dealt with later. If Lamlor sends you, then you are surely a skilled ${CLASS}.\
\
'Some of the Enemy has diverted from those who push towards Minas Tirith and have traversed north into Far Anórien. I was planning on scouting along the Onodló River for signs of the Rohirrim, but another matter has arisen. There are drumming sounds I keep hearing. They grow increasingly louder and seem to be coming from an area in Taur Drúadan, north of the Grey Wood. Would you be willing to investigate the sound, and make sure that it is not an ambush?'","The chieftain does not seem surprised by your presence. Instead, it looks as if Ghân-buri-Ghân has much on his mind. He sighs and gathers his thoughts.","Bregdal can be found in the village of Crithost in Talath Anor.\
\
You should seek out and speak with Bregdal.","Investigate the drumming sounds","The drumming sounds are coming from an area in the forest north-west of the Grey Wood.\
\
You should investigate the drumming sounds.","Ghân-buri-Ghân is in the village of Drû Bhûta in Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân, the chieftain of the Drúedain.","'Many have faith that the Rohirrim will arrive to aid us. I fear that folly may have befallen the riders. Perhaps all is not lost though. I have been told that you have spent much time out in the Pelennor, safely navigating through the thick of the Enemy. Would you be willing to ride north of Minas Tirith into Far Anórien and search for the riders?\
\
'You should speak with Bregdal in Crithost. He is a trustworthy ally, and Errand-rider of Minas Tirith. I sent him to Crithost on a special mission to seek information on the whereabouts of the riders. His knowledge of safe travel through Far Anórien is unmatched. Ride swiftly my friend, as time is short!'","Speak with the chieftain of the Drúedain"},
[7636]={"'${PLAYER}, you have returned! I'll wager your journey to the north was a success if you have returned to assist us at this hour.\
\
'While we successfully secured Talath Úrui, fumes and fire aside, the memory of that place still unsettles me. Borangos has remained hidden, but I saw tendrils of his thought everywhere, and his servants still haunted me. Now they are gone, and it is as if they never were. Where did they go, and for what purpose?\
\
'Pressing matters in the Morgul Vale drew us hither, and I must leave Talath Úrui behind. I will try not to dwell upon it, but still I worry. Let us aid Faramir with his task here, and we will turn to the matter of vanished Borangos when the city is cleansed!\
\
'I am glad you are here.'","From the hidden camp of Echad Uial, the dream of cleansing the Morgul Vale is in sight","'${PLAYER}! You earned my respect and it has not wavered; word of your deeds in Gorgoroth and in the northern lands has made its way back to me and to the other Rangers of Ithilien. And here we now meet upon the very doorstep of Minas Morgul! That is incredible, my friend, and yet I should not have doubted our paths would lead us here, where there is evil to be faced. Is that not what we do, time and again? It is indeed!\
\
'Faramir has regained his health, a gift of time and some say the healing powers of King Elessar himself, and he has led us here. There is a camp now, Echad Uial, and from there he plans to cleanse the city of its evil, and reclaim it for Gondor. Damrod travels with him and will be pleased to speak with you. Return to me when Damrod sees fit to release you!'","'You have done much to assist us in Rath Dúath, and I thank you for your efforts. Still, the Morgul Vale is filled with unspeakable dangers. Both the hills and the city must be faced and conquered if we are to banish this evil and cleanse the vale of the corruption that has seized it for so long.'","Echad Uial can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should travel to Echad Uial.","Those in the conquest of Gorgoroth and those in fealty to Gondor work together to cleanse the Morgul Vale and the fortress of Minas Morgul of the evils that inhabit them.","Talk to Thurindol","Introduction: Imlad Morgul","Travel to Echad Uial","Damrod and Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Damrod and Thurindol.","'${PLAYER}, I did not think to see you again. I heard that urgent matters took you away from the conquest of Gorgoroth and sent you far to the north. Well, much has transpired while you were gone, my friend. The Masters of Mordor have turned their attention upon the Dead City. I know not why, but their power has grown and whatever reasons they have for coming to Minas Morgul must be fell purposes indeed! We have come to stop them before they achieve... whatever it is they seek to achieve.\
\
'We found Faramir in good health, commanding the Rangers of Ithilien. They entered the Morgul Vale, and it is their design to cleanse the city of evil and reclaim it for King Elessar. Faramir established an encampment, Echad Uial, nearer to the city. If you should travel there, they will be glad to have your aid.'","Damrod can be found at Echad Uial.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Talk to Damrod","Complete quests in Rath Dúath to establish a hold in the area.","Complete quests in Rath Dúath to establish a hold in the area (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Welcome to Echad Uial, ${PLAYER}. Within any wood, we Rangers know how to travel at speed while remaining hidden; I find myself much more at home here than I did in the barren Wastes, where we last spoke. Come, we have much to discuss.' \
\
You and Damrod share stories and the account of your recent adventures.\
\
'Then you will assist us here in Rath Dúath, for now? Good! You have not changed, my friend. I am glad to hear it, for we have need of you here. Did you think otherwise?'"},
[7637]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","Introducción: Gremio de Joyeros","'Notará que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente su habilidad de artesanía, más recetas estarán disponibles, así que vuelva con frecuencia.\
\
'Los símbolos que necesita para la reputación se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos son los objetos que puede entregar a Aldúlf a cambio de reputación con este gremio. Esta es la única forma de ganar reputación. ¡Es mejor empezar temprano!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que le permiten crear objetos únicos de trueque. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","El Gremio de Joyeros es una sociedad formada por los mejores joyeros de toda la Tierra Media.","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Joyeros, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar a los artesanos elegibles ventajas en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a mejores recetas de las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes en reputación, obtendrás acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a forjar tu reputación con el Gremio de Joyeros. El líder puede encontrarse en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación se incrementa intercambiando objetos especiales creados por los artesanos.</rgb>","'Debes hablar de inmediato con Mirchiril.'","El vendedor Porto Corneta se encuentra en la sede del Gremio de Joyeros en Esteldín.\
\
Aldúlf, el líder del Gremio de Joyeros, te ha pedido que hables con Porto para que te familiarices con las ventajas de pertenecer a un Gremio de Artesanos.","Habla con Aldúlf, el líder del Gremio de Joyeros","Habla con el vendedor que vende recetas de símbolos del gremio","'Debes hablar de inmediato con Porto Corneta.'","Mirchiril ofrece muchas recetas importantes","Aldúlf, el líder del Gremio de Joyeros, se encuentra en la sede del gremio en Esteldín.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía le ha indicado que hable con Aldúlf para saber más sobre el Gremio de Joyeros.","El vendedor Mirchiril se encuentra en el salón del Gremio de Joyeros en Esteldín.\
\
Aldúlf, el líder del Gremio de Joyeros, le ha pedido que hable con Mirchiril para familiarizarse con las ventajas de pertenecer a un gremio de artesanos.","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Joyeros! Esta es una facción excelente para los joyeros que desean aprovechar su experiencia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, me corresponde supervisar el avance de su reputación cuando intercambie sus objetos. ¡Con gusto recogeré todo lo que fabriquen a partir de nuestras propias recetas del gremio!\
\
'Para obtener las recetas que permiten fabricar los objetos que busco, debe hablar con Mirchiril y luego con Porto Corneta. Ellos le ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder es intercambiar objetos artesanales negociables a cambio de reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","'¡Deberías hablar con el líder del Gremio de Joyeros inmediatamente!'","Porto Corneta ofrece recompensas interesantes a los miembros del Gremio de Joyeros","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas","'Soy el vendedor al que debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para recoger tus recompensas. Puede que aún no tenga nada que puedas usar por ahora, pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez que aumentes tu reputación con nosotros.\
\
'Los artículos que puedes fabricar con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el máximo éxito en la artesanía. Asegúrate de volver una vez que alcances el nivel Conocido en el Gremio de Joyeros!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Las recetas mejoradas vendidas por este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>"},
[7638]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","Reifnir ofrece muchas recetas importantes","Habla con Hávar, el líder del Gremio de Herreros","Lar ofrece recompensas interesantes a los miembros del Gremio de Herreros","'Notarás que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente tu habilidad de artesanía, habrá más recetas disponibles, así que vuelve a verme con frecuencia.\
\
'Los emblemas se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos son los objetos que puedes entregar a Hávar a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de conseguir reputación. ¡Es mejor empezar pronto!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que te permiten crear objetos de trueque únicos. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","El Gremio de Herreros es una sociedad que reúne a los mejores herreros de toda la Tierra Media.","Hávar, el líder del Gremio de Herreros, se encuentra en la sala del gremio en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía te ha pedido que hables con Hávar para saber más sobre el Gremio de Herreros.","'¡Debes hablar de inmediato con Lar!'","'Soy el vendedor al que debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para cobrar tus recompensas. Puede que aún no tenga nada que puedas usar por el momento, pero eso cambiará cuando aumente tu reputación con nosotros!\
\
'Los productos que puedes crear con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el mayor éxito en la artesanía. Asegúrate de volver una vez que alcances el nivel de Conocimiento con el Gremio de Herreros!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: las recetas mejoradas vendidas por este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Herreros! Esta es una excelente facción para los herreros que desean aprovechar su pericia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, mi papel es supervisar el avance de tu reputación cuando intercambias tus objetos. ¡Recogeré con gusto todo lo que fabriques a partir de nuestras recetas del gremio!\
\
'Para obtener las recetas para crear los objetos que busco, debes hablar con Reifnir y luego con Lar. Ellos te ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder del gremio es intercambiar objetos artesanales negociables a cambio de reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Habla con el vendedor que vende recetas de emblemas","Reifnir se encuentra en la sala del Gremio de Herreros en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Hávar te ha indicado que hables con Reifnir para ver qué recetas vende.","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Herreros, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la Artesanía.\
\
'El gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores que las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentas tu reputación, obtienes acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Herreros. El líder se encuentra en Ered Luin, cerca del área de artesanía en la Mansión de Thorin.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta intercambiando objetos artesanales especiales.</rgb>","Introducción: Gremio de Herreros","Lar está en el salón del Gremio de Herreros en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Hávar te ha indicado que hables con Lar para ver qué recetas vende.","'¡Debes hablar con Reifnir de inmediato!'","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas","'¡Deberías hablar con el líder del Gremio de Herreros de inmediato!'"},
[7639]={"Speak with Galadriel in the Court of Celeborn or in Caras Galadhon.","Speak with King Thranduil in the halls of Felegoth, in Eryn Lasgalen","'Hail, ${PLAYER}. I have been expecting your arrival.'","Speak with Galadriel","Introduction: Northern Mirkwood","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth, in Eryn Lasgalen. A swift horse in Southern Mirkwood will bring you to Tham Taerdol in Eryn Lasgalen, not far from the Elvenking's halls. Find such a swift horse in the ruins of Ost Galadh, in Emyn Lûm.","You have been summoned by Galadriel, Lady of Lórien, to discuss matters concerning the kingdoms of the north.\
\
You should meet Galadriel either at the Court of Celeborn or in Caras Galadhon.","You have been summoned by Galadriel, Lady of Lórien, to discuss matters concerning the kingdoms of the north.","Galadriel can be found either at the Court of Celeborn or in Caras Galadhon.\
\
You should speak with Galadriel.","'King Thranduil of the Woodland realm and I met in council. We spoke of the northern kingdoms and their peoples: the Elves that walk Felegoth's cavernous halls, the Men of Dale and those who dwell by the Long Lake, and the dwarves that live beneath Erebor, the Lonely Mountain. Much evil and darkness has left those lands, but it has not left them untouched.\
\
'I ask that you do your part to restore peace to the north. Speak with Thranduil in the halls of Felegoth. You can find a swift horse to the lands of the Elvenking by going to the ruins of Ost Galadh in Emyn Lûm, located in Southern Mirkwood. A horse will bear you swiftly to Tham Taerdol, and in the woods to the north-east you will find Felegoth.'"},
[7640]={"You have been summoned by Mablung, who requests your presence at his hideout in Osgiliath.\
\
You should meet Mablung and his men as soon as you are able.","'The lands east of here are completely ravaged by the enemy. Is it true that you traversed Osgiliath, the Causeway Forts, and Pelennor Fields? I almost cannot believe it! The White City will certainly benefit from your aid, brave warrior.'","Mablung can be found at his hideout within the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have been summoned by Mablung to aid Gondor as the Enemy presses closer to the city of Minas Tirith.","Talk to Damrod at the Ranger hideout in Osgiliath","Talk to Mablung at the Ranger hideout in Osgiliath","Travel to Minas Tirith and speak with Curugond","Talk to Mablung at his hideout in Osgiliath","Introduction: Old Anórien","Damrod can be found at the Ithilien Ranger hideout within the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have been asked by Mablung to aid Damrod in leading the Rangers out of Osgiliath.","'I am glad you have come, ${PLAYER}. The enemy has overtaken Osgiliath and they now march towards the Rammas. We could use one with your skills when we retreat from Osgiliath.\
\
'We make ready to move through Osgiliath towards the Causeway Forts. Will you join us, my friend?\
\
'Once we have made it safely to the White City, seek out Curugond. He is a good man, and I am sure that he will put your skills to use if you so desire to continue to help Gondor.'","Master Builder Curugond can be found in the First Circle of Minas Tirith, near the Lower Stables.\
\
You have asked by Damrod to speak to Curugond after you make the journey to Minas Tirith.","You have been summoned by Mablung to his hideout in Osgiliath where he hopes you will be able to aid the great Gondorian city, Minas Tirith.","'With or without Lord Faramir, we can delay no longer, my friend. I fear Osgiliath may be lost. My men and I are in the talks of retreating from this post so that we may aid Minas Tirith.\
\
'Damrod has elected to lead us through the city as he knows Osgiliath better than I. Speak with him if you wish to assist us.'"},
[7641]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","'¡Deberías hablar con el líder del Gremio de los Eruditos de inmediato!'","El Gremio de los Eruditos es una sociedad formada por los mejores eruditos de la Tierra Media.","Habla con Ethel Manzanal, la líder del Gremio de los Eruditos","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de los Eruditos, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores que las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentas tu reputación, obtienes acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de los Eruditos. El líder se encuentra en la Biblioteca de Elrond en Rivendel.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta intercambiando objetos especiales creados para ello.</rgb>","Introducción: Gremio de los Eruditos","Spiall está en la sede del Gremio de los Eruditos en Rivendel.\
\
Ethel Manzanal te ha enviado a hablar con Spiall para ver qué recetas vende.","Habla con el vendedor de recetas de pergamino","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de los Eruditos! Esta es una facción excelente para los estudiosos que buscan sacar provecho de su experiencia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, me corresponde supervisar el avance de su reputación cuando intercambien sus objetos. Con gusto recolectaré todo lo que fabriquen a partir de nuestras propias recetas del gremio.\
\
'Para obtener las recetas necesarias para fabricar los objetos que busco, debe hablar con Melongene Tuk y luego con Spiall. Ellos le ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder del gremio es intercambiar objetos elaborados y negociables a cambio de reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","'Soy el vendedor al que debes visitar cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para cobrar tus recompensas. Puede que por ahora no tenga nada que puedas usar, ¡pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez que avances en tu reputación con nosotros!\
\
Los productos que puedes elaborar con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el máximo éxito en la artesanía. Asegúrate de volver cuando alcances el nivel Conocimiento con el Gremio de los Eruditos!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: las recetas mejoradas vendidas por este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Melongene Tuk ofrece muchas recetas importantes","Melongene Tuk se encuentra en la sede del Gremio de los Eruditos en Rivendel.\
\
Ethel Manzanal le ha pedido que hable con Melongene para ver qué recetas vende.","'Notará que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente su habilidad de fabricación, más recetas estarán disponibles, ¡así que vuelva con frecuencia!\
\
'Los pergaminos se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos objetos son los que puede entregar a Ethel Manzanal a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de obtener reputación. ¡Es mejor comenzar temprano!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que le permiten crear objetos de trueque únicos. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Spiall ofrece recompensas interesantes a los miembros del Gremio de los Eruditos","'Deberías hablar con Melongene Tuk.'","Ethel Manzanal, la líder del Gremio de los Eruditos, se encuentra en el salón del gremio en Rivendel.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía le ha indicado que hable con Ethel Manzanal para obtener más información sobre el Gremio de los Eruditos.","<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta al comerciar objetos creados especialmente para ello.</rgb>\
\
'Veo que recientemente obtuviste acceso al Gremio de los Eruditos, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores que las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes tu reputación, obtendrás acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado temprano para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de los Eruditos. El líder se encuentra en la biblioteca de Elrond en Rivendel.'","'Deberías hablar con Spiall.'","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas"},
[7643]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","Toby Comebien ofrece recompensas interesantes para los miembros del Gremio de Sastres","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Sastres, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores que las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes en reputación, obtendrás acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Sastres. El líder puede encontrarse en Esteldín en las Quebradas del Norte.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los Gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta al intercambiar objetos especiales creados para ello.</rgb>","'Soy el vendedor a quien debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para cobrar tus recompensas. Puede que todavía no tenga nada que puedas usar por ahora, pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez que aumentes tu reputación con nosotros.\
\
'Los artículos que puedes elaborar con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el máximo éxito en la fabricación. Asegúrate de volver una vez que alcances el nivel 'Conocido' en el Gremio de Sastres.\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: las recetas mejoradas que vende este proveedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con la Gremio.</rgb>","'¡Deberías hablar con Toby Comebien de inmediato!'","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Sastres! Esta es una facción excelente para los sastres que buscan aprovechar su experiencia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, mi papel es supervisar el avance de tu reputación cuando intercambias tus objetos. ¡Con gusto recolectaré todo lo que fabriques con nuestras propias recetas del gremio!\
\
'Para conseguir las recetas para fabricar los objetos que busco, debes hablar con Jarmárr y luego con Toby Comebien. Ellos te ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder del gremio es intercambiar objetos artesanales negociables a cambio de reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","Hambrennil, el líder del Gremio de Sastres, está en los locales del gremio en Esteldín.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía te ha pedido que hables con Hambrennil para saber más sobre el Gremio de Sastres.","Introducción: Gremio de Sastres","'¡Deberías hablar con Jarmárr de inmediato!'","Habla con el vendedor de recetas de patrones","Ve a ver a Hambrennil, la jefa del Gremio de Sastres","Toby Comebien está en la sede del Gremio de Sastres en Esteldín.\
\
Hambrennil te ha pedido que hables con Toby Comebien para ver qué recetas vende.","Jarmárr está en los locales del Gremio de Sastres en Esteldín.\
\
Hambrennil te ha pedido que hables con Jarmárr para ver qué recetas vende.","Jarmárr ofrece muchas recetas importantes","<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta intercambiando objetos especialmente fabricados.</rgb>\
\
'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Sastres, #-1:{amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El gremio es una facción que puede otorgar a los artesanos elegibles ventajas en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores que las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes tu reputación, tendrás acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado temprano para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Sastres. El líder puede encontrarse en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.'","El Gremio de Sastres es una sociedad que agrupa a los mejores sastres de toda la Tierra Media.","'Notarás que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente tu habilidad de creación, más recetas estarán disponibles, ¡así que vuelve con frecuencia!\
\
'Los patrones se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos objetos son los que puedes entregar a Hambrennil a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de obtener reputación. ¡Es mejor empezar cuanto antes!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que te permiten crear objetos de trueque únicos. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el gremio.</rgb>","'¡Debes hablar con el líder del Gremio de Sastres de inmediato!'","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas"},
[7645]={"'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. Damrod sent you? There is indeed much to do before we can be sure the path to the Morannon, the Black Gate of Mordor, is clear and free of threat.\
\
'We would be grateful for your help in this task. Our numbers are small, and  I consider you as much a Ranger as myself.'","Talk to Mablung at the Camp of the Host","You have been summoned by Damrod, who requests your presence at the Camp of the Host in Northern Ithilien.\
\
You should meet with Damrod as soon as you are able.","Talk to Damrod at the Camp of the Host","You have been summoned by Damrod to the Camp of the Host in Northern Ithilien, where he hopes that you will be able to assist the Rangers of Ithilien in their tasks.","A strange howling sound rings out through the hills...","Mablung can be found at the Camp of the Host in Northern Ithilien.\
\
Mablung commands the Rangers of Ithilien stationed at the Camp of the Host and will be able to give you orders.","Introduction: The Wastes","'${PLAYER}, my friend. You received my message.\
\
'With the conflicts in Ithilien behind us, I trust you are well enough rested to press forward. The Host of the West prepares for the final leg of this journey. It will be perilous as the terrain is unkind and the enemies numerous. Since we know these lands better than any ally of Gondor, Aragorn has sent the Rangers of Ithilien ahead to ensure safe passage.\
\
'If you are able to lend us your arms, Mablung is coordinating the Rangers from the Camp of the Host. Speak with him if you would. I am sure he will be glad to see you.'","Damrod can be found at the Camp of the Host in Northern Ithilien.\
\
You have been summoned by Damrod to aid the Rangers of Ithilien as they make preparations for the march to the Black Gate."},
[7646]={"Sigue al rascacuevas","Entra a los Campos de Entrenamiento para iniciados y usa tu pico.","'¿Has venido a unirte a la caza del tesoro? Parece que cada día llegan más recién llegados con ganas de aprender los secretos de nuestro oficio. Tendrás que darte prisa si quieres unirte a los demás. Cruza el sendero hasta el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros y encontrarás allí a Halthor Ojodorado; él te dará más instrucciones.\
\
'Oh, y una cosa más: Halthor puede ser un poco... brusco al principio. ¡No dejes que eso te desanime! Se ablandará en cuanto demuestres tu valía.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Usa el rascacuevas dócil de tu inventario para completar este objetivo.</rgb>","Habla con Arngills en el Campo de Tesoros.","Excava en un lugar de excavación en los Campos de Entrenamiento","Habla con Halthor Ojodorado","Entra a los Campos de Entrenamiento y usa el rascacuevas de tu inventario.","'¡Excelente! Serás un magnífico cazador de tesoros; ¡ya has dominado la parte más difícil!\
\
'Me han dicho que te envíe con Orn Buscagemas, el instructor de zahorí. Supersticiones sin sentido, si me preguntas. Yo prefiero fiarme de mi brazo y de mis ojos antes que de un trozo de cristal, aunque Halthor Ojodorado cree firmemente en ello.'","Habla con Tór Buscasendas en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros para aprender a desenterrar tesoros.","Habla con Tór Buscasendas","Escoge un lugar de excavación y usa la gema de zahorí","Usa el rascacuevas de tu inventario","Habla con Orn Buscagemas en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros.","Habla con Tór Buscasendas en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros.","'Ahí estás, ${PLAYER}. He estado siguiendo de cerca tu progreso... me preguntaba cuándo el viejo Halthor te enviaría al campo.\
\
'Aquí tienes algunos obsequios de parte de los instructores para que puedas empezar. Si necesitas otro pico, regresa al campamento de los cazadores de tesoros y habla con Jondor.'","'¡Más cazadores novatos! Cada año sois más torpes que el anterior. ¡Casi me dan ganas de cancelar la caza del tesoro por completo! Pero hoy eres un ${RACE} con suerte... andamos escasos de cazadores capaces, y Aldúlf me ha convencido de que deberíamos darte una oportunidad.\
\
'Ahora que hemos terminado con las formalidades, ¡bienvenido! Soy Halthor Ojodorado, maestro de caza y adiestrador principal de rascacuevas del campamento de los cazadores de tesoros. Supongo que estarás deseando salir y empezar a cazar. Antes quizá te convenga echar un vistazo al campamento y hablar con algunos de los cazadores más experimentados antes de clavar el  pico en la tierra.\
\
'Ve a buscar a Tór Buscasendas... es un maestro excavando.","Habla con Orn Buscagemas","Habla con Halthor Ojodorado en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros en Ered Luin.","<rgb=#FF0000>Usa la Gema de zahorí del neófito de tu inventario para completar este objetivo.</rgb>","Devuelve el pico de iniciado a Tór Buscasendas","Vuelve a ver a Segar en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros.","Entra a los Campos de Entrenamiento","Te han invitado a tomar parte en una caza del tesoro en Ered Luin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","'¡Muy bien! ¡Serás un excelente zahorí!\
\
'Ahora deberías hablar con Segar, nuestro adiestrador de rascacuevas. Date prisa; he oído que ha estado preguntando por ti.'","Vuelve a ver a con Orn Buscagemas en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros.","Lugar de excavación explorado en los Campos de Entrenamiento","'¡Uno de los nuevos cazadores! Supongo que el joven Buscasendas te ha enviado para aprender sobre el arte del zahorí. La lección no debería llevar mucho tiempo... el zahorí es fácil de aprender, aunque bastante difícil de dominar.\
\
'¿Ves este cristal? Simplemente tómalo por la cadena y mantenlo firme. Concéntrate en la zona que deseas explorar y... bueno, ¡tendrás que verlo por ti mismo!\
\
'Puedes tomar prestado mi cristal y practicar en los tres sitios de excavación que tienes delante.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Usar una gema de zahorí con un sitio de excavación seleccionado te indicará el tamaño del cofre que contiene. Debes seleccionar un sitio de excavación para obtener una lectura adecuada.\
\
Usar una gema de zahorí sin haber seleccionado un sitio de excavación consumirá igualmente la gema.</rgb>","Entra a los campos de entrenamiento","'Tú... sí, ¡tú ahí! Eres ${PLAYER}, ¿no es así? Date prisa, te estaba esperando.\
\
'Me han encargado que te enseñe a cuidar y manejar rascacuevas. Hemos encontrado y adiestrado una variedad muy dócil de esta criatura. Rara vez, si es que alguna, causan problemas....\
\
'Tengo uno muy amistoso ya enjaulado y listo para ti. Veamos si sabes desenvolverte con una de estas bestias.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Un rascacuevas dócil buscará tesoros en la zona inmediata donde sea colocado. El rascacuevas no te conducirá a un lugar de excavación a menos que este contenga un cofre del tesoro. Aunque otros jugadores pueden ver tu rascacuevas, solo tú recibirás información sobre la recompensa.\
\
Los rascacuevas se consumen al usarlos.</rgb>","Habla con Segar","Entra a los Campos de Entrenamiento y usa la gema de zahorí de tu inventario.","'¿Has venido a aprender el refinado arte de desenterrar tesoros? No tiene mucho misterio; como dicen, todo está en la muñeca.\
\
'Toma este pico de cazador de tesoros y pruébala. Tráeme lo que descubras y veremos si tienes lo que hace falta.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Debes tener un pico de cazador de tesoros en tu inventario para excavar un sitio de excavación.</rgb>","Introducción: La caza del tesoro","Habla con Arngills","'Parece que aprendes rápido, ${PLAYER}. Todos mis cazadores no tienen más que buenas palabras para tu desempeño.\
\
'He acertado de lleno al seleccionarte como uno de nuestros nuevos cazadores de tesoros novatos; ya le he contado todo a Arngills. Está en el campo con los demás. ¡Será mejor que te des prisa en ir a verlo si quieres encontrar los mejores tesoros!'","'Nunca había visto a un novato manejar uno de nuestros rascacuevas con tanta soltura. ¡Ni siquiera intentó darte un mordisco! Ya he hablado con Halthor acerca de tu destreza.\
\
'Vuelve con él con mi bendición. ¡Estás listo para salir a cazar tesoros!'","Habla con Segar en el campamento de los cazadores de tesoros.","Gema de zahorí usada"},
[7647]={"Habla con Grimbeorn","'${PLAYER}, it is good to see you again. My father has sent me to the Vales of Anduin to resolve a trade dispute. When King Thranduil declared no one leave or enter Eryn Lasgalen, trade between the Elves and the Beornings was halted. Now he wishes to resume trade, for Elves, Men, and dwarves all rely upon this. The security of the north depends on Beornings and their willingness to trade. If you and Gandalf are headed to see Grimbeorn, perhaps you would speak to him of the reopening of trade between the Beornings and Elves. If there is one fact that I know of Grimbeorn, it is that he does not welcome guests. If we were to all greet him together, the task I was sent to do would surely fail.'","'Absolutely not. My decision has nothing to do with the King of the Greenleaves and everything to do with my people. However, I permit you to stay for as long as you need. I am not unkind.'","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","The Black Book of Mordor will bring you to the Vales of Anduin in Chapter 10","Gandalf believes that a greater task than assisting the Zhélruka and the Dwarves of Erebor has fallen upon those not completely vested in reclaiming the Grey Mountains.","The Dwarves of the North still need your help before you venture to the Vales of Anduin.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>If you are interested in following the storyline of the Black Book of Mordor, Chapter 10 will bring you naturally to the Vales of Anduin. Chapter 9 is available by speaking with Durin on the upper level of Skarháld.</rgb>","The dwarves of the North will need your help if they are to survive the dangers that threaten them.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>If you are interested in following the storyline of the Black Book of Mordor, Chapter 10 will bring you naturally to the Vales of Anduin. Chapter 9 is available by speaking with Durin on the upper level of Skarháld.</rgb>","Talk to Legolas at the Forest Gate in Eryn Lasgalen","Complete 'The Black Book of Mordor, Chapter 10.1: A New Journey'","The Black Book of Mordor will bring you to the Vales of Anduin in Chapter 10.\
\
Legolas can be found at the Forest Gate between Eryn Lasgalen and the Vales of Anduin.","Introduction: Vales of Anduin"},
[7648]={"Habla con Grimbeorn","'Absolutely not. My decision has nothing to do with the King of the Greenleaves and everything to do with my people. However, I permit you to stay for as long as you need. I am not unkind.'","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorninglands of the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","'${PLAYER}, you have received my father's request. It is good to see you again. Your assistance in this delicate task is most appreciated. Now, it would be unwise for both of us to travel to the Beorninghús to meet with Grimbeorn together. He does not welcome guests and I do not wish for my task to fail. Would you speak with Grimbeorn? I wish to scout Eryn Lasgalen, and make sure roads are truly safe. Come find me again once you have Grimbeorn's answer.'","King Thranduil wishes to resolve a trade dispute in the Vales of Anduin so that he may continue to provide assistance to the Men, Elves, and dwarves of the north.","King Thranduil requires your assistance in the Vales of Anduin. Thranduil has deemed Eryn Lasgalen safe and has opened the western road from Felegoth to the Vales of Anduin. He wishes for trade to continue between the Elves and Beornings. This was met with resistance from Grimbeorn, the leader of the Beornings, for reasons unknown. King Thranduil requires this dispute to be resolved hastily and diplomatically. The Elves, Men, and dwarves of the north all rely heavily upon trade. The security of the north is at stake.","Talk to Legolas at the Forest Gate in Eryn Lasgalen","Legolas can be found at the Forest Gate between Eryn Lasgalen and the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should talk to Legolas about King Thranduil's request to open the trade route through the Beorning-lands in the Vales of Anduin.","Introduction: Vales of Anduin"},
[7649]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de Armeros, amigo. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores de las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentas tu reputación, consigues acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a construir tu reputación con el Gremio de Armeros. El líder se encuentra en la Mansión de Thorin en Ered Luin.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta al comerciar objetos artesanales especiales.</rgb>","Habla con el vendedor de recetas de emblemas","Bill Musgoso está en la sala del Gremio de armeros en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Cottar Tunelero te ha indicado que hables con Bill Musgoso para ver qué recetas vende.","'Notará que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente su habilidad de fabricación, más recetas se volverán disponibles, así que ¡vuelva a consultarme con frecuencia!\
\
'Los emblemas se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos son los objetos que puede entregar a Cottar Tunelero a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de ganar reputación. ¡Es mejor comenzar temprano!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que le permiten crear objetos únicos de trueque. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Bill Musgoso ofrece recompensas ventajosas a los miembros del Gremio de armeros","Hatheldir se encuentra en la sala del Gremio de armeros, en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Cottar Tunelero le ha indicado que hable con Hatheldir para revisar las recetas que vende.","'¡Deberías hablar con el líder del Gremio de armeros de inmediato!'","'Debes hablar con Halthedir de inmediato.'","'Debes hablar con Bill Musgoso de inmediato.'","Introducción: Gremio de armeros","'Soy el vendedor al que debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para reclamar tus recompensas. Puede que aún no tenga nada que puedas usar, ¡pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez que aumentes tu reputación con nosotros!\
\
'Los productos que puedes fabricar con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el máximo éxito en la artesanía. Asegúrate de volver una vez que alcances el nivel de Conocimiento con el Gremio de armeros.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: las recetas mejoradas que vende este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Hatheldir ofrece muchas recetas importantes","El Gremio de Armeros es una sociedad que reúne a los mejores armeros de toda la Tierra Media.","<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación aumenta al comerciar objetos especiales creados para tal fin.</rgb>\
\
'Veo que recientemente has obtenido acceso al Gremio de armeros, #-1:{amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El gremio es una facción que puede conceder ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas mejores de las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes tu reputación, obtendrás acceso a más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a forjar tu reputación con el Gremio de armeros. El líder se encuentra en la Mansión de Thorin en Ered Luin.'","Habla con Cottar Tunelero, el jefe del Gremio de armeros","Cottar Tunelero, el líder del Gremio de armeros, se encuentra en la sala del Gremio en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía le ha pedido que hable con Cottar Tunelero para saber más sobre el Gremio de armeros.","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a la Gremio de armeros de Armas! Esta es una excelente facción para los armero que desean aprovechar su pericia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, mi función es supervisar el avance de su reputación cuando entregue sus objetos. Con gusto recolectaré todo lo que fabriquen a partir de nuestras propias recetas del Gremio.\
\
'Para obtener las recetas necesarias para fabricar los objetos que busco, hable con Hatheldir y luego con Bill Musgoso. Ellos le ayudarán a comenzar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder del Gremio es intercambiar objetos fabricados negociables a cambio de reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas"},
[7651]={"El líder del gremio te ofrece reputación a cambio de objetos que fabricas","'Ahora eres miembro del Gremio de Carpinteros, Sivullinen. No creo que seas digno, pero no me corresponde juzgar. Debes hablar con Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros. Se la puede encontrar en el salón del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín.'","Habla con el vendedor de recetas de talla","Tawarbes ofrece recompensas ventajosas para los miembros del Gremio de Carpinteros","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Carpinteros, ! Estoy seguro de que serás una valiosa incorporación a nuestras filas, pero aún te queda mucho por aprender.\
\
'Te sugiero que hables con Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros. La encontrarás en el salón del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín... tendrá mucho conocimiento que transmitirte.'","Habla con Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros","'¡Debes hablar con la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros inmediatamente!'","'Veo que recientemente has accedido al Gremio de Carpinteros, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Eso es un gran logro en el camino de la artesanía.\
\
'El Gremio es una facción que puede otorgar ventajas a los artesanos elegibles en su oficio. Al principio, puedes acceder a recetas superiores a las que normalmente encuentras en el mundo. A medida que aumentes tu reputación, tendrás acceso a aún más recetas.\
\
'Nunca es demasiado pronto para empezar a forjar tu reputación con el Gremio de Carpinteros. El líder se encuentra en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Los gremios son facciones de reputación que otorgan ventajas en la ejecución de recetas. La reputación se incrementa intercambiando objetos especiales creados para tal fin.</rgb>","'Soy el vendedor al que debes acudir cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para recoger tus recompensas. Puede que por ahora no tenga nada que puedas usar, ¡pero mis recetas estarán disponibles una vez avances tu reputación con nosotros!\
\
'Los productos que puedes crear con mis recetas son muy superiores a cualquier otra receta que encuentres y garantizarán el máximo éxito en la artesanía. Asegúrate de volver una vez alcances el nivel Conocido en el Gremio de Carpinteros.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Las recetas mejoradas vendidas por este vendedor son las recompensas por ganar reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","El Gremio de Carpinteros es una sociedad que agrupa a los mejores carpinteros de toda la Tierra Media.","Tawarbes se encuentra en la sede del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín.\
\
Viola Tejonera te ha indicado que hables con Tawarbes para ver qué recetas vende.","Guthki está en la sede del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín.\
\
Viola Tejonera te ha indicado que hables con Guthki para ver qué recetas vende.","'Es un honor darte la bienvenida al Gremio de Carpinteros, ${PLAYER}. No es poca cosa que te hayas unido a nuestras filas, aunque aún tienes mucho por aprender.\
\
'Tal vez deberías buscar a Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros. La encontrarás en el salón del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín. Estoy seguro de que compartirá su sabiduría contigo.'","'¡Ah, el Gremio de Carpinteros ha ganado otro miembro! Aunque tengo muchas ganas de ver tus creaciones, te sugiero que hables con Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros... posee una gran cantidad de conocimientos que, estoy seguro, compartirá contigo.\
\
'La encontrarás en el salón del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín.'","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Carpinteros! Esta es una facción excelente para los carpinteros que buscan aprovechar su experiencia.\
\
'Como líder de esta facción, mi papel es supervisar el avance de tu reputación cuando intercambias tus objetos. ¡Con gusto recogeré todo lo que fabriques usando nuestras recetas del Gremio!\
\
'Para conseguir las recetas necesarias para fabricar los objetos que busco, debes hablar con Guthki y luego con Tawarbes. Te ayudarán a empezar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: El papel del líder de la facción es intercambiar objetos fabricados y comerciables a cambio de reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","'Deberías hablar con Tawarbes de inmediato.'","'${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Gremio de Carpinteros, . No todos alcanzan los estándares que exigimos, pero tú lo has hecho admirablemente. Sin embargo, aun tienes mucho por aprender.\
\
'Debes ir al salón del Gremio de Carpinteros en Esteldín y hablar con Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros.'","'Deberías hablar con Guthki de inmediato.'","Introducción: Gremio de Carpinteros","Viola Tejonera, la líder del Gremio de Carpinteros, está en la sede del gremio en Esteldín.\
\
El Maestro de los Gremios de Artesanía te ha pedido que hables con Viola Tejonera para obtener más información sobre el Gremio de Carpinteros.","Guthki ofrece muchas recetas importantes","'Notarás que tengo muchas recetas nuevas a la venta. A medida que aumente tu habilidad de artesanía, más recetas estarán disponibles, ¡así que vuelve a consultarme con frecuencia!\
\
'Las tallas se fabrican a partir de las recetas que vendo; esos son los objetos que puedes entregar a Viola Tejonera a cambio de reputación. Esta es la única forma de ganar reputación. ¡Es mejor empezar pronto!'\
\
<rgb=#FF00FF00>NOTA: Este vendedor de recetas vende las recetas que te permiten crear objetos únicos de trueque. Los objetos resultantes se intercambian por reputación con el Gremio.</rgb>","Habla con el vendedor que ofrece recetas mejoradas"},
[7652]={"Los estandartes de la Mano Blanca pueden encontrarse en las ruinas de Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion. Lenglie está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Lenglie te ha pedido que le ayudes a determinar la identidad del líder de los semiorcos consiguiendo sus estandartes de las ruinas de Barad Morlas.","Consigue los estandartes de la Mano Blanca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has diezmado las filas de los semiorcos de Barad Morlas, pero Lengliel te advirtió de que no sería suficiente.","'Estos estandartes servirán, ${PLAYER}. Debería ser capaz de averiguar la identidad de los líderes de los semiorcos con no mucha dificultad.'","Estandartes de la Mano Blanca conseguidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿No has sido capaz de encontrar ningún estandarte en Barad Morlas, ${PLAYER}? Me resulta difícil de creer...'","'Necesitamos averiguar quién dirige a las fuerzas de Barad Morlas. Hasta que su líder sea derrotado, los semiorcos continuarán en este lugar, impertérritos.\
\
'Ve a Barad Morlas, ${PLAYER}, y consigue varios de los estandartes que los semiorcos han colocado allí. Entre esos ajados estandartes podría haber alguna pista para identificar a su líder.\
\
'Los estandartes están colocados por todo Barad Morlas, al suroeste de aquí. Apresúrate, ${PLAYER}... el tiempo se agota.'","Estandartes de los invasores","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"},
[7653]={"Con tus esfuerzos, los trasgos supervivientes de la batalla de Rath Teraig que hubieron a las ruinas de Lhúngobel han sido derrotados o expulsados de vuelta a Ered Luin. Con los trasgos dispersados, la gente de la Comarca Allende puede descansar tranquila sabiendo que un enemigo menos acecha en las Fronteras.","Derrot trasgos en Lhúngobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una compoañía de trasgos ha cruzado el río Lune a la Comarca Allende y capturado las ruinas de Lhúngobel.","Trasgos derrotados en Lhúngobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Invasores venidos de Ered Luin","Completado","Has derrotado muchos trasgos en Lhúngobel.","Mientras explorabas la Comarca Allende, has encontrado trasgos llegados de Ered Luin acampados en las ruinas de Lhúngobel. Aunque muchos trasgos fueron derrotados en la batalla de Rath Teraig, los supervivientes deben haber sido dispersados, con algunos de ellos huyendo a través del río Lune. Sin embargo, aun con sus números reducidos, ahora buscan saquear la Comarca Allende antes de cobrarse su venganza sobre los Enanos y Elfos de Ered Luin.\
\
Debes derrotar trasgos en las ruinas de Lhúngobel.","Los trasgos pueden encontrarse en Lhúngobel, en la Comarca Allende.\
\
Mientras explorabas la Comarca Allende, has encontrado trasgos en Lhúngobel. Debes derrotar trasgos en Lhúngobel."},
[7654]={"Invaders from Rhûn","Uya Hujûm can be found in north-eastern North Ithilien.\
\
Tordoron has asked you to assault the Khundolar encampment of Uya Hujûm.","Habla con Tordoron","Tordoron can be found in the northern wilds of North Ithilien.\
\
You have routed the Khundolar encamped in North Ithilien and should now report to Tordoron.","Destroy Khundolar trebuchets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'In my scouting, I have listened secretly to passers-by and have heard them refer to the camp in their tongue as Uya Hujûm.\
\
'To assail it shall be no easy task...\
\
'The Khundolar encampment is well-defended by their soldiers and they have armed themselves with trebuchets. I have not been able to discern how far their encampment stretches into the slopes of the Mountains of Shadow, but the pass they have claimed is of considerable length and shall be an arduous course.\
\
'To ensure the Khundolar can no longer pose a threat to Ithilien and the Host of the West, we must thin their numbers, dismantle their siege weaponry, and destroy their supplies.'\
\
Tordoron cracks a wry smile.\
\
'I would trust no other among us but you with this task, ${PLAYER}.'","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have routed the Khundolar threat within North Ithilien and should now return to Anborn.","A force of Khundolar Easterlings has invaded North Ithilien, bringing soldiers and weapons of war to wield against the Host of the West.","Defeat Khundolar at Uya Hujûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Khundolar ration-barrels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done it, my friend! I saw a few of their number flee back into Dagorlad as you returned. I do not think they expected to encounter a ${CLASS} of your skill!\
\
'They will certainly come again, but for a time, we are free of the Khundolar's presence in North Ithilien.\
\
'Now then... you should return to captain Anborn in Henneth Annûn and tell him of what you have done. If only I were there to see his face when you tell him of the Khundolar!'","'The Khundolar are routed... and flee in fear to Dagorlad?'\
\
Anborn's face betrays a mix of disbelief and joy.\
\
'You have done a great service to the Rangers, my friend. Through your efforts, our stores are renewed and my men better protected. Ithilien itself heals with greater vigour.\
\
'I think, perhaps, it is time that you rejoin your allies in the Host of the West. By my thinking, to deprive them of one of your skill would be a grave mistake.\
\
'Let us talk more of your journey, and of the road ahead.'","Destroyed Khundolar trebuchets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy Khundolar ration-barrels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Khundolar at Uya Hujûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burned Khundolar banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burn Khundolar banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Anborn at Henneth Annûn"},
[7655]={"Semiorcos derrotados en Barad Morlas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los semiorcos en Barad Morlas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Más semiorcos han llegado del Sur, ${PLAYER}. Han acampado en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de aquí. Lo que quiera que Saruman busque aquí, no puede ser para beneficio de los Pueblos Libres.\
\
'Se dice que Saruman es un maestro artesano, y que quizá busque ese arte prohibido que se perdió cuando Sauron destruyó Eregion. Sus súbditos deben ser dispersados antes de que puedan descubrir cualquier resto de conocimiento antiguo.\
\
'Ve a Barad Morlas, ${PLAYER}, y reduce las filas de los semiorcos que encuentres allí. Quizá eso los disuada.'","'Hay semiorcos también en Barad Morlas, al suroeste, ${PLAYER}. Me temo que debemos encargarnos de ellos como hicimos en Pembar.'","Pembar no es la única ruina élfica de Eregion que ha sido invadida. Barad Morlas, al sur, también se ha convertido en una plaza fuerte de los súbditos de Saruman.","Lengliel está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lengliel y contarle que has hecho lo que te pidió.","'Gracias por tus esfuerzos, ${PLAYER}. Grande es tu valentía, pero todavía hay mucho por hacer...'","Los semiorcos pueden encontrarse en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que vayas a Barad Morlas y diezmes las filas de los semiorcos que ocupan el lugar.","Invasores de Barad Morlas","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"},
[7660]={"Defeat Anduin lizards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Farasdúr near the Vinyards of Lórien","Defeated Anduin lizards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Anduin lizards are a vicious breed and must be driven from Lothlórien.'","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. I am the master huntsman of Egladil and the lands surrounding it. I and my hunters provide much of the meat we partake of during feasts and banquets in Lothlórien, though we are careful never to take too much from the forest's bounty.\
\
'Unfortunately, I have recently seen a new sort of creature about which threatens to throw matters awry -- a variety of large lizard that breeds along the banks of the Anduin. They used to be quite rare here, but of late their numbers have grown rapidly. Perhaps something evil has driven them from their territory upstream? I know not, but they are voracious hunters, and if we are to keep sufficient game within the bounds of Lórien's forests, then we must trim their numbers quickly. Will you lend us your aid?\
\
'It is unfortunate that Aesbrennil has not yet found a proper recipe for their tough meat, or we would be well-lardered indeed upon these beasts.'","Farasdúr is near the Vinyards of Lórien in Egladil.\
\
You should speak with Farasdúr near the Vinyards of Lórien.","'Commendable work, ${PLAYER}. I have no ill-will towards those creatures, but their presence here threatens the bounty of Lothlórien. \
\
'Perhaps when this dark time has passed, they shall return to their rightful grounds and prosper there again.'","Strange lizards have recently come to infest the forests bordering the Anduin, killing off many of the native animals.","Anduin lizards can mostly be found in Egladil in the south-east reaches of Lothlórien.\
\
Farasdúr has asked you to defeat several of the Anduin lizards that have encroached upon the hunting grounds of the Galadhrim.","Invasive Hunters"},
[7661]={"Talk to Himeinior near Barad Angol","'It is said that a group of foul sorcerers have begun performing foul rituals upon the land that has led to its blighted visage. I have sent Himeinior to investigate a tower that overlooks the sorcerers' encampment.\
\
'Would you travel to Barad Angol and assist Himeinior in gathering information about the blight? He will certainly need aid if he is to succeed.\
\
'Follow the path below this encampment down the mountain to Barad Angol. There, you will find Himeinior.'","The path to south of Helethir leads to Barad Angol.\
\
Danfennas has asked you to travel to Barad Angol and speak with the scout Himeinior.","'Traverse the path to the south of Helethir that leads to Barad Angol and speak with the scout that is found near the tower.'","Investigating Barad Angol","'It is good to see a friendly face, ${PLAYER}. Below this tower lies an encampment that appears to be responsible for the foul condition of this once beautiful forest. \
\
'Treacherous sorcerers that wield dark magic appear to be performing rituals in the encampment below. Our hope is to launch a series of attacks against this encampment to disrupt their plans.'","A blight has fallen upon the Ashenslades, and the source seems to be somewhere in the vicinity of Barad Angol. The Malledhrim have sent a scout to determine the source of the blight."},
[7662]={"Help Dolenthol with 'Confronting Shakfut'","Damrod is standing by in Barad Angarth, awaiting word on Ugrukhôr's forces.\
\
You should talk to Damrod.","Damrod has asked you to investigate the invading Orc army fortified in Zhar Skator, the western half of the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.","Talk to Damrod","'Come with me. I will lead us back to Barad Angarth unnoticed.'","'Hello again, ${PLAYER}. We have learned that the invading Orc army is under the command of the Gúrzyul Ugrukhôr. Clearly, there is very little unity among the former servants of Sauron.\
\
'I do not know why they have not pressed their attack on Gothmog's forces. It seems they entered the city, and then halted. Do they anticipate reinforcements? We must know more before we can act.\
\
'Please venture further into Ugrukhôr's encampment and gather information about the stalemate between the two forces.'","Help Damrod in Barad Angarth with 'Twice the Threat'","Dolenthol has asked you to venture further into Zhar Skator and learn more about Ugrukhôr's forces.\
\
You should help Dolenthol with 'Word Among Ugrukhôr's Forces'.","Help Dolenthol with 'Word Among Ugrukhôr's Forces'","Damrod has asked you to destabilize the Orc forces by completing several tasks in the western half of the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should complete quests in Zhar Skator.","Find Dolenthol","Return to Dolenthol in Zhar Skator with a report of what you overheard from Ugrukhôr's forces.","'Your work bears fruit, ${PLAYER}! Ugrukhôr's Orcs have moved to attack Gothmog's forces, and truthfully they do so as an unorganized mob, without discipline. If we tread carefully, we may be able to deal decisive blows to both armies!'","Help Damrod with 'The Enemy of my Enemy'","Investigation and Instigation","Help Dolenthol with 'Spoil the Supplies'","'Ugrukhôr ordered his forces to enter the city, but they were unable to break through to the next tier and have stalled. The march has left their supplies depleted and strained the morale of the Orcs. A handful of the bigger ones are keeping the others in line, and for now they await further instructions. I believe I know what we must do.\
\
'Drive off the Orc captain Shakfut, and destroy nearby supplies so we can foment dissent among Ugrukhôr's forces.'","Dolenthol has asked for assistance destabilizing Ugrukhôr's forces in the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should help Dolenthol with 'Confronting Shakfut' and 'Spoil the Supplies'.","You should return to Dolenthol and inform him of your progress.","'The information you gathered was of the utmost importance. I agree with Dolenthol, our best hope of breaking this siege may be to turn the Orc armies against each other.\
\
'My scouts tell me the Orcs have begun to gather in the western reaches of the Circle of Wrath. If we strike quickly, we might destabilize their forces; with strategy we may goad them into lashing out against Gothmog's forces.\
\
'Head west, and see if you can assist Dolenthol in destabilizing the Orc army gathered there.'","Dolenthol can be found somewhere amongst the fortifications in Barad Angarth.\
\
You should talk to Dolenthol.","'It appears your work was successful! Ugrukhôr's forces are preparing to retaliate against Gothmog's Orcs.\
\
'It would be wise for us to leave the area before they mobilize. Our plan will fail if they realize it was the Rangers of Ithilien that instigated the attack! We should head back to Barad Angarth and inform Damrod of our success.'","Talk to Dolenthol"},
[7663]={"Calin awaits your return in the farm-house in Woodhurst.\
\
You should return to Calin and let him know what you have found.","You find nothing of interest on this person","The door has been unlocked, and you may now enter","Talk to Calin","Elda is outside the Mead Hall of Woodhurst.\
\
Calin told you to return to the Mead Hall and tell Elda to let you in so that you can search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.","'I thought I made it clear that you should not be here?\
\
'What?! Calin wants me to let you into the Mead Hall?\
\
'This is outrageous! How dare he undermine everything we worked for and place his trust in you, whom he just met. I will speak with the others about this!'","Talk to Elda","'Ah, the ${CLASS} returns! I hope it is good news that you bring me?\
\
'Forgive me. My desire to know our enemy has clouded my reason. It was not likely that we would find much of use. However, this news of Elda's actions is troubling.\
\
'He is no longer watching the Mead Hall? I will seek an audience with him soon, as we are apparently not of a similar mind.'","Search bodies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","This man's club is bloodied, and may have delivered Cynethryth's killing blow","There are signs of a struggle, but it is eerily quiet and unlikely anyone survived","The bodies of the men who attacked the Mead Hall can be found throughout the hall.\
\
Calin asked you to search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.","The Mead Hall door must be unlocked before you can enter and investigate the bodies of the fallen assailants.","The Mead Hall was attacked by men from Woodhurst for an unknown cause. The Reeve's advisors have worked to keep the attack a secret to help maintain peace.","The bodies of the fallen assailants were left inside the Mead Hall.\
\
Calin asked you to search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.","'Arnwi was right to not speak openly of the truth. We spread the rumour that Heremond left for Brockbridge, as it was the only way to ease tensions and further violence against him. Only a few know of this.\
\
'One night a group of men forced their way into the Mead Hall and attacked everyone in sight. We are not certain who they were or why they did this, but they seemed intent upon reaching Heremond and his family. We barely escaped with Herubrand, but not everyone returned.\
\
'Would you enter the Mead Hall and search the bodies for any evidence of their motives? Alas, we will not be able to maintain secrecy for long, as the bodies are beginning to stink.'","This person is holding a bloody dagger and may have delivered the Reeve's killing blow","A fancy knife that appears to be Cynethryth's is sticking out of this man's chest","Unlock the Mead Hall door","Investigation of the Mead Hall","Use the key to unlock the Mead Hall door","Enter the Mead Hall of Woodhurst"},
[7664]={"'Calin proved his loyalty, and has not left my side. At first, I thought he stayed close to keep his eye on me, but I have found he is simply dedicated to me. He is a good man, and I see why my father liked him.\
\
'Calin came to me a few minutes ago looking nervous. Arnwi invited Calin for a drink at the nearby tavern, which seems harmless, but Calin wouldn't be worried for nothing. Please accompany Calin to help calm his nerves.'","Accompany Calin to the nearby tavern, where he has arranged to have a drink and catch up with Arnwi.","Invitation for a Drink","Speak with Herubrand","Calin is nervous about an unusual invitation for a drink with Arnwi, who has been out of touch for some time. Calin may be overly cautious, but a lot has happened lately to put him on edge.","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
He needs to know what has occurred in the tavern.","'Thank you for agreeing to come with me. I believe Arnwi simply wants to catch up after being out of touch for some time, but something just did not seem right. I feel more comfortable having you come with me.\
\
'We will leave as soon as you are ready to depart.'","'That rotten traitor! Why would Arnwi do such a thing? I wonder if he has been working against me this entire time. He coordinated that attack, and showed that he is working with the Dunlending ruffians.\
\
'I am a fool for not seeing it earlier. The Dunlendings have been the source of trouble brewing here. Was I blinded by my mixed heritage, and my view of them being brothers?'","Speak with Calin"},
[7665]={"Invitación al Festival del Lithe","Opal Buenavista se encuentra en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías hablar con Opal Buenavista, ya que te ha invitado a participar en los eventos del Festival del Lithe.","${PLAYERNAME:Estimado[m]|Estimada[f]} ,\
\
Estás ${PLAYERNAME:invitado[m]|invitada[f]} a participar en los eventos del Festival del Lithe de este año. ¡Hay mucho que hacer y tan poco tiempo! La Liga de las Posadas ha crecido, pero solo como respuesta a una competencia bastante poco amistosa por parte de la Asociación de la Cerveza, la nueva facción de los enanos.\
\
No olvides visitar El Sabor de Hobbiton ni las carreras de barriles de la Mansión de Thorin. También hay pesca en Delagua... pero no quiero estropearte la sorpresa. Ven al Árbol de la Fiesta y te lo explicaré todo mejor en persona.\
\
Atentamente,\
\
Opal Buenavista","Habla con Opal Buenavista en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Hobbiton","'¡Estoy demasiado ocupada para hablar contigo! ¡He perdido el desayuno por culpa de Lobelia y sus exigencias desmedidas! Toma esta guía y márchate. Te pondrá al día de todos los eventos de este año, ¡porque yo no tengo tiempo!'","El Festival del Lithe tiene mucho que ofrecer este año, y has sido ${PLAYERNAME:invitado[m]|invitada[f]} a participar en todos sus encantadores eventos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[7671]={"Collected unrefined ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This iron would better serve us as axes, hammers, and swords in less dire times. But as we stand here now, it seems the best course of action to make the cauldron to scorch our enemies and drive them off. You are to be thanked for these efforts.'","Collect unrefined ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I've orders from the Captain-General that need following, friend. You look the type of ${RACE} that knows well how to follow them, so I find myself here asking you to undertake a simple, though possibily dangerous task that needs doing and quickly.\
\
'To the north, at the foot of the great Misty Mountains, in the place called Arador's End, is the Isendeep. A great vein of ore runs through that place, and it is this iron we need now.\
\
'Get the iron from the Isendeep and bring it to me, so that I may craft the cauldron to strengthen our walls. If you find no ore there or the mine is held by the Enemy, then take the fight to Grothum and slaughter the goblins who would mine there.'","In the Isendeep, to the north in the central part of Arador's End, you will find iron ore.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Lugazag from the Enemy. You have been tasked with collecting the iron he needs to forge the cauldron.","Iron for the Cauldron of Lugazag","Deliver the ore to Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr at Lugazag","Lugazag is in need of stronger defences. In order to build a significant defence, the Captain-General has ordered that a great cauldron of iron be forged and filled with oil.","'The iron can be found in the Isendeep or carried by the goblins in Grothum. I would prefer that you slaughter the goblins, as they are terrible pests, but the swiftest method is the best at this time, friend.'"},
[7672]={"Volver a Jiret-menêsh","Gôbezhir has asked you to keep an eye out while travelling through An Shêru for birêt-kibur, iron fallen from the sky. Birêt-kibur could be found anywhere in An Shêru.","You have collected plenty of birêt-kibur while travelling through An Shêru. You should return to Jiret-menêsh so you may give it to Gôbezhir.","Iron from the Sky","Birêt-kibur collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have collected plenty of birêt-kibur while travelling through An Shêru. You should speak to Gôbezhir and give him the ore for which he asked.","Bring the birêt-kibur to Gôbezhir Firmhand","'By my beard, ${PLAYER}, you did it! Look at all that ore!'\
\
Gôbezhir excitedly takes a jeweller's loupe from his pocket and examines one of the pieces you brought him.\
\
'Aye, this is birêt-kibur, to be sure. I am near to weeping! But no, smelting first, weeping later. ${PLAYER}, you have my undying gratitude.'","'Well met, ${PLAYER}! Your arrival at Jiret-menêsh is grist for the mill, as they say! You are quite the lively topic of conversation. I have not spoken to a visitor in one hundred years!'\
\
The jovial dwarf chuckles and bows to you.\
\
'But how rude of me, I should introduce myself! I am Gôbezhir Firmhand, master smith of Jiret-menêsh. I have heard you are well-travelled! I envy the sights you have likely seen, though I am no warrior and am happy to live a quiet life.\
\
'I wonder, though, if you would be willing to keep an eye out for something for me. Since returning to the surface, I have had unusual dreams. I dream of a starlit night with falling stars trailing fire, streaking across the sky. They look so close, you could almost touch them. It is not unheard of for such things to be seen from the Height of the Sky, but I cannot help but feel like these dreams bear a message.\
\
'When these stars land, they leave iron ore unlike any from a mine. It is stronger, resistant to rust, and must be worked at a higher temperature. We call it birêt-kibur, 'the noble iron'. I believe in my heart that I am to use birêt-kibur to craft an axe. Not just any axe, but my life's masterwork. I must do this thing, but I am only suited for the forge, not for adventures in the wilds.\
\
'If you happen to come across birêt-kibur during your travels in An Shêru, would you collect it and bring it to me?'","Collect birêt-kibur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gôbezhir Firmhand dreams at night of falling stars and believes he is destined to forge an axe crafted from birêt-kibur, 'the noble iron'."},
[7674]={"Collected unrefined ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the unrefined ore to Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr at Tirith Rhaw","Unrefined ore can be found in the Isendeep to the north in Arador's End or on the goblins living in Grothum, north and east of Tirith Rhaw.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Tirith Rhaw from the Enemy. He has asked you to find the unrefined ore he needs to forge the cauldron.","'Orders from the Captain-General have me collecting ore to craft a forge cauldron in which to boil oil.\
\
'I am asking you to make your way north into the Isendeep to get unrefined ore and bring it to me. If you cannot find the ore there, then search amongst the goblins to the north and east in Grothum.\
\
'Return to me when you have the materials needed, and I will forge the cauldron.'","Collect unrefined ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I will begin work as soon as I have enough ore to forge the cauldron. I thank you for all you have done, ${PLAYER}. Our strength will see us through the coming battles.'","'Be swift, for I must forge the cauldron and shore the walls before the Enemy once again crashes against them.'","Tirith Rhaw is in need of stronger defences. In order to build a significant defence, the Captain-General has ordered that a great cauldron of iron be forged and filled with oil.","Iron on the Walls of Tirith Rhaw"},
[7675]={"'Tu primera misión contra los orcos del sur ha tenido un resultado más que notable. Ya he visto algunas caras sonrientes en nuestro campamento, donde antes no había ninguna.\
\
'Te estoy muy agradecido por tu ayuda, pero ahora me gustaría pedirte otro favor. Los orcos entrenan bestias de guerra que han descubierto a nuestros exploradores, hiriendo a algunos y matando a otros. Estos rastreadores infunden miedo en el corazón de mi pueblo, y si podemos mostrarles valor, podremos continuar el trabajo que has comenzado.\
\
'Hablo de los huargos, que vagan por las tierras al sur y al oeste de Ost Guruth, especialmente en los alrededores de Ost Cyrn. Los orcos marcan a las bestias que prefieren dejando cicatrices en sus patas. Reúne esas patas cicatrizadas de este enemigo, y demostraremos a los Eglain que no tienen nada que temer de este enemigo.'","Los huargos acechan en las tierras situadas al sur y al oeste de Ost Guruth, especialmente en los alrededores de Ost Cyrn.\
\
Grimdeal te ha pedido que caces a los huargos para conseguir sus patas y demostrar a los Eglain que el miedo que les inspiran puede ser superado.","Orcos que portan la bandera de Angmar se han derramado en las Tierras Solitarias desde el norte y han ocupado Ost Cyrn, unas ruinas situadas al suroeste de Ost Guruth.","'Demasiados de los míos han visto las fauces de los huargos de cerca como para sentir otra cosa que miedo al pensar en ellos. Debemos mostrarles que esta amenaza puede ser domada.'","Lleva las patas de huargo a Grimdeal, en Ost Guruth","Mandíbulas de hierro","'Una colección magnífica, que sin duda inspirará a nuestro pueblo. Sabrán que este enemigo puede ser derrotado, y que tú eres el héroe que lo ha conseguido.\
\
'Creo que el tramo de camino será algo más seguro, y quizás podamos permitirnos enviar mensajeros a Hunulf y Gadaric Mascador con suministros para comerciar. Tus esfuerzos nos inspiran y nos ayudan a todos, ${PLAYER}.'","Patas de huargo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7676]={"'We have won the day for a moment. We must report this victory to the Captain-General and ask for support from Glân Vraig.\
\
'Make your way to Glân Vraig to the south and east and report our victory here at the Isendeep to Captain-General Tordúr. Tell him that we need reinforcements sent as quickly as possible. If we are not reinforced soon, the Enemy will return in too great a number to defeat.'","Isendeep Reinforcements","Deliver the message without defeat","Forces loyal to the Free Peoples have liberated the Isendeep.","Another has informed the Captain-General, support arrive shortly at the mine.","Talk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig","'This news is very well-received. I will order forces to make their way to the Isendeep immediately. Thank you for the news, ${PLAYER}.'","Angmar's Army must not control the Mine","Glân Vraig lay to the south-east of the Isendeep.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Herecyne is under orders to inform the Captain-General of the successful attack and acquisiton of the Isendeep. She has ordered you to make your way to the Free Peoples' encampment of Glân Vraig and tell the Captain-General of the success.","Angmar's Army has taken control of the Mine, no support can be sent","Support must not be present at the mine","You have failed to the deliver the message to the Captain-General"},
[7678]={"Iserngraf: Base Mettle","Iserngraf is teeming with invading enemies. Reducing their numbers should make them less of a threat for the Rohirrim when they return to reclaim this mine.","Defeated invaders in Iserngraf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Having reduced the ranks of enemies within Iserngraf, return to Frithnoth and apprise him of your efforts.","Defeat invaders in Iserngraf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat enemies within Iserngraf","Talk to Frithnoth","Upon entering Iserngraf, it is clear that the invaders will not leave peaceably. You take it upon yourself to discourage a number of them, thinning their presence in the mine.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Iserngraf: Severance to be underway in order to access Iserngraf. If that quest has been completed, or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter Iserngraf in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","'Well done! Your efforts have discouraged our enemy and should allow us to even more easily displace them!'","Defeat enemies within Iserngraf."},
[7679]={"Collected uncommon ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Uncommon ore can be found in the Iserngraf.\
\
You should collect uncommon ore and bring it to Frithnoth.","'This is interesting! We have overlooked this ore in the past, but if the Enemy was interested in it, perhaps we should be as well.'","Find uncommon ore within Iserngraf","'This is interesting! We have overlooked this ore in the past but it seems as though the Enemy has an interest in it. Have you found any more of this? I would like to learn more of its properties.'","Bring the ore you collected to Frithnoth","Find uncommon ore within Iserngraf.","Though you have travelled through many mines in the past, you see something that you have not seen before within the Iserngraf.\
\
You see small piles of oddly-veined ore scattered on the floor. Perhaps Frithnoth would have some use for it.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Iserngraf: Severance to be underway in order to access Iserngraf. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter Iserngraf in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Iserngraf: Extraction","Collect uncommon ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7680]={"You ran out of time...","As you approach Gangfinda, you hear Frithnoth shout across the yard to you.\
\
'Trust in Gangfinda to lead you to Iserngraf. He is sure-footed and knows the way well!'","Defeated the leader of the invaders in Iserngraf","The miners of Iserngraf have been driven out by invading enemies. Hoping to discourage the foe, Frithnoth has sent you into the mine with the task of defeating the leader of this incursion.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting this quest.</rgb>","'Excellent! You bested the foul thing that led this incursion. That should weaken the enemy's resolve!'","Iserngraf: Severance","You should return to Frithnoth and inform him of your success within Iserngraf.","Gangfinda stands nearby.\
\
You should ride Gangfinda to Iserngraf.","Talk to Frithnoth","Defeat the leader of the invaders in Iserngraf","'Well met, friend ${CLASS}. Normally, I would not ask this of an outsider, but you look the sort who could be of aid.\
\
'Iserngraf, one of our mines, has been attacked, and we have been driven out. This mine is a valuable source of ore that we need for weapons and armour. We dare not lose it, for its resources are rich and our need of it is great.\
\
'I would ask that you travel to Iserngraf and meet the leader of these invaders in battle. Defeat him -- or it -- and return to me. Gangfinda can guide you to the Isengraf, but will take you no further than the entrance. Horses and dark caves do not go well together, as I am sure you have heard.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting this quest.</rgb>"},
[7681]={"There are indications the statues were once wrapped in this cloth","You have searched the Elderwell for signs of the Ishâkhai. Return to Máladil to inform her of your findings.","'Hello, my friend. Have you found anything of note?'\
\
You tell Máladil of your findings at the statues.\
\
'Those are good finds! I will look into them further to determine if they are really relics of the Ishâkhai. There is so much to learn of these people who vanished long ago.\
\
'You have my thanks, friend. You would make a great researcher should your adventuring days ever come to an end.'","Ishâkhai of the Elderwell","Return to Máladil with your findings","This statue has been destroyed by time. There is not much to learn from it","'Greetings, ${CLASS}. Are you here to admire the Elderwell?\
\
'It is quite the sight to behold. I left Sul Madásh to come here and investigate it in hopes to learn more about the Ishâkhai.\
\
'Would you like to help me search these ruins for any signs of them?'","Investigate old cloth","Examine weathered markings","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the broken statue","Máladil is studying the Elderwell and has asked for your help searching the ruins for signs of the Ishâkhai.","The markings appear to be some form of writing. You do not recognize the language"},
[7682]={"Talk to Hidâti","'It is done. Ishími is banished, and should no longer trouble the Aradûni.\
\
'You must understand, however, that it is not banished for good, it has just been forced to move. I may be the elder Kâparai, but even I am not powerful enough to permanently banish a spirit of such malevolence. I fear Ishími may haunt Shagâna forever, lest we discover what it really is, and what unleashed it.'","Ishími, the Anguished Wind","Placed Kâparai wards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Banished Ishími, the Anguished Wind","Ishími has successfully been banished.\
\
You should talk to Hidâti.","Place Kâparai wards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ishími has begun manifesting near the statue of Izighûz Menûndari.\
\
You should find the cyclone of wind near the statue.","'The howling wind had abated! You have truly done it! You have truly proven yourself friends of the Aradûni.\
\
'I will speak with Mizâdi on behalf of Damakhêra Ardu. I believe an alliance would benefit both Hamât and Aradûn. Together, we will attack Emax Dûl and push the Ordâkhai from these lands!'","You must defeat the coalesced form of Ishími, the Anguished Wind to banish it from the Dawn-warden!\
\
You must place the final Kâparai ward near the cyclone to confront Ishími.","Find the cyclone of wind","The Anguished Wind howls in defiance!","The soldiers at the Dawn-warden are being harried by an unseen force.","Banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind","'I am Captain Hanâbu of the Aradûni, the Servants. Like Hamât Renewed, we have risen to reclaim our ancestral lands from Ordâkh. What was once Nísaka will be Aradûn, by will of our leader, Damakhêra Ardu.\
\
'I have led this group of soldiers ahead to scout Idagâl, in preparation for our larger force to arrive. We mean to make war on the Ordâkhai, starting with their fortress at Emax Dûl. I thought it fitting to make our first camp under the Dawn-warden, the hero-king Izighûz Menûndari himself, but perhaps he does not look favourably upon us!\
\
'Something haunts this place: a foul, torturing wind. It keeps us from Emax Dûl! We cannot even think straight, let alone plan our invasion!'","'It is good I came with you. I will banish Ishími from this place, and you will assist me.\
\
'Take these wards. We will place them around the camp, and tend to the Aradûni's broken spirits. This will enrage Ishími, and he will manifest to stop us. We will be ready.'","Healed frightened Aradûni (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","(Optional) Place the final Kâparai ward","Talk to Captain Hanâbu","'It is as I thought. Ishími is enraged by our attempts to banish it. Look, it manifests on the ridge near the statue of Izighûz Menûndari! It gathers for a final attack! Ready yourself!\
\
'We must place a ward near that whirlwind, forcing it to coalesce itself into something we can fight.'","Ishími coalesces into a solid form to confront you!","You will need Hidâti's help to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind.\
\
You should talk to Hidâti.","Heal frightened Aradûni (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ishími has become enraged by your attempts to banish it.\
\
You should talk to Hidâti.","Ishími has successfully been banished.\
\
You should talk to Captain Hanâbu.","Hidâti has a plan to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind from the Dawn-warden.\
\
You should place Kâparai wards and heal the spirits of frightened Aradûni with Hidâti."},
[7683]={"'Frithwyn and Céolflad were kind to me when they returned. Edhild is still cold, but... I sense that she has changed as well.\
\
'What did you say to them to make them change their minds?'\
\
You tell Ránmald that it was private, but perhaps the women will tell her someday.","Ránmald is in the cave amongst the other women of Byre Tor, who have promised to treat her more kindly.\
\
You should speak with Ránmald.","The surviving refugees are in their cave north of Byre Tor.\
\
You should speak to the refugees about the situation at hand.","Talk to Frithwyn","Ránmald has been cast out by her fellow survivors, and is alone with her husband and father-in-law dead. To be pregnant, alone, and out in the cold wild with no support will be a death sentence for her.","Speak with Ránmald","'I... I suppose you must leave to find the others, then. I had hoped that you would be able to see us to safety again, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
You think upon Ránmald's difficult situation. She cannot travel far while pregnant, and the other women do not seem able or willing to care for her in her time of need.\
\
Yet... you must see to the others who fled the massacre at Byre Tor. They may be much in need as well. What is to be done?","'What do ya want? I thought ye only spoke with the nobility of the cave!'","Isolation Amongst Survivors"},
[7685]={"Artar Ildarthos asks you to break the Ordâkhai fortifications at Ghât Lor.","Destroy fortifications at Ghât Lor. Ghât Lor can be found to the east of Vartúlin.","Destroyed fortifications at Ghât Lor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy fortifications at Ghât Lor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We Kintai have a saying, outsider. \\qWhen the tree resists the wind, it is the wood that cracks, never the wind.\\q We all must be in balance with nature, never resisting its flow. These southern Men - these Men of Ordâkh - they are always out of balance, destroying the natural way of things. They have built great fortifications at Ghât Lor, further destroying our forests and sometimes even using the husks of our sacred Veróthi to protect themselves.\
\
'Break their fortifications, destroy this blasphemy against nature and the Kintai. It will weaken them, and may make them think twice before they again twist nature to their corrupted will. We Kintai know that when the tree resists the wind, it is the wood that cracks. It is past time these Men of Ordâkh learn the same.'","'The wood has broken and so, hopefully, has the spirit of the southern Men. It is a severe lesson, but one the Ordakhai must learn, sooner or later. My thanks for your efforts, ${PLAYER}. You are like the wind, guiding the natural way of things.'","Return to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin.","It Is the Wood That Cracks","Return to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin"},
[7686]={"'You rescued my satchel from the spiders? Thank you, friend. Can you set it down on that small table over there?'","It's Always Spiders","Place Usham's satchel down on the table outside the inn","Usham is not happy.","'Keep it? Are you mad? I do not want it anymore! Take it outside the city and leave it there!'","'Can you set my satchel down on that small table over there?'","Defeat spiders east of the city (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Your friend is gone. He said he was going to sign up with one of the caravans and go with them to a land far from here, where spiders will no longer menace him.'\
\
She grins at you.\
\
'He left before I could tell him about any of the great beasts that I have heard live in and beyond the vast deserts... much worse than any of the spiders you find around here! Oh well. He will see.\
\
'Good day to you.'","'Far to the east of the city I ran afoul of... afoul of...'\
\
Usham shudders.\
\
'Do I have to say it? Spiders! Terrible things! In my haste to escape, I left my satchel behind. Will you go back there and retrieve it for me? And perhaps you will defeat some of the creatures that frightened me so?'","Now that you have done as he asked, you should return to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn.","Collect Usham's satchel where he dropped it east of the city","You pick up Usham's satchel and resolve to return it to him outside the Dampstone Inn","Usham is outside the Dampstone Inn.","Maisha has called for your attention outside the Dampstone Inn.","As you go to set it down, a sneaky spider leaps from the satchel!","Defeated spiders east of the city (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Usham no longer wants his satchel, and has asked you to leave it outside the city. Just to the north-east of the Dampstone Inn should be far enough.","Talk to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn","You set down the satchel. Honestly, you cannot really blame Usham for this","Talk to Maisha outside the Dampstone Inn","Return to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn","'There... there was a spider hiding in my satchel? It must have hitched a ride when I was travelling toward the city, and thought to surprise me when I least expected it! These creatures will stop at nothing to terrify me! I am lucky that I dropped the satchel when I did! Why did I ever send you to bring it back to me?'\
\
You ask Usham what he would like done with his satchel now. He gazes at you in horror.\
\
'Keep it? Are you mad? I do not want it anymore! Take it outside the city and leave it there!'","You triumphed over the sneaky spider. That was a close one!","Bring the satchel to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn","Usham is gone, but a woman standing nearby calls for your attention","Usham was frightened by spiders outside the city and has asked for your help.","'In my haste to escape, I left my satchel behind. Will you go back there and retrieve it for me? And perhaps you will defeat some of the creatures that frightened me so?'","Usham asked you to set his satchel down on the table outside the inn.","Leave Usham's satchel in the wild north-east of the Dampstone Inn","Usham ran afoul of spiders to the east of the city, and he asked for your help recovering the satchel he dropped here when he fled."},
[7687]={"'¿Qué tenemos aquí? ¿Alguna clase de moneda? No parece gran cosa... ¿y esto? ¿Unas puertas grabadas en el reverso? ¡Vaya moneda tan peculiar me has traído!\
\
'Supongo que vale algo, aunque seguramente no mucho. Quizá el Conservador Colazorro quiera exhibirla en la Casa de los Mathoms.\
\
'Sí, eso estaría bien. Toma, elige algo que consideres apropiado para una moneda como esta.'","'¿Hmm? ¿Necesitas algo?'","'¡Cebadilla Mantecona, a tu servicio, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! ¡Vaya moneda tan extraña tienes ahí! Parece alguna clase de moneda enana... he visto unas pocas en manos de huéspedes, eso sí, ¡pero ninguna como esta! ¡Ni siquiera estoy seguro de qué metal es!\
\
'Bueno, no creo que pague una comida o una habitación, pero probablemente tenga valor para alguien... aunque sea como tema de conversación.\
\
'Te propongo un intercambio. Tengo varias cosas que viajeros han dejado olvidadas. Puedes cambiar esa moneda por una de ellas. ¿Qué te parece?'","Moneda de Ithildín","'¡No puedo creerlo! ¡Es una moneda de ithildín! Se dice que muchas se acuñaron para conmemorar la amistad entre los Elfos de Acebeda y los Enanos de Khazad-dûm. La mayoría se perdió... ¿dónde encontraste semejante tesoro?\
\
'Por favor, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, intercambia esta moneda conmigo. Tengo muchas cosas que ofrecer a cambio. ¡Elige lo que consideres apropiado!'","Lleva tu moneda de ithildín a una de las siguientes personas para recibir una recompensa.\
\
• Jon Helecharroyo en Archet\
• Dwalin en la Mansión de Thorin\
• El alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande\
• Cebadilla Mantecona en Bree\
• Cardavor en Celondim","'¿Una moneda enana de algún tipo, no es así? He oído hablar de ellas, pero nunca pensé ver una. ¿Dónde la encontraste?\
\
'Estaría encantado de darte algo a cambio. Elige lo que quieras, y concluiremos nuestro intercambio.'","'¿Hmm? ¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?'","'Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Veo que has encontrado una moneda de ithildín. Estas monedas fueron acuñadas por los Enanos de Moria en los días de su amistad con los Elfos de Eregion. Mira aquí: está grabada la Puerta de Durin, que también estaba incrustada con este mismo metal.\
\
'La mayoría de estas monedas se perdió cuando Moria cayó en la oscuridad. Si no te molesta, me gustaría conservar esta moneda. Puede servir como un recordatorio, en estos tiempos oscuros, de la camaradería que existió entre elfos y enanos.\
\
'Pero no te dejaré marchar con las manos vacías. Elige algo que consideres adecuado, y haremos nuestro intercambio.'","'Saludos. ¿Necesitas algo?'","'Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¿Necesitas algo?'","'Hola, ¿puedo ayudarte con algo?'","Has encontrado una misteriosa moneda incrustada de ithildín. Este metal raro fue forjado por los Elfos a partir de mithril hace mucho tiempo. En una cara aparece grabada la imagen de las Puertas de Durin, que guardaban la Puerta Oeste de Moria, mientras que la otra cara muestra un martillo y un yunque, los signos de Durin.","No tienes seguridad de dónde proviene esta moneda, pero parece ser una reliquia de Khazad-dûm, llamada Moria por los Elfos. Muchas personas estarían interesadas en una reliquia así y seguramente te ofrecerían una gran recompensa por ella.\
\
