[7693]={"'Se rumorea que los hombres demacrados son criaturas de gran poder, retorcidas por Morgoth en la Primera Edad... tuviste suerte de sobrevivir contra Ivar.'","Recoge el yelmo de Ivar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ivar Manosangrienta","'¡Bien hecho al derrotar a Ivar Manosangrienta!'","Yelmo de Ivar recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Radagast conoce el antiguo mal del Señor demacrado Ivar, apodado Manosangrienta, que está levantando un ejército de tumularios en Agamaur.","'Si los rumores son ciertos, puede que Angmar se esté preparando para atacar Eriador. Debes darte prisa.'","Entrega el yelmo de Ivar a Radagast, en el campamento de los Eglain","'¿Qué es esto, ${PLAYER}? ¿El yelmo de Ivar Manosangrienta? He esperado este día durante mucho tiempo.\
\
'En la antigüedad, Morgoth corrompió a los hombres esclavizados e infundió en ellos espíritus caídos. Estos se convirtieron en los hombres demacrados, pero entre ellos eligió a cinco que portarían un poder inimaginable en burla de los magos.\
\
'Ivar fue, de hecho, creado en burla de mí, y su muerte sirve como justicia para los de mi clase. Te has ganado bien esta recompensa, ${PLAYER}.'","'Has hecho un nombre por ti mismo, ${PLAYER}. Incluso aquí ha llegado la noticia de tus hazañas. De hecho, estoy sorprendido por todo lo que has logrado. Aun así, tal vez puedas ayudarme de nuevo.\
\
'Sé qué fue lo que comenzó la plaga en Agamaur, el Pantano Rojo. Un Señor demacrado, una criatura terrible al servicio de Angmar, ha levantado un ejército de tumularios aquí y ha despertado este mal antiguo, no los Eglain. Debo pedirte que intervengas en mi nombre, porque yo no puedo. ¿Irás en mi lugar?\
\
'Al este están las ruinas llamadas Garth Agarwen. Buscaría allí a Ivar Manosangrienta. Si lo encuentras y lo derrotas, tráeme su yelmo como prueba.'","Ivar puede encontrarse en Garth Agarwen, en Agamaur, dentro de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Radagast no puede interferir directamente en la guerra buscando y destruyendo a Ivar Manosangrienta. Te ha pedido que vayas en su lugar y que le traigas el yelmo de Ivar como prueba de tu victoria."},
[7695]={"Complete 'The Crows of Iáphel'","Iáphel Errands","Talk to Miruhir","Miruhir has many tasks that need doing in and around his vineyard.","Complete 'Vineyard Pests'","Miruhir has asked you to help with many tasks around the vineyard.\
\
Complete quests in and around Iáphel.","Complete 'A Delivery for the Cooper'","Complete 'Fence Repair'","'If you have come to purchase wine, I am afraid most of it is spoken for. Merchants from Minas Tirith have bought up my entire existing stock and almost all the product of the coming harvest. How much wine can one city drink?\
\
'What I can offer you is work. There is plenty to do and not enough hands for the doing.'","You have completed all the tasks that Miruhir gave you.\
\
Speak with him in Iáphel.","You have completed all the tasks that Miruhir has set before you. He looks so happy he could hug you. He doesn't because you are sweaty, he is sweaty, and despite his gratitude he doesn't know you that well.\
\
'What a gift you have for odd jobs! Could I convince you to stay on? Even for another day or so? Ah, you have other places to be. I understand.'\
\
He tries not to look too disappointed but he is a forthright man who wears his heart upon his sleeve."},
[7696]={"Miruhir wishes to send some wine to his friend, Derva.","Miruhir has asked you to deliver wine to his friend, Derva, at the farm to the north.\
\
Deliver wine to Derva.","Talk to Derva","'If you plan to venture north in the near future, might I ask you to bring a bottle of wine to my friend, Derva? We often make time to visit each other, but work at the winery is hungry for my time.\
\
'Please give it to her with my apologies.'","Iáphel's Wine Delivery Service","'Oho! I was beginning to wonder when Miruhir would come calling. He's busy at the vineyard you say? I wish I could say that's surprising but that man is in love with his work. That's alright. He'll make time for me sooner than later. He never makes me wait too long.'"},
[7697]={"Jackals can be found to the TBD of TBD.\
\
TBD Dog Lover, a concerned citizen in Jirush, has asked you to thin the number of jackals around TBD.","TBD Dog Lover can be found to the TBD of Jirush.\
\
Return to TBD Dog Lover.","Jackal Begone","'Were you not set upon by wild dogs upon your journey to Jirush, traveller? These desert hounds have grown bold of late. Many a would-be visitor has found himself beset by jackals. If these fierce scavengers pose no threat to you, I would thank you for your aid in making these roads safe from the beasts.'","'I have heard jackals continue to harass vulnerable travellers in the TBD wastes, friend. The Khûd would benefit from your assistance in teaching these dogs to think twice about their next meal.'","Derrota a los chacales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to TBD Dog Lover","Chacales derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","TBD Dog Lover, a concerned citizen of TBD, is worried about the jackal attacks assaulting travellers to Jirush. She especially seems concerned about her own faithful hound's safety.","'I cannot recall the last I went for a stroll with my faithful companion here without fear of encountering a less-friendly hound! Thank you, brave adventurer. The sole dog I need see in the Khûd is this one beside me.'"},
[7698]={"Mourn Jajax's fallen allies","Speak with Jajax","Say farewell to Jajax","Summon and defeat Hebil","Jajax's Revenge","'I thank you for that, ${PLAYER}. You are a worthy ${RACE}, worthy even of being a Corsair. There is honour in how you choose to live your life.\
\
'Now I must mourn for my poor men. A moment of silence, if you please.'","You have mourned Jajax's fallen allies","You have defeated Hebil, avenging the murdered Corsairs loyal to Jajax","The site of the massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>mourn</rgb> Jajax's men at the site of the massacre.","Hebil's banner is at the massacre site in southern Lamedon.\
\
You should use the battle-horn on the banner to call Hebil to battle.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","Jajax stands at the site of the Corsairs' massacre, in southern Lamedon.\
\
You should say farewell to Jajax.","Hebil has punished Jajax for allying himself with you in the most horrible way Jajax could ever imagine.","Jajax is at the site of Hebil's massacre.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","'Here we are, as you see. Look at them! They did not deserve such a death for their loyalty to me. Hebil will pay, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Here is his banner. He waits for my summons.'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. You have more honour than any Corsair I have ever met, and the spirit of a fine warrior.\
\
'Be wary when you travel further, friend, especially in Belfalas. If Hebil spoke true, there are three other captains who will seek to hunt us down for treason. That is, if I do not hunt them first! I will bury my men, and then I will go to Belfalas. Perhaps I will see you there, eh?'"},
[7704]={"Andûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. You defeated some of them to thin their numbers and renew their fear of people. You should return to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn.","Jázgai defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Andûmu","'It is not unusual for jázgai to come skulking around our tents at night. The smell of our food must draw them to us. I fear it is only a matter of time before those scavengers become brave or desperate enough to attack someone. Once, they feared people, but they seem to be getting a little too comfortable with us.\
\
'Do you think you would be able to thin their numbers before they try to steal our supplies, or worse yet, hurt somebody? It would do us much good if they feared us once more. Their den is on a hill south of here called Spoiler's Crag.'","'You have taken care of the jázgai, ${PLAYER}? That is wonderful news. Many people will sleep better at night, myself included. Thank you!'","Andûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. He has asked you to go to their den atop a hill south of Gadim-ûn called Spoiler's Crag and renew their fear of people.","Defeat jázgai at Spoiler's Crag (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jealous Neighbours","A pack of jázgai have been less afraid of the people at Gadim-ûn of late, and have come close to venturing into the camp."},
[7705]={"Craft a jewelled coin for the refugees of Wildermore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah! This will help fill the pockets of the poor. Excellent handiwork, ${PLAYER}; I thank you for this donation.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","A skilled jeweller such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by crafting a jewelled coin for them.","'Many people are destitute after the destruction of Núrzum came to Wildermore. As a jeweller, do you think you could craft something valuable to donate to them, for the people to spend on necessities when in a pinch?\
\
'Any contribution you could make would be helpful to these folk. Many have nothing at all since the invasion.'","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted a jewelled coin, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.","Jeweller: Jewelled Coin","Crafted a jewelled coin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hildelith has given you a recipe for a jewelled coin.\
\
You should craft a jewelled coin for the impoverished refugees at Forlaw.","Deliver the jewelled coin to Hildelith"},
[7706]={"Recupera piezas de joyería de los gusanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Estas son extraordinarias. Necesitarán algo de limpieza y pulido, pero la mano de obra es exquisita. Pueden enseñarnos mucho sobre cómo colocar detalles intrincados en anillos y pendientes.'","Joyas de Evendim","Piezas de joyería recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los gusanos se pueden encontrar en el Barandalf, al sur del Coloso.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que busques piezas de joyería en los gusanos del Barandalf.","'Las joyas que has encontrado podrían haber pertenecido a una de las familias reales.'","Cavando en las dunas, los gusanos podrían haber devorado otras piezas de joyería antigua.","Lleva las joyas a Herthdúr","Herthdúr está en el Coloso, al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Herthdúr estará ansioso por ver las antiguas joyas que has recuperado de las arenas.","'He examinado el anillo que has encontrado, y sin duda es del viejo reino. Debió haber caído por la borda de un barco que lo transportaba. La marea lo llevó lentamente a la orilla donde quedó enterrado en las dunas, olvidado hasta que un gusano lo devoró accidentalmente.\
\
'Muchos barcos viajaban por estas aguas, y muchas tormentas los azotaban o los destrozaban, particularmente a lo largo de este tramo de agua. Me pregunto cuántas otras piezas de joyería cayeron por la borda y terminaron en las arenas.\
\
'Hay una forma de saberlo. Regresa al lugar donde encontraste esta pieza y busca en los gusanos otras piezas de joyería. Si alguno de ellos se tragó una, es probable que otros también lo hayan hecho. Vuelve conmigo y tráeme todo lo que encuentres.'"},
[7707]={"Encuntra a un montaraz en el campamento del Coloso para hablarle sobre el anillo que has encontrado","Joyas reptantes","Has encontrado un antiguo y opaco anillo entre los restos de un gusano. Un Montaraz del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en verlo.","El campamento del Coloso está al norte del Barandalf.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces del campamento del Coloso podría estar interesado en ver el anillo que has encontrado.","El anillo es opaco, y el diseño parece antiguo. No puedes discernir nada más sobre él. Deberías mostrárselo a uno de los Montaraces del campamento del Coloso.","'¿Dices que encontraste esto dentro de un gusano? Me pregunto cómo llegó allí...'"},
[7708]={"'Podemos usar más Fronteros. Si quieres ayudar, habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Se le puede encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'No te conozco. Si fueras ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}, tal vez la gente de por aquí te recibiría mejor. Deberías ir a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande.'","'¡Oh! ¿Quieres convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}? He oído que necesitan más gente. ¡Quizás deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande! Bodo no suele ir muy lejos del Agujero Municipal.'","'¡Hola! ¿Has oído que los Fronteros están expandiéndose? ¡No solo sus cinturones, por cierto! Deberías ir a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande si estás ${PLAYERNAME:interesado[m]|interesada[f]}. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Oh, ¡malditos osos! ¿Qué? Oh, bueno... si quieres ayudar por aquí, deberías convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}. ¡Seguro que necesitamos más de ellos! Deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande si quieres unirte. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Bueno, no te conozco, pero sé que no eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}. Quizás deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en sus oficinas cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande.'","'Hay muchos problemas por aquí para que un Frontero los resuelva, pero no para algún extraño que no conozco. Si quieres ayudar, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Hay muchos extraños por estos días. ¡Necesitamos más Fronteros! Si quieres ayudar, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Normalmente se le puede encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¡Vaya, hola! Debo decir que hemos estado recibiendo más que nuestra parte de extraños por este pueblo, enanos y otros tipos raros. La mayoría de la gente será lo suficientemente educada, si te mantienes al margen.\
\
'Sin embargo, supongo que si hablas con el Segundo Oficial Bonce -- él es el capitán de la Guardia -- y él te hace ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}, podrías encontrar una mejor bienvenida. Sí, sí, eso lo haría. El Oficial se puede encontrar en algún lugar de Cavada Grande.\
\
'¡Buen día para ti!'","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a la Guardia, Frontero !'","'Necesitamos más Fronteros, sí. Deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¡Creo que pareces material de Frontero! Deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce sobre un trabajo. Probablemente lo encontrarás cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Quién eres, de todos modos? No recuerdo tu cara. Quizás deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. He oído que está buscando más Fronteros, y pareces que podrías ser bueno en ese trabajo. Bonce se puede encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'No te conozco, y no confío en la gente que no conozco. Si fueras ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}, tal vez te daría un poco más de tiempo. ¿Quieres ser ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}? Habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Realmente necesitamos la ayuda, amigo. ¡Gracias!'","'Quizás deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. ¡He oído que está contratando nuevos Fronteros! Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'He oído que el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande necesita nuevos Fronteros. ¡Quizás deberías ir allí a hablar con él! Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Hola, ${PLAYERNAME:extraño[m]|extraña[f]}. Si quieres ayudar por la Comarca, deberías convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}. Ve a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande si estás ${PLAYERNAME:interesado[m]|interesada[f]}. Normalmente lo puedes encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Deberías ir a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. He oído que necesita algunos nuevos Fronteros. Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Bueno, Frontero ${PLAYER}, ¡estoy seguro de que habrá mucho trabajo para ti!'","'Lo siento, no puedo conceder una audiencia a cualquier extraño. Debo admitir que tienes un aspecto favorable, así que podrías ser ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} en la Comarca. Sin embargo, quiero dejar esa decisión en manos del Segundo Oficial, Bodo Bonce. De hecho, podría permitirte convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]} de la Guardia, aunque eso sería muy inusual.\
\
'El Oficial Bonce se puede encontrar en Cavada Grande al oeste. Te recomiendo que hables con él lo antes posible.\
\
'Adiós.'","'¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un extraño[m]|una extraña[f]} por aquí? Debes serlo. Toma mi consejo y únete a los Fronteros. Ve a Cavada Grande y habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce, ¿por qué no? Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:interesado[m]|interesada[f]} en ayudar por aquí como Frontero, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Quién eres? No te conozco. Deberías unirte a los Fronteros primero si quieres ayudar por la Comarca. Habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande si estás ${PLAYERNAME:interesado[m]|interesada[f]}. Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Entonces, ¿el tío Bodo te ha hecho ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}? ¡Maravilloso!'","'Si quieres ayudarnos a los hobbits de la Comarca, tendrás que unirte a los Fronteros. Deberías ir a Cavada Grande y hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Seguro que estará cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Se dice que eres alguien que ayuda a los necesitados. Bueno, si quieres ayudarnos a los hobbits de la Comarca, tendrás que unirte a los Fronteros. La mayoría de los hobbits son lo suficientemente amigables, pero sospechan de los extraños. Como ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}, te confiarán. Al menos un poco, de todos modos.\
\
'Si quieres unirte a la Guardia como ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}, tendrás que hablar con el Segundo Oficial. Él es el único que puede inscribirte. Lo encontrarás en Cavada Grande, cerca del Agujero Municipal.\
\
'El Segundo Oficial Bonce es respetado por la mayoría de la gente, así que si él dice que eres una buena persona, te escucharán.'","'¿Eh? ¿Quién eres? No quiero extraños merodeando por mi puerta. ¡No soy el viejo Loco Bolsón buscando una aventura! Si quieres andar por aquí, molestando a la gente, tendrás que obtener permiso del Segundo Oficial Bonce.\
\
'Él es el Capitán de la Guardia cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande, al oeste de aquí. Incluso podría tener un uso para ti como Frontero.\
\
'¡Ahora lárgate!'","'Las cosas no están bien por aquí estos días. Tal vez conseguir más Fronteros ayudaría. Si no tienes nada mejor que hacer, quizás deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Estará cerca del Agujero Municipal, como es probable.'","'He oído que el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande necesita gente para inscribirse como Fronteros. ¿Quizás deberías ir a hablar con él? Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Quién es este? No tengo tiempo para tratar con algún extraño que camina por aquí y perturba la paz. ¡Ya tengo suficientes problemas con esas malditas arañas!\
\
'Habla con el Segundo Oficial Bonce en Cavada Grande; él es el capitán de la Guardia. A menudo busca Fronteros para ayudar a mantener la paz. Si se siente cómodo confiando en ti, entonces tal vez tenga algo de trabajo para ti.\
\
'¡Pero por ahora, lárgate!'","'Deberías ir a ver al Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. ¡He oído que está contratando Fronteros como loco! Podrías encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Quizás deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Oficial Bodo Bonce. He oído que necesita más Fronteros con urgencia. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Con toda la gente rara que pasa por la Comarca, ¡definitivamente necesitábamos más Fronteros!'","'Podemos usar algo de ayuda por aquí, pero no de extraños. Si quieres ayudar por la Comarca, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande sobre convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}. Normalmente lo puedes encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'No, no te conozco. Pensé que sí, pero no. ¡Oye! Quizás deberías ir a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. He oído que está tratando de contratar más Fronteros, y tal vez tú sirvas para ese trabajo. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Eh, ¿qué estás haciendo por aquí? ¡La gente extraña no es muy bienvenida en Hobbiton! Supongo que no harás ningún daño, sin embargo. Tienes un aspecto más amigable que algunos otros que he visto. Supongo que podrías quedarte, pero tendrás que hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bonce sobre eso.\
\
'Bonce es casi el capitán de los Fronteros, aunque el viejo Pastelón podría decirte lo contrario. Lo encontrarás cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. Eso está al oeste de aquí.\
\
'Ahora, tengo trabajo que hacer. ¡Los jardines no se cuidan solos, sabes!'","'Si quieres ayudar en la Comarca, ¡deberías convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}! Habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en sus oficinas cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande.'","'¿Así que te enviaron a mí, eh? Por supuesto, normalmente solo aceptamos hobbits -- gente de la Comarca, entiendes -- pero estos no son tiempos normales, me temo, y podemos usar a cualquier hob... eh, cualquier persona de buena voluntad que podamos encontrar.\
\
'Ayuda a tantos hobbits de la Comarca como puedas, y ascenderás en las filas. ¡Todos los que quieran proteger al pueblo de la Comarca son bienvenidos! Somos un pueblo pacífico, y nuestras preocupaciones pueden parecer de poca importancia para otros -- la entrega del correo, la degustación de buenos alimentos, el encendido de fuegos artificiales -- pero no te dejes engañar. Nuestras formas pacíficas están amenazadas, y el peligro puede encontrarse en los lugares más insospechados.\
\
'Ayuda a los hobbits con sus preocupaciones diarias, pero si viajas a aldeas más distantes, como Ojo de Aguja, Sobrecolina o Tejonera... lleva contigo un arma, ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}. La vida es peligrosa en las fronteras de la Comarca, y cuanto más te alejas de Cavada Grande y Hobbiton, más probable es que encuentres problemas.'","'Creo que deberías ir a hablar con Bodo Bonce, el Segundo Oficial en Cavada Grande. He oído que necesita gente para inscribirse como Fronteros, y pareces que podrías hacer el trabajo. Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Si quieres viajar libremente por la Comarca, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial, Bodo Bonce. Verás, la gente aquí en la Comarca no es muy amigable con los extraños. Últimamente ha habido mucha gente rara vagando por aquí. Ahora bien, si Bonce te deja unirte a los Fronteros, ¡apostaría que encontrarías una bienvenida más cálida!\
\
'Puedes encontrar a Bonce cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. Eso está un poco al oeste de aquí.\
\
'Buena suerte, extraño.'","'He oído que los Fronteros necesitan más gente. Podrías querer hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande.'","'¿Quién es este ahora? No puedo ser molestado por algún extraño. Si estás buscando trabajo de la gente de por aquí, habla con el Segundo Oficial Bonce allá. Él me ayuda con la Guardia, asegurándose de que los Fronteros hagan sus rondas, manteniendo alejados a los indeseables y cosas así.\
\
'Ahora, no pareces una mala persona, así que supongo que podría dejarte unirte a la Guardia como ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}.'","Únete a los Fronteros","'Bueno, nunca. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un extraño[m]|una extraña[f]}, ¿verdad? Si quieres pasar por la Comarca, deberías unirte a los Fronteros. Ve rápido a Cavada Grande y habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Lo encontrarás cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","El Segundo Oficial Bonce se puede encontrar fuera del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. El Agujero Municipal está en un recinto amurallado en el lado norte de la ciudad.\
\
Deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial de la Guardia de la Comarca, Bodo Bonce, en Cavada Grande, si deseas unirte a los Fronteros.","'Si estás buscando al Segundo Oficial Bonce, lo encontrarás en Cavada Grande.'","'¡Dios mío, ${PLAYERNAME:otro extraño[m]|otra extraña[f]}! ¿Quieres convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]} también? Deberías ir a Cavada Grande para hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Normalmente puedes encontrarlo por el Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Has oído hablar de los Fronteros? Están contratando a mucha gente nueva. ¿Quizás deberías unirte? Si quieres, ve a Cavada Grande y habla con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Qué? ¿Quién eres, de nuevo? Oh, oh, ya veo. Podrías ir a Cavada Grande y hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce. He oído que está contratando a muchos nuevos Fronteros. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¡Tú ahí, sal de mi tierra! ¡Ya he tenido suficientes problemas con extraños vagando por mi tierra sin siquiera un '¡Hola!'\
\
'Si tienes un problema, ve a ver a Bodo Bonce, el Segundo Oficial en Cavada Grande. Lo encontrarás cerca del Agujero Municipal.\
\
'¡Ahora lárgate!'","'Si aún quieres ayudar a la Comarca, necesitarás convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}, y solo el Segundo Oficial Bonce en Cavada Grande puede concederte eso.'","'¡Ouch! Mi tobillo. No, no, no puedes ayudarme ahora mismo. Si quieres hacerme un favor, ve al Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en sus oficinas cerca del Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. He oído que podría necesitar más Fronteros.'","'Oh cielos, ${PLAYERNAME:otro extraño[m]|otra extraña[f]}. Deberías ir a ver al Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Hola. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:nuevo[m]|nueva[f]} por aquí, ¿verdad? Quizás deberías unirte a los Fronteros si vas a quedarte un tiempo. He oído que el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande está buscando más gente. Puedes encontrarlo cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'El Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande ha hecho un llamado para más Fronteros. Me parece que deberías ir allí y unirte. La Oficina de vigilancia por allí está cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'¿Has oído que los Fronteros están buscando gente nueva? Quizás deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce sobre el trabajo. Sus oficinas están cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'He oído que el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce está contratando a cualquiera como Frontero. ¡Hobbits, Gente Grande, cualquiera! Deberías ir a Cavada Grande a hablar con él sobre eso. Normalmente lo puedes encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","Para que puedas ayudar a los Hobbits de la Comarca, necesitarás unirte a los Fronteros de la Guardia.","'¿Qué estarías haciendo por aquí? Debo admitir, sin embargo, que tienes un aspecto amigable, así que probablemente no harás ningún daño. Aun así, la gente por aquí será desconfiada contigo, a menos que hables con el Segundo Oficial Bonce. Él es el capitán de la Guardia. Si estás buscando trabajo, incluso podría dejarte unirte a los Fronteros.\
\
'El Segundo Oficial Bonce tiene sus oficinas en el Agujero Municipal en Cavada Grande. Eso está en el Cuaderna del Oeste.\
\
'Si te unes a los Fronteros, la gente probablemente no será tan desconfiada contigo. Incluso podrían pedirte ayuda con algunas cosas. Y créeme, ¡eso te mantendrá más ocupado de lo que te gustaría!'","'No te conozco, aunque he oído tu nombre. Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:interesado[m]|interesada[f]} en ayudar por aquí, deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. Normalmente se le puede encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Bueno, mira tú. ¿Quieres ayudar por la Comarca? Deberías ir a Cavada Grande y hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce, para que puedas convertirte en ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}. Se puede encontrar cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Mi tío, el Segundo Oficial Bonce, podría usar tu ayuda, si aún estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]}. Puedes encontrarlo en Cavada Grande.'","'¿Entonces eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]} ahora? ¡Eso es bueno!'","'¡Bolgovado necesita más Fronteros! Deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande sobre inscribirte para el trabajo. Puedes encontrar a Bonce cerca del Agujero Municipal.'","'Hola, ¿qué hace alguien como tú por Hobbiton? Oh bueno, no pareces de los que hacen mucho daño, ¿verdad?\
\
'Aun así, la mayoría de la gente no tendrá nada que ver contigo, no a menos que hables con el Segundo Oficial Bonce en Cavada Grande. Él está a cargo de la Guardia. De hecho, podría dejarte unirte como Frontero, aunque eso sería raro.\
\
'Como Frontero, sin embargo, la mayoría de la gente no será tan sospechosa de ti.'","'¿Quieres ayudar en la Comarca? Deberías hablar con el Segundo Oficial Bodo Bonce en Cavada Grande. He oído que necesita nuevos Fronteros para inscribirse de inmediato. Puedes encontrarlo en sus oficinas cerca del Agujero Municipal.'"},
[7709]={"'I am impressed, duvodiad. It takes great courage to face those vile creatures.\
\
'Soon, we will be able to return to the mine, and our families will remain safe. My thanks to you.'","Defeated bugan in the mine (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat bugan in the mine (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'So Gwilum sent you to help? That is good, for we need many strong arms.\
\
'Bugan have infested our mine, and we were fortunate to escape with as few casualties as we did. If you wish to help, duvodiad, enter the mine and kill the bugan.\
\
'Will you do this? Destroy the bugan and their chieftain! If we cannot work the mine, I fear the Brenin will punish our families.'","The Barnavon Mine has been infested by bugan, who have driven forth the Boar-clan miners.","Bugan can be found within the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Argel has asked you to enter the Barnavon Mine and defeat many of the bugan which drove them out.","Joining the Battle","Talk to Argel at the mine","Defeated bugan chieftain","Defeat bugan chieftain","Argel is at the camp outside the Barnavon Mine.\
\
You should return to Argel with news of your deeds."},
[7711]={"Skarding Wargsbane can be found on the battlefield.\
\
You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","The ground shakes as the beast approaches!","Azhatarg has been defeated!","Search Howlers' Notch for Azhatar","Examine where the trail of destruction ends","Examine the destruction","Defeat Azhatarg","Howlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should search Howlers' Notch with Skarding by your side.","Skarding Wargsbane can be found at Shakal-atrâd.\
\
You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","Examine the trail of destruction","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane.","No sign of Azhatar here, but it looks like there was recent conflict","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane at Shakal-atrâd","This is very much broken","This Orc was mauled by a great force","'Call me to your side when you wish to begin the hunt.'","This has been recently broken","Talk to Skarding Wargsbane","Skarding Wargsbane, the great Beorning hunter, tracks a deadly beast upon the battlefield.","Joining the Hunt","This dwarf was mauled, just as the Orc you saw","'The hunt was a success, as I knew it would be. The kill of Azhatarg is our reward! It has been a day well spent. Come let us return to Shakal-atrâd.'","Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated","'Rest well, for the war carries on. There may be other hunts upon the battlefield before the war's end. Good hunting, ${PLAYER}.'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, have you come to join me on a hunt? There's a beast upon the battlefield. They call the beast Azhatar. That is the beast I seek.'","Examine the dead dwarf","Howlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade.\
\
Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.","Continue following the trail"},
[7712]={"As you began to speak with the guard, Mêshaget and Khagâmi arrived behind you. You should talk to Mêshaget.","'Stop there, who are you? You are no merchant. What is your business?'\
\
Before you can answer, the guard speaks to someone behind you.\
\
'Mêshaget! Back so soon? We expected you to be gone for quite a while!'","'${PLAYER}, when you are ready to leave this place, you and Khagâmi are invited to visit Jiret-menêsh! It is unlikely that you will be allowed inside the mountain, but many of us have been enjoying the fresh air outdoors, and there is still much to see and do above ground. It is to the west, atop a mountain Men of the past once called \\qThe Sheenwall\\q.\
\
'If you do not mind, I would like to walk with Khagâmi to discuss trade and politics. You may travel on ahead, and we will follow behind you.'","Ir a Jiret-menêsh","Journey to Jiret-menêsh","Talk to the guard","A guard is asking you to stop","'A slight change of plans! These are my new friends, Khagâmi and ${PLAYER}. Khagâmi is from Zajâna and represents one of their top officials, making my trip unnecessary. On my honour, they are not Ordâkhai spies.'\
\
The guard chuckles and waves you through.","Jiret-menêsh is located in north-western An Shêru, atop a mountain peak.","As you approached the entrance to Jiret-menêsh, a guard asked you to stop. You should talk to her.","Talk to Mêshaget","Mêshaget has invited you to visit his home, Jiret-menêsh."},
[7713]={"Bring the jam to Gírta","Now is the time to <rgb=#00FF00>dance</rgb> and crush the grapes","Joyous Jam","Tienes una tanda de uvas recién pisadas listas para convertirse en mermelada","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should place the grapes that you have collected into the tub.","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should stomp on the grapes.","The wash bucket can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should wash your feet before stomping on grapes.","Now it is time to crush the grapes!","Uvas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The grape tub can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should remove the crushed grapes from the tub.","The next step: give the honey jar a shake or two","Add the crushed grapes to a half-empty honey jar","Crush the grapes by doing a <rgb=#00FF00>dance</rgb> on them","Gírta can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should bring the jam to Gírta.","Place the grapes into the tub at the Beorninghús","Your stamping feet crush the grapes most effectively","A honey jar can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should add the crushed grapes to the jar.","You should shake the jar.","The vineyard can be found west of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should gather some grapes for making jam.","Gírta asked you to make jam from scratch: a difficult task, but one which the Beorning matriarch believes you can accomplish. Perhaps it would be best to begin by picking grapes in the orchard.","Perfectly shaken!","Recoge uvas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This is a splendid jam. You have done well! It will spread well on crusty bread, or perhaps I will add it to a dessert. There are always plenty of possibilities to be found for a tasty jam!'","Recoge las uvas pisadas de la tinaja","Métete en la tinaja","For those visiting the Beorninghús, it is important to help in the daily work of Beornings.","Wash your feet in the wash bucket","Perhaps a good wash would do before the grapes are crushed","Give the jar a good <rgb=#00FF00>shake</rgb>"},
[7714]={"Gárferth and Edsig are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárferth and Edsig.","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","'I will risk your displeasure, my dear father, for the honour of our kin. I must!\
\
'Be safe until I return, all of you!'","'You may think me rash, father, but I will not rest until I have slain this giant Núrzum. Thrymm and my brothers must be avenged!'","Cyneberg recommends caution after seeing what Núrzum was capable of","Speak with Edsig","Judgement Clouded By Grief","'I demand revenge, father! My brother and nephew were slaughtered by this evil foe. Let us ride out, and we will ride him down -- he and his army of Orcs.'","'We ought to discuss what to do, for I cannot let Wildermore fall into the hands of Saruman's servants.\
\
'The giant Núrzum will not be permitted to endure after his crimes, but... I fear my judgement is clouded by grief. I fear that for all of us.\
\
'My sons have lost their brothers, and Cyneberg has lost her father and the man she loved. How can we be rational?'","Gárferth is bent on revenge","'Cyneberg is right. We must not act until we have thought our plan through. We should strive to understand our enemy, should we not?'\
\
'I vow that I will see the giant dead before long, but now is not the time for rash acts.'","Edsig wishes to avenge his fallen brothers and nephews","Speak with Gárwig","'Cursed foolish boys! Those two never heed me. They have too much feeling, and little wisdom.\
\
'I hope they will not be too rash. Thank you for staying by my side, you and dear Cyneberg.'","Hear Edsig's thoughts","Gárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg are in the Mead Hall at Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárferth, Edsig, and Cyneberg to hear what they think should be done about Núrzum.","Gárwig wishes to act to protect his realm, but he knows that his judgement is deeply clouded by the grief of his loss.","Hear Cyneberg's thoughts","'I saw this fearsome creature with my own eyes, Reeve Gárwig. I watched him squash my father like an ant, and swat Thrymm away like a fly.\
\
'I recommend caution, not rashness, though my heart grieves for those who cannot yet be avenged.\
\
'I know your pain and grief, dear Reeve -- I do. Please heed my advice.'","Hear Gárferth's thoughts","Talk to Gárferth","'I am sorry to disobey you, my dear father, but I cannot stand here idly while that monster roams our lands.\
\
'I am sorry!'"},
[7715]={"Derrota orcos en Tharbad y recupera objetos de valor (${NUMBER}/6)","'¡Encontraste algo! ¡Sabía que lo harías!'\
\
Le entregas a Caron la vieja insignia y ella la gira entre sus manos, examinándola de cerca.\
\
'¡Este relieve de metal debió ser la marca de un gremio comercial que operaba desde Tharbad cuando la ciudad estaba en su apogeo! Tendré que contarle a mi hermano Brioc sobre esto cuando llegue a casa. Tiene varios libros que podrían decirme más sobre este gremio, pero se pasa todos los días preocupándose. ¡Es todo un desperdicio, si me lo preguntas!\
\
'¡Gracias por ayudarme, ${PLAYER}!'","Caron está al oeste de Tharbad, en la orilla del río.","'¿Crees posible que los orcos hayan recogido algo valioso de ese período de la historia de Tharbad? Sobre todo llevan suciedad y basura, hasta donde puedo ver, ¡pero escondido entre la inmundicia podría haber un auténtico tesoro! ¡Imagínate!'","Basura de orcos recogida (${NUMBER}/6)","Has recogido una vieja insignia de Tharbad... ¡esto no es basura después de todo!","¿Solo suciedad y baratijas?","Los orcos que merodean por la ciudad inundada de Tharbad podrían haber encontrado objetos de valor.","Caron ha dejado volar su imaginación, y se pregunta si los orcos podrían haber recogido algo de valor entre las ruinas de la ciudad inundada.","Derrota orcos en Tharbad y recupera objetos de valor (5/6)","Lleva la vieja insignia a Caron al oeste de Tharbad","'Tharbad fue una ciudad próspera e importante en su apogeo, pero eso fue hace mucho tiempo. Ahora los orcos acechan en cada rincón, y no tienen respeto por la ciudad que solía ser.\
\
'Aun así, ¿crees posible que los orcos hayan recogido algo valioso de ese período de la historia de Tharbad? Sobre todo llevan suciedad y basura, hasta donde puedo ver, ¡pero escondido entre la inmundicia podría haber un auténtico tesoro! ¡Imagínate!'"},
[7717]={"'One more thing, ${PLAYER}. While you scout the way to Shakhajât, slay any hobgoblins that cross your path. This will keep them from reporting back to their masters in the fortress and also give you a warm-up for the battles to come. This task serves two purposes, and that is even better than one!'","You have defeated many hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should talk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad.","Just a Warm-up","Defeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Scout-master Ausma has asked you to deal with any hobgoblins that cross your path while you complete your initial reconnaissance.","Talk to Scout-master Ausma at Bárgstad","'This is just the beginning, ${PLAYER}. If these are the hobgoblins outside the fort, imagine how many must lurk within!'","Scout-master Ausma has asked you to defeat any hobgoblins you come across while looking for Shakhajât.\
\
You should defeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws."},
[7718]={"Gísling can be found in eastern Snowbourn to the north of the east gate.\
\
You should speak with Gísling now that he has been freed from his imprisonment.","Meet Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn","'Thank you for everything, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Fastred's wrath is a very dangerous thing, but his heart is in the right place. I say this, even with all that I have been through these past few days.\
\
'Let us now deal with Sigeric. Such a fool cannot be allowed to go without punishment.'","Justice Served","Gísling's cell is inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
You should open Gísling's cell and return to him his freedom now that Sigeric has been exposed as a traitor.","Talk to Fastred in the prison of Snowbourn","Fastred has told you to meet him in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Fastred, as he instructed.","Talk to Gísling in Snowbourn","'Before all else, I will right the wrong that was done here.\
\
'Gísling, you are free. For your imprisonment, I am deeply sorry. You will always find Snowbourn a home, and anything you desire will be yours.\
\
'${PLAYER} will let you out of your cell, then we will deal with this wretch.'","The Rohirrim of Snowbourn have captured Sigeric from the croft where you defeated him.","'Sigeric will pay for his actions against Rohan, ${PLAYER}. Of this, you can be certain.\
\
'Let us travel to the prison and speak with him. I will meet you there.'","Gísling looks as if he wishes to say something to Fastred, but he remains silent","Release Gísling from his cell","Fastred is in the prison of Snowbourn, located near the Mead Hall.\
\
Fastred wants you to meet with him so that he can right his recent wrongs."},
[7719]={"'Soy un maestro cervecero. ¿Lo sabías? En estos días casi no tengo tiempo, con toda la gestión de la Asociación Cervecera que debo atender. El reclutamiento es, por supuesto, la máxima prioridad, y también socavar a la Liga de las Posadas... no preparar ni catar cervezas.\
\
'Pero hoy tengo ganas de elaborar algo. Quiero preparar una bebida, una cerveza especial. Quiero que la entregues a mis buenos amigos de la Comarca. Quiero arruinar su festival. Quiero estropearles el día. Quiero que se enfermen.\
\
'Mi cerveza especial es un secreto, y te permitiré conocer su receta pidiéndote que recojas los ingredientes. Sé alguien bueno, ${PLAYER}, y ayúdame con mi plan.'","Gas de pantano recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La Cerveza Especial de Jónar","Jónar, un enano siniestro de la Mansión de Thorin, te ha enviado a una búsqueda para recolectar los ingredientes de su bebida especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Jónar se encuentra en el sótano de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Jónar todos los ingredientes repugnantes que recolectaste durante tu aventura.","Huevo crudo podrido recolectado","'¡Cocó!'\
\
Billina no aprueba tu aspecto siniestro. En su sobresalto, pone un repugnante huevo podrido. ¡Eso fue fácil!","Recolecta gas de pantano en el Pantano de los Juncos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los ingredientes de Jónar pueden encontrarse en los siguientes lugares: el gas de pantano se encuentra en el Pantano de los Juncos. El huevo crudo puede encontrarse en la granja de Arenilla. La baba de babosa viscosa puede encontrarse a lo largo de la orilla del río, cerca de Celondim.\
\
Deberías recolectar gas de pantano, un huevo crudo y baba de babosa para la cerveza especial de Jónar.","Lleva los ingredientes repugnantes a Jónar","Baba recolectada de una babosa viscosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Dámelos.'","'No veo los ingredientes que te pedí. ¿Acaso crees que los tengo yo? Si los tuviera, ¿te los habría pedido? Dime. No, dime. ¿No? Exacto. Ahora ve y haz lo que te pedí.'","Recolecta un huevo crudo podrido en la granja de Arenilla","Recolecta baba de babosas viscosas cerca de Celondim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7720]={"'¡Ja... ja ja! ¡Apestas! Puedo notarlo solo con estar cerca: mi bebida fue un éxito. ¡Ho ho ja ja ja!\
\
'...Aléjate un poco más, por favor.'","Lleva la bebida especial de Jónar al Árbol de la Fiesta","Este sería un buen lugar para destapar la bebida especial de Jónar","La Entrega Especial de Jónar","'Mi bebida ya huele realmente mal. Márchate de inmediato; deberías llevarla a los hobbits. No queda mucho tiempo antes de que esa cosa explote en vapores miserables y repugnantes.'","El Árbol de la Fiesta se encuentra en Hobbiton, en la Comarca.\
\
Deberías activar el horrible brebaje de Jónar alrededor de la concentración de asistentes al festival de la Comarca para arruinarles el día.","Jónar se encuentra en el sótano de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Jónar y contarle todo lo ocurrido.","Regresa con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","Jónar desea que lleves su horrible brebaje a una zona poblada de La Comarca, donde arruinará el día de cualquiera que se encuentre cerca.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Has desatado un hedor terrible","Los vapores del brebaje vil provocaron una explosión","'Ahora ya conoces mi receta secreta: un huevo podrido, cinco frascos de gas de pantano y siete frascos de baba de babosa viscosa. He convertido todo eso en algo magnífico: mi bebida especial.\
\
'Solo te queda una cosa por hacer para dejarme satisfecho. Debes llevar esto a una zona poblada de la Comarca y asegurarte de dispersar los viles vapores que emite. ¡Los efectos serán desastrosos!\
\
'Toma esto, mi esbirre, y llévalo a un lugar donde se sepa que se reúnen los hobbits, especialmente los de la Liga de las Posadas. Debes llevarlo directamente al Árbol de la Fiesta, ¡donde sin duda arruinará el festival para todos!'","Usa la bebida especial de Jónar en quienes asisten al festival de la Comarca","El Árbol de la Fiesta se encuentra en la Comarca, en el pueblo de Hobbiton.\
\
Deberías llevar la bebida especial de Jónar al Árbol de la Fiesta, donde sin duda arruinará el día de muchos hobbits que se han reunido allí."},
[7725]={"'${PLAYER}, I cannot explain what has happened.\
\
'I became certain that Karazgar sought something precious within Caras Tilion, and so it was there I travelled with a small company of scouts and warriors. I led my kin into the heights of our old home, and I was pleased to see it free of the webs that once choked it... but we were not alone. Indeed, evil spirits lingered there, but they did not seem to notice our passing. It was Karazgar and his Men of Mordor that fell upon us, and I rose my blade to attack. However, as Karazgar raised his weapon against me, I felt my mind and vision turn to darkness. It washed over me in what felt like mere moments, but when I awoke, I stood before Felegoth... alone.\
\
'I know what fate must have befallen my kin, but have the Valar themselves spared me? They would not do such a thing! They could not... and nor could she....'\
\
'When Caras Tilion fell, one of the servants of Valar fell with it. She was known to me as Tárasánë, but among my kin, she was the Green Lady. I thought her banished or gone to the Uttermost West, but I cannot bear to return to that place again.\
\
'I ask you to do what I cannot. Go to Caras Tilion and see what became of my kin. If Karazgar remains, he must not be allowed to harm Tárasánë.'","After confronting the Weeping Warrior at Caras Tilion, Thranduil returned to Felegoth with no memory of his encounter with Karazgar.","As you step into the pool of water, a towering figure appears before you...","Search Caras Tilion for signs of the Weeping Warrior","Caras Tilion can be found to the south of Felegoth in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
Unable to remember anything after encountering Karazgar, Thranduil has asked you to seek the Weeping Warrior in Caras Tilion.","As Thranduil feared, the battle consumed Elves and Men alike, but Karazgar fled deeper into Caras Tilion...","'I knew it would be you....'\
\
The Green Lady gazes at you for a long moment and studies your appearance.\
\
'The Elvenking once looked upon me as you now do, but in time, his gaze softened. I spared him the wrath of the one you call Karazgar, but the dooms of his kin could not be prevented. Indeed, I also spared him the memory of looking upon me once more, for I know the hurts it would bring him.\
\
'The one called Karazgar thought to raise his weapon against me, but he is beneath the notice of me and my lord in the Uttermost West. I touched his blighted flesh to heal it, and he recoiled at once as if in agony. He could not overcome me, and so he fled in fear.\
\
'You have come sooner than I foresaw... and so now, you must depart. You shall know when to return.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Of Dreams and Desires'</rgb>","Follow the trail of rust deeper into Caras Tilion","Karazgar's Gambit","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion.\
\
You should follow the trail of rust into Caras Tilion and attempt to learn what has transpired.","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion.\
\
You have found what remains of Thranduil's company and Karazgar's agents in Caras Tilion, but it appears Karazgar escaped this encounter. You should search for him deeper in Caras Tilion.","Talk to the Green Lady","The Green Lady is standing in the centre of Caras Tilion.\
\
You have followed Karazgar's trail to a rust-laden pool in Caras Tilion. The Green Lady that Thranduil described has revealed herself to you. You should attempt to speak to her and learn what has transpired.","The trail of rust leads deeper into Caras Tilion...","You notice a trail of scattered rust leading deeper into Caras Tilion..."},
[7726]={"Minas Agar se alza en el lado oeste de Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gúlaran y derrotar a Karstíona, la emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain, en el interior de Minas Agar.","Los Trév Duvárdain han enviado a un emisario a Agar para tratar con los lacayos de la Corona de Hierro.","'De todas las alianzas que la Corona de Hierro podría haber forjado, esta era la más grave. Si les hubieran dado un apoyo mayor a los Trév Duvárdain, nuestros esfuerzos aquí habrían sido en vano.\
\
'¡Bien hecho!'","'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y los Trév Duvárdain. He estado investigando y he averiguado que Domongart ha enviado a una emisaria para tratar con Angmar.\
\
'Deberías investigar el asunto. Ha habido muchos informes de Montañeses de los Trév Duvárdain cerca de la torre de Minas Agar, junto a Barad Gúlaran. Debemos impedir que se lleve a cabo esta alianza, cueste lo que cueste.\
\
'Derrota a Karstíona, la emisaria, y vuelve a verme cuando lo hayas conseguido. Si deseas entrar en Minas Agar, te sugiero que lleves contigo aliados dignos de confianza.'","Karstíona, emisaria de los Trév Duvárdain","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnír, al norte de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
Tras derrotar a Karstíona, debes volver a ver a Brúnfair y decirle que has tenido éxito.","'Karstíona debe ser derrotada y la alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y los Montañeses destruida.'","Entra en Minas Agar y derrota a Karstíona"},
[7727]={"Consigue el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín","Oculto del Enemigo","No encuentras ningún mapa en este Montaraz.","El Montaraz caído que llevaba el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín está en el algún lugar de los estanques y jardines de Glinghant, más allá de la plaza de Clorhir, en Annúminas.\
\
Harthadril te ha pedido que saques el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín de Glinghant.","El conocimiento puede ser el arma más poderosa en tiempos de guerra, ${PLAYER}. Puede cambiar el rumbo de la batalla, para bien o para mal. Te hablo ahora de un asunto que no admite demora, pues se trata de un conocimiento que podría suponer la perdición de mi pueblo... no aquí en la ciudad, sino en otro lugar de la Tierra Media.\
\
Cuando los aguaoscuras llegaron a Annúminas, algunos de mis hermanos intentaron expulsarlos de los estanques de Glinghant. Podría haberme unido a la batalla, ya que sus estanques y jardines me son muy queridos, peor Fainneleg me ordenó que ayudara en la defensa inicial de Gwaelband. Gwonil y yo luchamos valientemente y rechazamos el asalto Angmarim, pero mientras que nosotros sobrevivimos para recibir otros cometidos, los Dúnedain que lucharon en Glinghant no lo consiguieron. Los aguaoscuras los superaron y los jardines fueron tomados.\
\
Y lo que es aún peor, uno de mis hermanos caídos llevaba encima un mapa al refugio oculto de Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte. Quizá fuera imprudente llevar tal mapa encima, pero lo hecho, hecho está. Debemos recuperar el mapa antes de que caiga en manos del Enemigo. Los aguaoscuras puede que no aprecien su importnacia, pero uno de los sirvientes de Amarthiel más corpóreos sí podría hacerlo. No podemos dejar que caiga en sus manos, ${PLAYER}. Busca a los Montaraces caídos en Glinghant y recupera el mapa con la ruta a Esteldín del que lo llevaba. ¡Apresúrate, ya que no hay tiempo qu eperder! Si no estoy por aquí cuando vuelvas, lleva rápidamente el mapa al capitán general Daerdan, en Echad Garthadir, aquí en la ciudad.","Mapa con la ruta a Estledín recuperado"},
[7728]={"Taskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You took the place of a troll in Angmar while it wrought destruction against the forces of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","Talk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Troll (Cost: 500 Commendations)","'Tu irte. Troll venir.'","'Trolls fight. You die too fast. We strong where you weak.\
\
'You go to troll-home now. Troll come here and fight. We win war. Take all. I send troll home when done.'","Taskmaster Sharkúlob is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The trolls from Angmar, in an effort to speed the victory of Angmar's army, are willing to come to the Ettenmoors to fight the Free Peoples in exchange for your services in the North. You should speak with Taskmaster Sharkûlob.","'Trolls buenos. Tú también eres. ¡Aplastamos, destrozamos y golpeamos! ¡Tárks mueren!'","Los trolls de Angmar tienen un único objetivo: destruir a los enemigos de Angmar.","Keep Slaughtering the Free Peoples","Talk to Taskmaster Sharkúlob at Gramsfoot"},
[7730]={"Entrega las llaves a Oghûk en su celda dentro de la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","'¡Uno de esos carceleros debe tener la llave de mi celda!'","Guardianes y Cautivos","'Quiero salir de esta prisión, ${RACE}. No pertenezco aquí, encerrado. Te ayudaré a expulsar a esos asquerosos orcos si me ayudas.\
\
'Necesito la llave de esta celda. Busca a los carceleros, mátalos y toma sus llaves. Si me liberas, yo te ayudaré.'","El trasgo Oghûk quiere que lo ayudes a escapar de su celda.","Los carceleros trasgos se encuentran en las mazmorras de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Oghûk cree que los carceleros de la prisión de la Ciudad de los Trasgos tienen las llaves de su celda. Quiere que mates a los carceleros y encuentres las llaves. Solo te ayudará después de que lo liberes.","'¿No tenían la llave de mi celda? ¡Maldito sea Kaushar! ¡Maldito por las cosas más oscuras de la tierra! ¡Maldito, maldito!\
\
'Tengo que pensar. ¡Le arrancaré las tripas a mordiscos!'"},
[7733]={"'Very good, my friend! I trust my handkerchief served you well?\
\
'Durthuzâram is sacred to the Longbeards—nay, to all dwarves! Through your efforts, all dwarves and their descendants shall be able to admire it for ages to come!\
\
'You have my deepest thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Polished befouled crystal-lamps on the banks of Durthuzâram (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I have another task for you, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'It is certain that the Orcs and the Men of the Iron Crown pose the most immediate threat to our efforts to secure Gloomingtarn, but we must not lose sight of our truest purpose in Mount Gundabad. I speak of course of its reclamation—and its restoration!'\
\
Hermáth looks around the sprawling cavern of Gloomingtarn with a mix of awe and determination on his face.\
\
'Merely winning a victory over our foes is not enough to honour the sacred halls of Durin the Deathless, we must become the new stewards of Mount Gundabad. When I first led this expedition into Gloomingtarn, I made note of several befouled crystal-lamps on the banks of Durthuzâram. Countless tales told of the glowing lights along the banks of the dark lake, and I would not make liars of my ancestors!\
\
'Here, take my handkerchief. It is of a hardier cloth than you might think, and it has cleaned worse... believe me! Polish the crystal-lamps, ${PLAYER}, and set the banks of Durthuzâram aglow once more!'","Polish befouled crystal-lamps on the banks of Durthuzâram (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","After discovering that a number of the crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram have been befouled by slime and muck, Hermáth Stormhammer has resolved to see them restored to their former glory.","Befouled crystal-lamps can be found along the banks of Durthuzâram.\
\
After lending you his handkerchief, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to polish the befouled crystal-lamps along the banks of Durthuzâram.","Keepers of the Sacred Tarn","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"},
[7734]={"'¿Te has encargado de los trolls del sur?'","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Tus esfuerzos para cortar el avance de los trolls silvanos podría salvar el bosque de su entera destrucción.\
\
'Solo puedo esperar que sin el problema de los trolls silvanos, el bosque pronto recobre de nuevo la paz.'","Trolls silvanos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Lithuilas en Gwingris","'Mientras estabas encargándote de nuestros problemas más inmediatos en Glâd Ereg, nuestros exploradores han sabido que también hay una gran persencia de trolls silvanos allí. Estas criaturas son criadas por el Señor Oscuro y podrían ser la causa de la corrupción del bosque.\
\
'Por lo que nos han contado los exploradores, los trolls del bosque moran principalmente en Sâd Thereg, en el extremo sur de Glâd Ereg. Ve allí para ver qué puedes averiguar sobre su presencia allí.\
\
'Ten cuidado y lleva contigo a uno o dos aliados, pues estos monstruos son enemigos terribles.'","Guardianes del bosque","Derrota a los trolls silvanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los trolls silvanos se encuentran cerca de Sâd Thareg, al sur de Gwingris.\
\
Lithuilas te ha pedido que derrotes a los trolls silvanos de Glâd Ereg y averigües su propósito allí. Te ha sugerido que lleves uno o dos aliados contigo.","Lithuilas ha averiguado que hay un grupo de trolls silvanos en Glâd Ereg y cree que son los responsables de provocar al bosque.","Lithuilas está en Gwingris, al norte de Sâd Thareg.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lithuilas con las noticias de tu éxito."},
[7736]={"You have done your duty to Captain Róglarg and patrolled the Under-gate, but it seems your threats were likely not fully understood by the Under-gate wardens.\
\
It seems that the children of Shelob have begun to amass on the other side of the Under-gate.","Keeping Them On Guard","<rgb=#FF00FF>Shake your fist</rgb> at the Under-gate wardens","Patrol the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol","The Under-gate can be found in the rear of the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol the Under-gate and threaten the Uruk guards if they have been remiss in their duties.","Captain Róglarg is concerned that the Uruks guards of the Under-gate have shirking their duties.","The Under-gate wardens stand before the Under-gate in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have heard strange sounds on the other side of the Under-gate and should now threaten the Under-gate wardens as Captain Róglarg commanded.","You have done your duty to Captain Róglarg and patrolled the Under-gate.","Completado","You hear faint, but frantic scraping and screeching on the other side of the Under-gate...","'I haven't heard a thing from Her Ladyship or her children in days, and that's not like her! Not like her at all....\
\
'I have two Uruks guarding the Under-gate now, and I can't trust either of them to make sure none of Her Ladyship's children sneak in.\
\
'I want you to go patrol the Under-gate, and if you hear ANYTHING on the other side of it, you set those guard right!\
\
'Make it clear to them that I'll have them locked on her side if they don't keep the spiders out!'"},
[7737]={"Keeping Them at Bay","'Since we have started watching the Gorge, the number of trolls down there has continued to increase.\
\
'Thus far, you and your friends are the only ones who have had the strength and wits to fight them head on.\
\
'Until we get more men from Edoras, we have not the force to drive them out, but if you can take a few of those beasts down, it should serve to keep them at bay for a while and ensure the safety of Stangard.'","You should gather your allies and defeat the monstrous trolls that inhabit the Limlight Gorge to prevent them from mustering numbers that might threaten Stangard.","Captain Agelbrit is at the Limlight Gorge guard-post.\
\
You should return to Captain Agelbrit with news of your success.","Defeat trolls in the Limlight Gorge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Captain Agelbrit fears that the trolls of the Limight Gorge may gather their strength to attack Stangard.","Talk to Captain Agelbrit","'I could see a bit of your battles from up here....quite astounding!\
\
'Your valour continues to amaze me, ${PLAYER}. You have my gratitude and that of the Men of Stangard.'","'Have you defeated the trolls yet?'"},
[7738]={"Horn blown at horn-blowing spots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rhadrog has asked you to use the Haerondir Horn in certain places around Haerondir, and to use it to scare nearby curious Orcs.","Blow Haerondir Horn at horn-blowing spots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Another way we keep those Orcs out of here is with the use of eerie-sounding instruments. Here's one of them: the Haerondir Horn! There's a few places in Haerondir that have excellent acoustics. Go blow the horn in those places, and after that, see if you can find any curious Orcs that have strayed too close. Sneak up behind them, and blow the horn! Keeping the fear in them keeps us safe. I'll admit, it's also a bit of fun, but don't tell Anborn I said that.'","Spook curious Orc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Keeping Up Appearances","Rhadrog can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You should speak with Rhadrog.","'I told you it was fun! Orcs are such cowards. Haerondir should remain unbothered by them for the time being. Should we return from the coming battle, and I remain hopeful we will, we will not find this ruin has become a stronghold for any remaining Orcs!'","Curious Orcs can be found outside of Haerondir.\
\
Use the Haerondir Horn to spook curious Orcs who have wandered too close to Haerondir.","The spooked Orc runs away!","Use the Haerondir Horn at horn-blowing spots in Haerondir.","Speak with Rhadrog"},
[7740]={"Baráil in Sâr Marsag has asked you to travel west to Hadrudád and collect suitable firewood to keep their flame lit as well as defeat any of the monstrous huorns you encounter.","Gather firewood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Baráil in Sâr Marsag has asked you to travel to Hadrudád and collect suitable firewood to keep their flame lit as well as defeat any of the monstrous huorns you encounter.","Firewood gathered (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Huorns defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You return! And with plenty of firewood as well!'\
\
Baráil takes the firewood from you.\
\
'This will keep the flame lit for some time. Thank you my friend.\
\
'Sâr Marsag will remain a beacon of safety as we continue our efforts.'","Keeping the Flame Lit","Return to Baráil with the firewood","Vence a los ucornos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Baráil in Sâr Marsag with the firewood you have collected to keep the flame lit.","'The fire here is a sign of safety for travellers. Monsters fear it, and it is the last marker on the road leaving Adagím. I could use your help to keep it burning if you are willing, ${CLASS}.\
\
'In the area to the west known as Hadrudád, you can find suitable firewood that we could use. Be careful of the trees though, the Huorns have grown quite aggressive from the blight rotting inside them.'"},
[7741]={"Mantener puros a los Norsu","'Esto no es bueno. Este colmillo fue marcado por la mano de uno de los Susi-väki, pero las palabras de poder utilizadas son angmarim. Esto concuerda con lo que sé de un vidente Susi-väki que ha sido visto por aquí recientemente. ¡Un Hombre de Angmar debe de estar intentando enseñar a los Susi-väki cómo ensorcelar a nuestros norsu!\
\
'He oído historias de los malignos grilletes que los Angmarim imponen a sus bestias, retorciéndolas con el paso del tiempo y la desesperación hasta convertirlas en criaturas crueles. Esto no debe permitirse en Länsi-mâ. ¡Encuentra a ese vidente y deténlo!'","Regresa junto a Mika en Norsu-hauta y cuéntale tu éxito.","'Has cumplido bien tu cometido, ${PLAYER}. No obstante, parece que aún nos queda una amenaza angmarim considerable que suprimir.'","Mika reconoce las marcas del colmillo como hechicería angmarim trazada por la mano de un Gauradan. Quiere que encuentres y derrotes al vidente gauradan que se atreve a intentar corromper a uno de los mamuts de los Lossoth.","Busca por los alrededores de Norsu-hauta al vidente gauradan que está intentando ensorcelar a un mamut.","Derrota a un vidente gauradan que está intentando ensorcelar a un mamut","'No es momento de dudar. Busca al vidente Susi-väki aquí, en Norsu-hauta.'","Has derrotado al vidente gauradan"},
[7742]={"'After the funeral today, most of Gárwig's family will have a hard time getting back to the way things were, though for some that may take a long time. Please check on the orphans; Ansith and Cuthmar. They are cared for by Ebba and can usually be found in Gárferth's house.'","Fence posts can be found scattered around the western side of Forlaw.","Pick up fence posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ansith is inside Gárferth's house, near the centre of Forlaw. Ansith and Ebba are preparing dinner after the long day.","Collected fence posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, did Ansith send you to help? Thank you for helping us remove these snow piles! They build up fast these days. It seems like the wind blows them right back as I turn around to remove the next. \
\
'I was also helping her with her chore, but could you now help me with mine? I need to collect a few fence posts to replace the broken ones at the western gate. Could you please grab a few fence posts for me?'","Cuthmar can be found on the western side of Forlaw busy with his chores.","Snow pile removed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak to Ansith","'I am impressed. I did not think this many posts would be laying around town. You collected enough wood that those remaining in Forlaw may be able to start rebuilding soon. I'd help, but they don't let me, yet.\
\
'This would have taken me all day! But, with the funeral and all, it's not a bad day to have some fun instead. I cannot let myself be gloomy like all the adults seem to be today. Thank you for your help.'","Speak to Cuthmar","The two orphans of Gárwig's kin, sired by Cuthbald and Merwyn, are now cared for by Ebba. After the recent events and the funeral, they need not dwell on such times as the adults will, and are being kept busy with chores.","Return the fence posts to Cuthmar","Remove snow piles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Keeping the Orphans Busy","Snow piles on the western side of Forlaw are building up. \
\
Most of the residents cannot remember the snow in Forlaw ever being quite this bad.","'Cuthmar and I are behind on our chores with the funeral today, and it is hard to focus on anything with all that has happened. If you have a little time we could use your help! \
\
'The snow in Forlaw is worse lately than it has ever been. I brushed away the snow piles that built up around most of the town, but I have not been able to get to the western side of Forlaw. Could you please help me remove the piles over there?'"},
[7743]={"Talk to Hállkell","Keeping the Roads Safe","The ambushed caravan can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should investigate the caravan.","It is doubtful they saw the ambush coming","'Dead... they're all dead... we were ambushed and - I tried to save them.'","Hállkell is visibly shaken","Still no signs of trouble","Nothing to report here","The road continues to the west, towards the Vales of Anduin.\
\
Continue to patrol the main road to the west for Orcs.","A caravan ahead has met with conflict","Continue to patrol the road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs","'We were ambushed and... I tried, I did. But the spiders... spiders such as I have never seen and... I tried but I could not save them.'","'After the Battle Under the Trees, many Orcs fled to the Emyn-nu-Fuin, cravenly hiding up in those hills from retribution. Even now they lurk in my domain. If I am to open westward trade once more, those paths must be made safe from the attacks of these Orcs.\
\
'Will you patrol the way between here and the Vales of Anduin, keeping an eye out for any Orc?'","Hállkell can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to the merchant again.","The main road through Eryn Lasgalen can be found south of Felegoth.\
\
You should patrol the road for Orcs.","Patrol the main road through Eryn Lasgalen for Orcs","The dead Elves bear blackened puncture wounds","Investigate the ambushed caravan (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Having concluded the spiders have left Mirkwood, Thranduil focuses on keeping the roads safe in hope that trade can resume.","The road continues east and west.\
\
Continue patrolling for Orcs along the main road to the west.","The Beorning merchant can be found along the western end of the main road in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to the merchant and find out what happened to the caravan.","Are those... spider-webs?"},
[7744]={"Carrera de saltos de barril: La credulidad de Kolmar","Habla con Arnar","'¡Veo que has tenido suerte en las carreras de barriles! Permíteme ser el primero en felicitarte por tu excelente fortuna, ${PLAYER}. Aquí tienes tu recompensa.'","Observa la carrera para ver si Kolmar resulta vencedor","Kolmar ha perdido la carrera","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","'¡Observa la carrera, ${PLAYER}! ¿Cómo crees que le irá a Kolmar?'","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la abundante recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","¡Kolmar ha ganado la carrera!","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Has predicho que Kolmar ganará la carrera, y ahora deberías observar si tu predicción se cumple.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Kolmar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.","'Bien, ${PLAYER}, ¡muy buenos días! A menudo se dice que no hay nada mejor que un buen clima veraniego, aunque para mi gusto está un poco sofocante en esta época del año. ¡Me estoy derritiendo aquí de pie!\
\
'Estos perezosos días de verano pueden hacerse eternos, por eso esperamos con tantas ganas los eventos del festival. Este año, los habitantes de la Mansión de Thorin compiten por terminar la carrera de saltos de barril lo más rápido posible. Si quieres saber un secreto, creo que sé quién es el más rápido…\
\
'Creo que Kolmar es una apuesta segura este año. Un amigo mío lo vio vaciar un barril entero y seguir bailando sin problemas. ¿Te gustaría apoyar a Kolmar? Yo lo haría, si fuera tú.'"},
[7745]={"Lar ha perdido la carrera","Observa la carrera para ver si Lar resulta victorioso","Habla con Arnar","'¡Observa la carrera, ${PLAYER}; a ver si Lar demuestra ser el más resistente de todos!'","'Bueno, ${PLAYER}, ¡muy buenos días! A menudo se dice que no hay nada mejor que un buen clima veraniego, aunque para mi gusto está un poco bochornoso en esta época del año. ¡Me estoy asando aquí de pie!\
\
'Estos perezosos días de verano pueden hacerse eternos, por eso esperamos con tantas ganas los eventos del Festival. Este año, los habitantes de la Mansión de Thorin compiten por terminar la carrera de saltos de barril lo más rápido posible. ¿Quién crees que ganará?\
\
'Creo que Lar es el candidato más fuerte. No recuerdo haber visto nunca a un enano más rápido... ¡ni con una sed menos saciable! Si estás de acuerdo, deberías elegirlo.'","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Crees que Lar ganará la carrera y deberías observar si esto se cumple.","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","'¡Veo que has tenido algo de suerte en las carreras de barriles! Permíteme ser el primero en felicitarte por tu excelente fortuna, ${PLAYER}. Aquí tienes tu recompensa.'","No abandones la zona de la carrera","¡Lar ha ganado la carrera!","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Lar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.","Carrera de saltos de barril: Corre, Lar"},
[7746]={"'Muy buenos días, ${PLAYER}! ¿Has venido por el festival? Pues como ya sabrás, nuestro evento principal es la Carrera de saltos de barril.\
\
'Esta competición enfrentará a cuatro borrachos empedernidos… es decir, a nobles y respetables enanos, en una lucha hasta el final.\
\
'¡La línea de meta, claro! No dejamos a esos compañeros acercarse a hachas ni a otros objetos afilados hasta que se les pase la borrachera. Dímelo si te interesan algunas entradas.'","Carrera de saltos de barril: ¡A la carrera!","Habla con Jorfi","Jorfi ofrece un par de entradas gratuitas para la Carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Jorfi para recibir dos entradas gratuitas para las carreras de saltos de barril.","'Aquí tienes, mi buen ${RACE}: ¡dos entradas para el evento principal!\
\
'Elige bien a tus corredores… si uno de ellos ya parece achispado antes incluso de empezar la carrera, ese es tu enano, te lo aseguro.\
\
'Ah, y si vuelves más tarde, quizá pueda conseguirte un par de entradas más.'"},
[7747]={"Ottó ha perdido la carrera","Habla con Arnar","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Ottó mientras participa en la carrera de salto de barriles del Festival de Verano.","Observa la carrera para ver si Ottó resulta victorioso","'Bueno, ${PLAYER}, ¡muy buenos días! A menudo se dice que no hay nada mejor que un buen clima veraniego, aunque para mi gusto está un poco bochornoso en esta época del año. ¡Me estoy asando aquí de pie!\
\
'Estos perezosos días de verano pueden hacerse eternos, por eso esperamos con tantas ganas los eventos del Festival. Este año, los habitantes de la Mansión de Thorin compiten por terminar la carrera de salto de barriles lo más rápido posible. ¿Quién crees que ganará?\
\
'Si quieres que te cuente un pequeño secreto, Ottó es sin duda el candidato más fuerte. ¡Creo que nunca lo he visto sin una jarra en la mano! Entre tú y yo, es tan robusto como el enano más resistente que haya existido.'","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","'¡Veo que has tenido algo de suerte en las carreras de barriles! Permíteme ser el primero en felicitarte por tu excelente fortuna, ${PLAYER}. Aquí tienes tu recompensa.'","'Ottó es sin duda mi favorito para esta ronda. Pero ¿por qué estás hablando conmigo? ¡Mira la carrera, ${PLAYER}!'","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","¡Ottó ha ganado la carrera!","Carrera de salto de barriles: Ottó el extraordinario","La carrera de salto de barriles comenzará pronto en este mismo circuito.\
\
Has predicho que Ottó ganará la carrera, y deberías observar si tu predicción se cumple."},
[7748]={"Habla con Arnar","'Bueno, ${PLAYER}, ¡muy buenos días para ti!\
\
'Estos perezosos días de verano pueden hacerse interminables, por eso esperamos con tantas ganas los eventos del Festival. Este año, los habitantes de la Mansión de Thorin compiten por terminar la carrera de saltos de barril lo más rápido posible. ¿Quién crees que ganará?\
\
'¿Así que quieres saber mi opinión? Bueno, no se supone que deba decirlo, pero… haré una excepción. Verás, Signar procede de una larga estirpe de bebedores experimentados, y no veo cómo alguien podría superarlo con semejante herencia. ¿Te gustaría apoyar a Signar en esta ronda? Es una elección sabia.'","Carrera de saltos de barril: El paso veloz de Signar","Has abandonado la zona de la carrera","'¡Veo que has tenido algo de suerte en las carreras de barriles! Permíteme ser el primero en felicitarte por tu excelente fortuna, ${PLAYER}. Aquí tienes tu recompensa.'","Observa la carrera para ver si Signar resulta victorioso","La carrera de saltos de barril comenzará pronto en esta misma pista.\
\
Has predicho que Signar ganará la carrera, y deberías observar si esta predicción se cumple.","Tienes un interés personal en el éxito de Signar mientras participa en la carrera de saltos de barril del Festival de Verano.","'¡Observa la carrera, ${PLAYER}! ¿Cómo crees que le irá a Signar?'","¡Signar ha ganado la carrera!","Arnar se encuentra en la zona de la carrera de barriles durante el Festival de Verano.\
\
Deberías hablar con Arnar y recoger la generosa recompensa que tiene para ofrecerte por tu excelente suerte.","No abandones la zona de la carrera","Signar ha perdido la carrera"},
[7751]={"Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
A Maladan le alegrará saber que has sobrevivido a la batalla de Haudh Valandur.","Habla con Maladan en el Camino de los Reyes","Haudh Valandur se ha convertido en el hogar de un grupo de kergrim, unas criaturas repugnantes de origen desconocido.","Acaba con kergrim en Haudh Valandur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Cuando llegamos aquí, pensábamos que los únicos problemas que tendríamos en estas tumbas serían unos cuantos saqueadores y asegurarnos de que las paredes no se nos vinieran encima. \
\
'Nadie previó a los kergrim, sean lo que sean. Lo único que sé es que son unos carroñeros despiadados que te matarán antes de siquiera mirarte.\
\
'Un grupo de ellos se ha instalado en Haudh Valandur. Ese es un problema que necesito que solucioneis.'","Kergrim de Haudh Valandur","'No tengo más consejo que este: atacad primero y con fuerza.'","'¿Entonces es seguro entrar?'","Kergrim derrotados en Haudh Valandur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Haudh Valandur se encuentra en el Camino de los Reyes, al oeste del campamento de los Montaraces.\
\
Maladan te ha pedido que vayas a Haudh Valandur y derrotes a los kergrim que hay allí."},
[7752]={"Has encontrado las provisiones saqueadas, pero llegaste demasiado tarde para salvar al conductor","Tu misión es viajar a Tûkurdul para recuperar las provisiones que fueron saqueadas y salvar al conductor si puedes. Por supuesto, debes matar a cualquier kergrim que veas en la zona para asegurarte de que no vuelvan a atacar.","Kergrim derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Hola, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Me alegra que hayas podido recuperar las provisiones, aunque es triste escuchar lo del conductor. Regresemos a Ub Nishir.'","Derrota a los kergrim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Provisiones saqueadas reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kergrim en el extremo noroeste de Tûkurdul, cerca de Ashâgir, saqueó un cargamento del oeste. Se llevaron al conductor y el contenido de su carga. Salva al conductor y recupera sus provisiones.","Kergrim en la carretera"},
[7753]={"Buenamordida y Viejo Roedor están en Skûmfil, al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Odmar quiere que acabes con los líderes kergrim que trajeron a las criaturas devoradoras de cadáveres a Skûmfil a través de los túneles de Moria.","Los líderes kergrim","Derrota a Buenamordida","Habla con Odmar en el Refugio Sombrío","Derrota a Viejo Roedor","Skûmfil no es más que un vertedero, un lugar donde se arrojan a los orcos muertos de Moria cuando empiezan a apestar. Es allí donde dos enemigos se han reunido, cada uno con la intención de usar los cadáveres para sus propios fines. Los kergrim y otros carroñeros los utilizan como fuente de alimento, y los insectos, como lugar para poner sus huevos y engendrar futuras generaciones.","'No sé cómo estas bestias lograron llegar a Skûmfil, pero creo que debería alegrarnos saber que es nuestro deber acabar con ellas. Dirígete al sureste y entra en Skûmfil. Encuentra a los dos kergrim, Buenamordida y Viejo Roedor. Derrótalos y regresa a mí.'","Odmar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al noroeste de Skûmfil.\
\
Encontraste a los dos kergrim, uno antiguo y el otro un invocador, y los mataste. Odmar, que está en el Refugio Sombrío, se alegrará de saber que ya está hecho.","'Los kergrim son criaturas asquerosas que se alimentan de los cuerpos putrefactos de los muertos. Creo que es nuestro deber acabar con ellos. Nada bueno puede salir de ese comportamiento.\
\
'Busca a los kergrim Buenamordida y Viejo Roedor. Encuéntralos y mátalos para que no puedan seguir cometiendo sus actos atroces con los muertos.\
\
'Los hallarás en Skûmfil, al sureste del Refugio Sombrío.'","'Es bueno saber que ya no tendremos que temer a criaturas como esas. Ojalá no tuviéramos que volver a luchar nunca más contra enemigos tan terribles.\
\
'Por desgracia, ese no es nuestro destino. Aun así, has hecho un buen trabajo hoy, ${PLAYER}. Te doy las gracias e informaré a Throstur de tus esfuerzos.'","Buenamordida derrotado","Viejo Roedor derrotado"},
[7755]={"Las llaves de las criptas","Llaves conseguidas en el Camino de los Reyes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Maladan se encuentra en el campamento de Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Maladan querrá examinar las llaves que has recogido.","'Las compararé con nuestros registros para ver a qué zonas has conseguido acceso.'","Los habitantes del Camino de los Reyes poseen antiguas llaves que pueden abrir algunas de las criptas y tumbas que hay en su interior.","Consigue llaves en el Camino de los Reyes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Llévale las llaves a Maladan","'En poco tiempo querremos empezar a explorar las tumbas de esta zona... para ver en qué estado se encuentran, quién hay dentro de ellas, expulsar a quienes las ocupan ahora y recuperar reliquias valiosas.\
\
'Pero no podremos hacerlo si no conseguimos entrar en ellas. Envié una petición a Tinnudir, pero no se encontró ninguna de las llaves de estas criptas en la fortaleza de allí. Nuestras copias se han perdido en el tiempo.\
\
'Sin embargo, he visto a muchos de los habitantes del Camino de los Reyes entrando y saliendo de las tumbas, y creo que algunos deben de tener llaves que están utilizando. Sal a conseguir unas cuantas y veamos qué podemos explorar.'","'Si queremos descubrir el destino de nuestros gobernantes, debemos tener las llaves para abrir las criptas y las tumbas.'"},
[7758]={"'The Elves of Rivendell have spotted a particularly unpleasant goblin by the name of Khlârum. This evil creature makes a particular sport of hunting down scouts and travellers in the region, and they would like to see him chased back down into the hole from whence he came.\
\
'Khlârum was last seen wandering in the vicinity of the goblin-camp of Akûltot, outside Goblin-town, in the Misty Mountains.'","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Khlârum's defeat.","'My thanks for dealing with the goblin Khlârum. Our attempts to infiltrate Goblin-town can now proceed without his interference.'","Talk to Handarod","Defeat Khlârum","Khlârum the Sneak","A particularly vicious and dangerous goblin has been spotted in the camps outside of Goblin-town. He is said to be hunting down warriors who dare travel too close to their stronghold.","Khlârum lurks near the camp of Akûltot in the eastern Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to aid the Elves of Rivendell by defeating the goblin Khlârum.","Defeated Khlârum"},
[7759]={"Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts.","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: Torches can be dropped by right clicking the induction bar.</rgb>","Burned piles of refuse at Khorroz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Set fire to a large pile at Khorroz","Light fires to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz","Burned piles of refuse to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz.","Khorroz: Beasts at Bay","Pick up a torch to burn other piles of refuse","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.","Completado","Burn piles of refuse at Khorroz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","This pile of refuse was quite flammable!","You have lit many piles aflame at Khorroz and frightened off many cave-beasts in return. Your efforts here are sure to make Máttugard a safer dwelling for those seeking to reclaim Gundabad.","Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts. The beasts thrive in the darkness. Perhaps there is a way to drive some of the beasts out of Khorroz?"},
[7760]={"Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts.","Khorroz, once the home to the largest bat population in Gundabad, has now been overtaken by deadly cave-beasts. The dwarf-made cavern is littered with bones and old trinkets. These trinkets must have been collected by the cave-beasts as they hunt in Gundabad. Reuniting these trinkets with their rightful owners would certainly be a boon to the spirits of those seeking to reclaim Gundabad.","A supply chest can be found at any dwarf outpost in Máttugard.\
\
You should place the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest.","Collect dwarf trinkets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Khorroz: Missing Trinkets","Khorroz can be found in Máttugard.\
\
You should collect dwarf trinkets at Khorroz.","Place the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest","Collected dwarf trinkets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7761]={"Confront Khâshap","Attend Khâshap's assembly","Khâshap plans to confront the rumours head on by appearing before the Gut. Hadorion believes we should spring the trap now.","'Let us make preparations to begin our pursuit! We have him cornered!'","'He has escaped again!\
\
'The man is either lucky or very good at pretending to be. Either way, the pursuit doesn't stop. This is his destination, after all.\
\
'We must pressure him into making one final mistake.\
\
'The man has nine lives. I won't lie to you. We are severely outnumbered.\
\
'But we must keep our eyes on the prize. Khâshap is within our grasp!'","Khâshap has fled into the back streets of the Gut. Hadorion believes this is the final chance. Khâshap is cornered.","Khâshap has fled into the back alleys!","Khâshap's Assembly","A group of Corsairs has gathered","Khâshap has gathered his Corsairs and makes his escape into the back alleys of the Lower Ward. He must be stopped here before he delivers the phials of Ifrinn to his master.","It is finally time to confront Khâshap.","Talk to Hadorion"},
[7763]={"Esta caja contiene botas resistentes de varios tamaños, perfectas para patear rascacuevas. Maginard te sugirió que tomaras un par para ti.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Debes colocar las botas como una habilidad. Para hacerlo, arrastra el objeto 'Botas Pateagarras' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades. Luego, usa la habilidad en los Rascacuevas Ladrones para avanzar en la misión.</rgb>","'Todo el mundo habla de las musarañas ladronas, pero no se habla lo suficiente de los rascacuevas ladrones, si me preguntas. Por supuesto, esos inútiles agentes de la ley no hacen nada. Yo crecí en la Comarca propiamente dicha, y los Fronteros nunca permitirían que sucedieran cosas así, te lo digo. No, de hecho, les darían a esos rascacuevas ladrones una patada tan fuerte que no la olvidarían pronto.\
\
'Si planeas entrar en ese túnel de musarañas y ves un rascacueva, eso es lo que deberías hacer. Patea tan fuerte que pensarán que fue el propio Toro Bramador Tuk quien lo hizo, ¡y no volverán, te lo prometo!\
\
'Pero querrás unas botas resistentes. Los rascacuevas son muy puntiagudos. De hecho, hay una caja con esas botas justo por allá. Sírvete, la mayoría de la gente aquí no las quiere.'\
\
Maginard se ríe y mueve sus peludos dedos de los pies.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>'","Patea a los rascacuevas","Maginard quiere que des patadas a los rascacuevas que encuentres dentro del túnel al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo. Usa tus Botas Pateagarras para mandar volar a las bestias.","Maginard quiere que des patadas a los rascacuevas ladrones que encuentres dentro del túnel bajo el pueblo de Entibo. Para hacerlo de forma segura, debes tener un par de botas resistentes para patear. Maginard te habló de una caja cercana que contiene esas botas en el centro del pueblo de Entibo.","Patea a los rascacuevas ladrones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rascacuevas ladrones pateados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue un par de Botas Pateagarras de la caja","Maginard Zorronillo sabe que hay rascacuevas causando problemas en Entibo y tiene algunas ideas sobre cómo lidiar con ellos."},
[7764]={"'Defeat Gozug, and it may be that the trolls will leave this place.'","'Ta-room, ta-rum, little ${RACE}! If we cannot move the trolls out by force, perhaps they will depart if their chieftain is slain.\
\
'There have been whispers on the winds of a great wild troll named Gozug, who dwells in the Stone-hole. Would you enter that foul cave and defeat him? Perhaps then the trolls shall depart this place.'","Gozug can be found deep within the troll-infested Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp.\
\
Gnarlstump has asked you to defeat Gozug, chieftain of the wild trolls of the Brown Lands.","Defeated Gozug","'Ah, this was a good deed, little ${RACE}. Trolls are a bad lot, to be certain. Ta-rum!'","Gnarlstump is at his camp, south of the Stone-hole.\
\
You should return to Gnarlstump with news of your victory.","Defeat Gozug","Kicking a Stone","Gnarlstump is angered by the presence of trolls in the Brown Lands, especially the desolation of the Entwives' gardens, and wishes them removed.","Talk to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands"},
[7765]={"Kidzul-kâlah: Battles Past","Destroyed shunned swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy shunned swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The dredging machines stand like forgotten hulks in the Gladden Fields, idle now, but not always. Once there was a time when they sifted soil and mud, and drew weapons and armour-pieces from long ago to light. Someone or something has taken these unearthed treasures into Kidzul-kâlah, whether for grave robbery or some other purpose I cannot say. But if that purpose be foul, as I think it must, they should be found and destroyed.'","Hithril of the Elves of Lórien is concerned about the shadowy waters that surround the sunken ruins of Kidzul-kâlah.","Weapons taken from the Gladden Fields into Kidzul-kâlah should be destroyed before they can be used for some foul purpose."},
[7767]={"Kidzul-kâlah: Dark Waters","'The ruins of Kidzul-kâlah are surrounded by ice-cold waters, but nothing chills the heart quite like the evil that rises from that still pond. Shadowy darkwaters will menace the Vales of Anduin if they are not defeated. Do you understand me, ${PLAYER}?'","Sombramórbidos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los sombramórbidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Kidzul darkwaters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Darkwaters menace the drowned ruins of Kidzul-kâlah, and must be defeated.","Hithril, of the Elves of Lórien, is concerned about the shadowy waters that surround the sunken ruins of Kidzul-kâlah.","Defeated Kidzul darkwaters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7769]={"Encuentra y derrota a Tamâhu, el escorpión temible.","Derrota a Tamâhu, el escorpión temible","Encuentra al escorpión temible Tamâhu","'Estos escorpiones me ponen la piel de gallina. Me alegra que hayas podido reducir su número. ¡Regresemos a Urmâkh para informar las buenas noticias!'","Los escorpiones cerca de Dûlagig han estado expandiendo su alcance y se están volviendo más agresivos en sus ataques. Reduce su número antes de que se conviertan en una amenaza aún mayor para Urmâkh.","Incendia los nidos de escorpiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los escorpiones y destruye sus nidos para reducir su número.","Derrota a los escorpiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tamâhu chasquea sus pinzas en señal de advertencia al acercarte","Mátenlo con fuego","Escorpiones derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7771]={"Las estructuras fúngicas se encuentran en y alrededor de Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Tyki quiere que quemes algunas de las extrañas estructuras fúngicas cerca del campamento de los Orcos.","'Ah, encantado de verte, ${PLAYER}. Entonces, ¿esas estructuras se quemaron? ¿O estaban demasiado mojadas?'","Tyki ha estado observando de cerca a los orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga para ver si su intento de cura con agua fresca funcionó. Ha determinado que no, y la amenaza orca debe ser erradicada de Khazad-dûm...con fuego.","Estructuras fúngicas quemadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Busca al sur Dalgum-ru, el campamento de los orcos, en y alrededor del cual se encuentran las extrañas estructuras fúngicas de las que te hablé. ¡Quémalas hasta reducirlas a cenizas!'","Mátalo con fuego","Quema las estructuras fúngicas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No sirve de nada, ${PLAYER}. Esperaba volver a una vida tranquila y limpia, matando a los orcos normales y sencillos, pero parece que no va a ser así. Estas monstruosidades fúngicas no pueden seguir mancillando las amadas piedras de nuestro antiguo hogar.\
\
'He notado el hongo que infesta varias estructuras alrededor del campamento de los orcos, al igual que tú, estoy seguro. No sé qué son, y no estoy seguro de que me importe, pero sospecho que están contribuyendo al problema.\
\
'Si el agua purificadora no funcionó, entonces quizás la llama purificadora sí lo hará. ¡Quema las estructuras cubiertas de hongo en todo Dalgum-ru y sus alrededores, luego vuelve a verme!'","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki para informarle de lo inflamables que resultaron ser esas estructuras fúngicas."},
[7772]={"'These orders confirm what we have long feared. A large number of troops are moving towards this area as we speak. When the Enemy arrives, the Golden Host and all the Galadhrim will be in grave danger. According to these orders, the forces that are due to arrive, will be used to lay siege to Lothlórien.\
\
'I will inform the others at once. By intercepting these orders, you may have secured us additional time.'","Collected sealed orders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect sealed orders  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Eirien at Mithechad","'There is a small Orc-camp known as Gâthlata which serves as the central crossroad for the enemy forces mustering in the Ashenslades. Supplies and troops daily pass through the outpost to whatever camp they are assigned to.\
\
'It would be of great value to us if we could learn where these forces are being sent and what their goals may be. Orcs at Gâthlata may bear records or sealed orders related to these movements. Would you journey to Gâthlata and recover some of these orders?\
\
'The encampment is east of here, just north of Ânghum-maudhûl.'","Sealed orders may be found on the Orcs at Gâthlata, east of Mithechad, north of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
Eirien has asked you to collect sealed orders from the Orcs of Gâthlata.","Eirien is at Mithechad, west of Gâthlata.\
\
You should bring the sealed orders you discovered to Eirien at once.","The small Orc-camp of Gâthlata sits below Ânghum-maudhûl and serves as a crossroad for the Orcs mustering in the Ashenslades.","Kill the Messenger","'Travel east to Gâthlata and retrieve records or sealed orders related to troop-movements in the Ashenslades.'"},
[7773]={"Derrota a Âthruk en Maudhul-ulur","'Los huargos de los Lindes Oscuros temerán a los Malledhrim.'","'Los sabuesos de Dol Guldur han sido silenciados en Maudhul-ulur gracias a ti, ${PLAYER}.'","Matando al lobo","'Creo que la única forma de terminar con la amenaza de los huargos es derrotar a su líder. Corta la cabeza y la serpiente morirá.\
\
'Entre los huargos de Maudhul-ulur hay un jinete de huargos que los lidera. Derrota a Âthruk y a su bestia, y cundirá el caos entre los huargos.\
\
'Vuelve a verme cuando hayas completado esta tarea y te recompensaré lo mejor que pueda.'","Goldínwen está en Echad Glamodúd, al norte de Maudhul-ulur.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Goldínwen con la noticia de tu victoria.","Âthruk se encuentra en Maudhul-ulur, al sur de Echad Glamodúd.\
\
Goldínwen te ha pedido que derrotes a Âthruk, el capataz de Maudhul-ulur.","Habla con Goldílwen en Echad Glamodúd","'¿Âthruk todavía vive? Esas son aciagas noticias. Debe ser eliminado, o los huargos seguirán suponiendo una amenaza.'","'¡Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}! Los huargos de Maudhul-ulur ahora nos temerán.\
\
'Te has ganado esta recompensa y la gratitud de los Malledhrim.'","Âthruk derrotado","Los huargos organizados de Maudhul-ulur siguen siendo una gran amenaza para los Elfos de los Malledhrim."},
[7775]={"With the Taurogrim defeated and their twisted forms burned, the familiar crackling of firewood echoes through Tríubad. Although you suspect that the Taurogrim will soon return, you have done well to aid the Woodmen.","Kindling to Wildfire","Completado","Defeated Taurogrim and burned their remains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Taurogrim and burn their remains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Driven from Tríubad by the Taurogrim, the Woodmen hope to repel the wood-demons from their remaining settlements in Woodsedge.","'Perhaps Tríubad is lost, but the wood-demons cannot come to Hultvís! They must be stopped, and I believe I know how it can be achieved!\
\
'It was said in tales of old that the Thyrsir could not truly be slain. If one of the wood-demons fell to the axe, its mouldering remains would give rise to more of its kind. Only when they were put to flame could their evil be ended. Demons they may be, but they are demons wrought of wood, and that means they must fear fire!\
\
'If you are to overcome the wood-demons, you must swiftly burn their remains after defeating them. For each of our sakes, let us hope the tale spoke true!'","Taurogrim can be found throughout Tríubad in Woodsedge.\
\
Believing it might cleanse the Vales of Anduin of their evil, Clothar has asked you to burn the remains of fallen Taurogrim at Tríubad.","You have burned the remains of many of the Taurogrim at Tríubad."},
[7776]={"Defeated Saruman's minion","'Your heroic efforts are needed elsewhere in Rohan. Do you not agree, my old friend? Think of the elderly Théoden King, surrounded by disloyal men.\
\
'Surely you must wish to help the King of Rohan....'","Talk to the old man again...","Break the old man's spell! Say <rgb=#FF0000>no</rgb> to him, if you can","The old man in rags is near the White Hand Encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. How goes your quest in Fangorn? You are a long way from home, my old friend.\
\
'Tell me: why do you waste your time on mindless Orcs in some ragged old forest when there are more pressing issues at hand?'","An old, bent man has appeared in the forest near the White Hand encampment.","'Hrumm....'\
\
The Ent spoke! At least, you think it spoke. Regardless, a sound was made, possibly one to indicate approval of your actions on his behalf.\
\
This is a good sign, but also a frustrating one; the Ents are slow to wake. It seems that it will take a lifetime of a mortal Man to rouse them as Gandalf wished....","Defeat the warrior summoned by Saruman","Talk to Wisewood","Kindly Advice","Talk to the old man again","Something does not seem right. This sounds like wisdom, but your logic struggles against your heart, for the man's words seem wrong...","'Yes, ${PLAYER}. These Orcs are not the real threat to Rohan. The King's nephew, Éomer, wishes to harm the King.\
\
'You and I are old friends, are we not? You should trust me, ${PLAYER}, and go help the King free himself from his nephew's influence.\
\
'Leave this forest at once. There is nothing for you here.'","Such wisdom cannot be naysaid","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should say <rgb=#FF0000>no</rgb> to the old man and break the strange spell he has over you.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should <rgb=#FF0000>agree</rgb> with the old man, since what he says is so reasonable.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.</rgb>","All that this man says seems reasonable and just","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.","<rgb=#FF0000>Agree</rgb> with the old man","Wisewood is at his place near the White Hand encampment in north-eastern Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with Wisewood.","The old man vows that you will die for defying him","Talk to the old man again, now that the veil is lifted","The old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn.\
\
You should speak with the old man in rags once more.","The old man's voice has grown cold and hard.\
\
'You defy me! You are a fool. You could have left this forest alive, ${PLAYER}, but now you will die. Of this, you may be assured.'","You have naysaid the old man, who is likely Saruman posing as Gandalf. The spell is broken!"},
[7777]={"Kindness Counts","Impressed by the kindness you have shown her people, Lady Tóla, new wife of Lord Ingmar, requests your presence.","Lady Tóla awaits you within her house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
You should enter Lord Ingmar's house and speak with Lady Tóla.","Talk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth","Darmod stands guard outside Lord Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth.\
\
Botulf instructed you to speak with Darmod, Lord Ingmar's doorwarden, to gain access to Lady Tóla.","'Are you ${PLAYER}? Word of your kindness has come to me, and I desired to thank you. It is not often that strangers offer their aid, nor that they be offered hospitality in return... these days are dire.\
\
'However, I confess, it was not to show gratitude alone that I summoned you hither.'","'Ah, ${PLAYER} the ${CLASS}. Lady Tóla awaits you within. Please enter.'","Talk to Darmod outside Ingmar's house in Eaworth","'${PLAYER}, a moment! The kindness you have shown our people has come to the attention of Lady Tóla, Lord Ingmar's new wife. She wishes to express her gratitude to you in person.\
\
'Lord Ingmar's home is in the northern part of the city. Speak with Darmod, the doorwarden, and he will grant you access to Lady Tóla.'"},
[7778]={"Mizâdi knows your strength and honour and looks to your assistance again as she takes her battle directly to the Ordâkhai.","Reach Kindred standing with the Hamât Renewed","'Our advance is certain, and your labours steadfast. With each passing hour, we draw nearer to that final stroke which shall see Hamât restored.\
\
'Be watchful for the marks borne by those leading our foes—their insignias are of great worth to Mizâdi, for they stand as tokens of their waning power and our rising strength.\
\
'Hearken now, ${PLAYER}. Survey what has been set aside in your name, and claim the reward you have rightfully won.'","Speak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment","As Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.","Kindred of Hamât Renewed","Your renown grows among the Hamât Renewed. Return now to the Quartermaster—they have readied a boon in thanks for your labours."},
[7784]={"Across Kighân, your efforts increase your standing among the people. In the halls of Zajâna, your name and deeds grow with import.","Kindred to the City of Zajâna","Across Kighân, your efforts increase your standing among the people.","You remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.","Reach Kindred standing with The City of Zajâna","'Your voice now holds weight within these walls, ${PLAYER}. Your deeds and words align, and for that, the Doorwards grant favour. Choose from what has been set aside and know that our doors remain open to one such as you.'","Speak with Alahamâr at Zajâna"},
[7785]={"You have defended the Malledhrim war-banner with honour","Defend the banner of the Malledhrim","You were unable to defend the Malledhrim war-banner","The guard-towers are in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch.","'I hope you have prepared yourself for the battle ahead, ${PLAYER}. The Orcs of Taur Morvith may be in disarray, and now is the time to strike against them and shatter their will to fight altogether!\
\
'In each of their fortresses, there is a guard-tower that overlooks the approaches...I want you to either fight or sneak into those encampments and claim the top of one of those towers with a banner of the Malledhrim, then hold it against any Orcs who attempt to reclaim it from you!'","You have placed the Malledhrim war-banner atop one of the guard-towers","You have abandoned the Malledhrim war-banner to the Enemy","'Bring our war-banner to Krul Lugu and defend it against the Orcs...they will learn that it is futile to defy the Malledhrim!'","'Ha! Well fought, ${PLAYER}! Well fought, indeed!\
\
'Surely the Orcs' will to fight will be broken by such valour as you have shown today. With your aid, we shall hold this front, and our forces at Ost Galadh shall be free to lay low the tower of Dol Guldur!'","Rey de la colina","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu.\
\
You should speak with Iavassúl regarding your efforts in the Orc-camps.","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","The guard-towers are in Krul Lugu below Iavassúl's Watch.\
\
Iavassúl has asked you to claim one of the two guard-towers in Taur Morvith with a banner of the Malledhrim, then hold it against the Orcs for a time.","The Orcs of Taur Morvith are in disarray. Iavassúl now has a plan to keep them that way.","Place the Malledhrim war-banner"},
[7788]={"Se busca: hachas picadas de Umbar y de los confines de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas picadas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger hachas picadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las hachas picadas en una caja de recolección","Hachas picadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Recoge hachas picadas (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: hachas picadas de Umbar o de los confines de Gondor.","Tarea de Gondor del Rey del Poniente y Gondor Exterior: Hacha picada","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: hachas picadas de Gondor. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."},
[7796]={"You pick up a small, unadorned pouch...","'I cannot tell what my scouts will find, ${PLAYER}, but I will make certain that you and King Thorin know of it.\
\
'When you come to Felegoth next, speak to me and I shall tell you what I have learned.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Bane of the Elvenking'</rgb>","'What is this, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You offer the small pouch to King Thranduil. He opens the pouch to examine its contents, and his face betrays some small measure of amusement.\
\
'Do you know what King Thorin bade you deliver to me? It is a pouch of gold coins, and this trifling gift tells me more than hours of words between us might. He wishes to demonstrate that the greed that seized the last of his name need no longer be feared. I had no quarrel with King Dáin before his death, but I appreciate such a gesture from the new King Under the Mountain.\
\
'Now then, I do not believe that is the only reason you travelled all the way to my halls.'\
\
You inform King Thranduil that Karazgar has returned to Eryn Lasgalen for an unknown purpose.\
\
'It seems Karazgar's charge eludes him still. If what he seeks lies within my realm, then we must seize this chance to ensnare him.\
\
'The scouts of Felegoth stand ready, and I would have you direct them. See that they scout the lands around Loeglond, Tholkát, Tham Aeldír, Torech Emel, and the eastern reaches of Eryn Lasgalen. I would also ask that one search the ruins of Caras Tilion, but they are to speak to none but me of what they find.\
\
'When you have sent them off, return to me.'","Deliver the token of peace to King Thranduil in Felegoth","Directed King Thranduil's scouts to search for Karazgar in Eryn Lasgalen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have been tasked with delivering King Thorin's token of peace to King Thranduil.","Scouts can be found throughout Felegoth.\
\
King Thranduil has asked you to send scouts into Eryn Lasgalen to seek the Weeping Warrior. You should sent the scouts out as soon as you are able.","Talk to King Thranduil","The token of peace can be found on King Thorin III's throne.\
\
King Thorin has asked you to collect and deliver a token of peace to King Thranduil.","Retrieve the token of peace from King Thorin's throne","Hoping to warn King Thranduil of the Weeping Warrior's presence in Eryn Lasgalen, King Thorin III seeks to renew his father's friendship with the Elvenking.","King Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have sent many of King Thranduil's scouts into Eryn Lasgalen in search of the Weeping Warrior. You should return to King Thranduil.","Direct King Thranduil's scouts to search for Karazgar in Eryn Lasgalen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Hail, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I have not met with King Thranduil since I became King Under the Mountain, and I think it should remain that way for a time. Our peoples are friendly, but we do not impose on each other's realms. When Durin's Folk and the Elves have met in the past, things have not always gone well. Intentions have been misread, and ire stoked needlessly. There was not always such friendship between our peoples, my friend, but my father and King Thranduil put things to rights after the Battle of Five Armies. Ah, but diplomacy is now my burden!\
\
'I have prepared a token of peace for King Thranduil, and I would have you deliver to him on my behalf. It is a token he alone will understand, and it will quell any doubts he has of his friendship with Durin's Folk.\
\
'Once you have delivered it to him, tell him of the Weeping Warrior's presence in Eryn Lasgalen. He will know what is to be done.'","Kings of Wood and Stone"},
[7797]={"Search Minas Tirith for any kingsfoil growing wild.","Kingsfoil: Between the Cracks","Bring the kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","'What is this? Wild sprigs of that athelas? Oh, you are a miracle-worker, ${PLAYER}. I will take this to that hooded Aragorn, immediately.'","'I am to find kingsfoil leaves - living if I can and as much as possible. But truly, I do not know how I will find another single leaf! Does it grow in the cracks somewhere? I am sure I've seen it here or there, but I know not where! I am driving myself mad, thinking how often I walked past that very shape of leaf. \
\
'Will you help me? I fear to think what that Aragorn fellow will do with me if I do not. That kingsfoil must be about, must it not?  In cracks and greenswards, there must be some, somewhere!'","Aragorn has tasked Bergil with finding enough athelas, also known as kingsfoil, to treat every soldier afflicted with the Black Shadow.","Bring the kingsfoil to Bergil","Found some wild-growing kingsfoil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Find wild-growing kingsfoil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7798]={"Ask around for kingsfoil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the dried kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","'You were able to find some dried kingsfoil? By the kings of old, you have saved my hide! I will bring it to that Aragorn directly.'","Kingsfoil: Cut and Dried","Received dried kingsfoil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'What a bind I am! I found that hooded Aragorn a few dried leaves of kingsfoil or, what does he call it, athelas? Well, now he wants more. The old man who gave me those leaves has not any more. Will you help me? Somewhere about here, someone must have a few more dried leaves!'","Bring the kingsfoil to Bergil","Ask people in Minas Tirith for any dried kingsfoil leaves they may have.","Aragorn has tasked Bergil with finding enough athelas, also known as kingsfoil, to treat every soldier afflicted with the Black Shadow."},
[7799]={"Roba una piedra de la suerte","Rompecabezas","Amon Môth se encuentra al oeste y al sur de las Agujas de la Linde, y el túmulo que mencionó Erchiel está en algún lugar del borde norte de su campamento.\
\
Erchiel te ha pedido demostrar tu astucia robándole una piedra de la suerte a uno de los gigantes de Amon Môth.","Erchiel se encuentra en las Agujas de la Linde, al noreste de Amon Môth, cerca de la orilla del lago Evendim.\
\
Debes llevarle la piedra de la suerte.","Roba una piedra de la suerte a los gigantes de Amon Môth","Lleva la piedra de la suerte a Erchiel en las Agujas de la Linde","'¿Sin suerte aún?\
\
'Hasta donde recuerdo, el gigante en cuestión hace guardia cerca del borde norte de Amon Môth. Debería haber un pequeño túmulo de piedras cerca señalando el lugar.\
\
'Ten cuidado. Los gigantes no son muy listos, pero sí extremadamente fuertes.'","'Hay una banda de gigantes de las colinas que se han instalado en el borde occidental del bosque. Son brutos desagradables, y se dedican a derribar árboles y aplastar el matorral de tal forma que solo de pensarlo los nudos de Ramalarga se tensan.\
\
'Ahora bien, yo prefiero las batallas de astucia a las del acero cuando lidio con criaturas que me triplican en altura y tienen una décima parte de mi ingenio, así que te propongo este plan: desde hace algunos años he infundido en los gigantes un temor profundo a espíritus y duendecillos del bosque —no, no existen tales, al menos no por estos alrededores, pero los gigantes no lo saben. Luces titilantes entre los árboles, desapariciones inexplicables de objetos importantes, sonidos extraños e irreales... todo lo que podrías usar para asustar a niños y evitar que se adentren en un bosque peligroso. Los gigantes no son mucho más sabios que los niños, y el mismo truco los mantiene fuera de este bosque... la mayoría de las veces.\
\
'Los gigantes se han vuelto más atrevidos últimamente —quizá podrías... levantar los espíritus una vez más. Sé que uno de los gigantes que vigila los límites de su campamento tiene una piedra de la suerte muy preciada, que lleva siempre encima —una roca sin valor real, apostaría. Trata de arrebatársela cuando su atención esté en otra cosa. Dejé un pequeño túmulo de piedras cerca para ayudarte a crear una distracción. Muévete rápido y sin que te vean, o lo más probable es que te pisen.'","Robaste una piedra de la suerte","'¿Ya has vuelto, y nada menos que con el recuerdo del gigante? ¡Muy bien hecho!\
\
'Ahora que has demostrado estar a la altura, tengo una tarea algo más complicada para ti.'","'¿Ah, todavía sin suerte con los gigantes? Espero que no estés demasiado maltrecho. Sigue intentándolo y recuerda que, cuando la fuerza bruta y el glorioso filo del acero fallan, un poco de simple astucia suele bastar.'","La elfa Erchiel está preocupada por los gigantes que han estado arruinando el bosque."},
[7800]={"'Qué deliciosamente sucinto. Gracias.'","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Redacta un panfleto de Morgul.","La líder del Gremio de Eruditos te ha pedido que compiles tu investigación sobre el Enemigo en un panfleto para los Montaraces.","Habla con Ethel Manzanal","'¿Y bien?'","Entrega un panfleto de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","Ejecutada la receta para un panfleto de Morgul","'¡Minas Morgul, Valle de Morgul, Emblemas de Morgul! Uno pensaría que un enemigo tan poderoso sería capaz de ser un poco más creativo con sus nombres. Ve a traerme algunos registros de Minas Morgul. Compila tus hallazgos en un... panfleto de Morgul o algo así.'","Conoce al Enemigo - Análisis","Habla con la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","Ejecuta la receta para un panfleto de Morgul","Entrega un panfleto de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Ethel Manzanal"},
[7801]={"'Qué deliciosamente sucinto. Gracias.'","La líder del Gremio de Eruditos te ha pedido que redactes un informe sobre el Enemigo para la Compañía Blanca.","Habla con Ethel Manzanal","Entrega un informe de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Ethel Manzanal","Ejecuta la receta para un informe de Morgul","'¿Y bien?'","Conoce al Enemigo - Informes extensos","Entrega un informe de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Redacta un informe de Morgul.","Ejecutada la receta para un informe de Morgul","'La Compañía Blanca está pidiendo un informe sobre lo que hemos aprendido sobre lo que el enemigo ha estado haciendo en Minas Morgul. Estoy demasiado ocupado para escribirlo. Hazlo tú. ¿Cuánto tiempo podría llevar?'","Habla con la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul"},
[7802]={"'Qué deliciosamente sucinto. Gracias.'","'Oh, esto es... ¿cómo puede nuestro enemigo ser tan desorganizado y aun así hacernos la vida tan difícil? ¡Mira esto!'\
\
La Líder del Gremio agita un trozo de papel en tu cara.\
\
'Estas órdenes interceptadas solo dicen 'Mata a 10 hombres'. Apenas una estrategia. Ve a buscarme evidencia de un líder competente entre sus filas. Tiene que haber uno en alguna parte.'","Habla con Ethel Manzanal","'¿Y bien?'","Entrega un Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Ethel Manzanal","Ejecutada la receta para el Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Redacta un Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul.","Ejecuta la receta para un Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul","Conoce al Enemigo - Organigrama","La líder del Gremio de Eruditos te ha pedido que redactes un Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul para los Montaraces acampados en Minas Morgul.","Habla con la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","Entrega un Informe de Análisis de Liderazgo de Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul"},
[7803]={"Entrega la Tintura de Relajación de la líder del Gremio de Eruditos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Ethel Manzanal","La líder del Gremio de Eruditos te ha pedido que prepares su Tintura de Relajación especial, aunque no estás muy seguro de cuán relajante es en realidad....","Habla con Ethel Manzanal","'¿Y bien?'","Entrega la Tintura de Relajación de la líder del Gremio de Eruditos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","'La líder del gremio de artesanía dice que la mejor manera de relajarse es con una taza de té de hierbas. JA. La mejor manera de relajarse es, por supuesto, mi tintura de relajación mezclada a medida. ¡La tomo todo el tiempo y estoy extremadamente relajada siempre! ¡Prepárame varias muestras para llevar a nuestro gremio primo para que pueda mostrarles lo equivocados que están! Lo haría yo, pero me tiemblan demasiado las manos... por el café.'","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Prepara la Tintura de Relajación de la líder del Gremio de Eruditos.","Ejecutada la receta de la Tintura de Relajación de la líder del Gremio de Eruditos","Conoce al Enemigo - Relajación","Habla con la líder del Gremio de Eruditos en Minas Morgul","'Normalmente no es de ese color, pero creo que servirá.'","Ejecuta la receta de la Tintura de Relajación de la líder del Gremio de Eruditos"},
[7804]={"Libro recogido","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. ¡Este es un hallazgo magnífico!\
\
'¡Apenas puedo contener mi emoción ante la posibilidad de resolver este misterio que hemos descubierto!'","Derrota a Granbramido y recoge el libro","Lleva el libro a Winiel en la Bodega Putrefacta","Mirwen quedó complacida con los textos que le llevaste, pero tampoco pudo traducirlos de inmediato.","Granbramido se encuentra en algún lugar de las Obras Hidráulicas de Moria, muy al sur de Rivendel.\
\
Mirwen te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al sapo llamado Granbramido, pues hace mucho tiempo tragó un libro de saber enano.","Conocimiento del Sabio","'Me temo que debes aventurarte de nuevo en Moria y buscar en los rincones más profundos de las Obras Hidráulicas. Recorre los canales que dan nombre a este lugar.\
\
'Un sapo ancestral llamado Granbramido era conocido por sentirse atraído por objetos de gran conocimiento. Si llegas a encontrarlo, mátalo. ¡Es tan probable que el libro esté en su vientre como en cualquier otro lugar de Moria, si es que la criatura aún existe!\
\
'Una vez tengas el libro, llévaselo a Winiel. Con la ayuda de ese tomo, podrá traducir estos escritos.'","'¿Mirwen tenía algún consejo para nosotros, ${PLAYER}?'"},
[7810]={"'With the numbers of spiders and Orcs you have defeated, it may be many days before their forces are of any strength to attempt another siege near the Morgai.'","You ran out of time...","Defeat Dulgan.","Kála-murg: The Final Stand","Defeated Dulgan","'The Orc holdout is under attack. We must strike now!'","Talk to Candúr","'The valley of Lhingris, beyond the Morgai ridge, is becoming worse by each passing night, and still worse by each passing day. The hordes of Ungol spiders and other crawling beasts seem to have no end.\
\
'We have seen a group of spiders keep attacking the Orc holdout of Kála-murg. Perhaps for once we can work with the spiders and defeat this common enemy.\
\
'Are you willing to brave the valley of Lhingris once more?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest. This quest can be completed with one or two adventurers.</rgb>","You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","As the unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain, few Orcs remain in Lhingris.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Dulgan"},
[7811]={"'You have done well, friend. Your efforts will be duly noted!'","Derrota arañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arañas vencidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Candúr","Defeat spiders.","Talk to Candúr.","Kála-murg: The Hordes of Ungol","Elimina a las arañas","As the unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain, few Orcs remain in Lhingris.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Kála-murg: The Final Stand to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>"},
[7812]={"Gather silk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gathered silk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather silk","Bring the silk to Candúr","Bring the silk to Candúr.","'This is indeed a precious gift. I shall send this to our finest tailors in Minas Tirith to see that they make use of it.'","As the unrelenting forces of Ungol pour from the mountain, few Orcs remain in Lhingris.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Kála-murg: The Final Stand to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather silk.","Kála-murg: The Silken Gift"},
[7819]={"Lenn Dûskud, a small pond, is at Kêr Izel, within the Paths of the Dead, far to the north of Dol Amroth.\
\
Golusel asked you to venture to a pond within the Paths of the Dead and clear it of any foul objects.","'The Morthond, the great river that flows through these lands, begins from within the Paths of the Dead. Rumour is Lenn Dûskud, a pond within the ancient city, has been corrupted by the dead within. If those waters were to find their way into the Morthrond the entirety of this region would be irrevocably harmed.\
\
'Venture north to the Paths of the Dead, find this city and remove any ruthless rune-stones within this pond that could corrupt the waters.'","'With the Ruthless Dead angry and stirred up, we will have to watch these waters more closely.'","Kêr Izel - Lenn Dûskud","A pool of foetid water is in the ancient city within the Paths of the Dead.","Removed ruthless rune-stones from Lenn Dûskud (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Golusel is in Dol Amroth.\
\
Golusel will be pleased to hear the waters have been cleansed.","Remove ruthless rune-stones from Lenn Dûskud (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7826]={"Muestra la reina de las moscas del pantano a alguien en la Cabaña del Cazador","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","La Cabaña del Cazador está al este de Archet.\
\
Debes llevar el cadáver de la reina de las moscas del pantano a la Cabaña del Cazador para ver si alguien tiene más información para ti.","Has matado a una reina de las moscas del pantano de aspecto verdaderamente peculiar.","Dama de las Moscas","<rgb=#00e4ff>¡Esta misión ha sido restaurada para los Servidores Legendarios!</rgb>\
\
Las marcas en esta reina de moscas de pantano no se parecen a ninguna de las que hayas oído antes. Seguramente alguien en la Cabaña del Cazador querrá verla.","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! ¡Este es un hallazgo realmente peculiar!'"},
[7827]={"'Because the frost-bound hobgoblins rule the Pit of Stonejaws, it is very likely there is a Frost-horde presence here as well. The drakes are the masters in that relationship, after all. I have sent Molkha to find the drakes and observe them. Look for her on the eastern side of the pit. If she has succeeded in finding them, do what you can to disrupt the drakes. When we eventually assault Shakhajât. We're better off if the Frost-horde doesn't come to fight on the side of the hobgoblins.'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. Keep your voice down. The cave ahead teems with frost-drakes and their spawn! I expect Ausma sent you to see if I had found the drake-nest and if I had, to deal with them at once. Well, I have, so you should!'","Complete 'Quelling the Horde'","Talk to Molkha","The goblin runs for its life","Find Molkha","'I saw you fighting in there. I guess Ausma was right about you. You certainly are skilled! But what did that goblin give you?'\
\
You show Molkha the strange red crystal. She gingerly takes it from you, and winces. She holds it up to one ear, listening carefully. Her eyes widen. She then hands it back to you.\
\
'I can hear... screaming? Whatever this is, I don't want it! You should take it to Ausma right away. If Loknashra had it, it probably came from the Angmarim!'","Molkha needs your help.","Complete 'Food for Their Young'","Molkha has been sent to find the frost-drakes inside the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should find Molkha somewhere in the tunnels east of Bárgstad.","Complete 'Frost-bound Nest-tenders'","'Ack! No, stay away! Wait, you not hobgoblin? You maybe... help me? Me don't want to end up drake food!'\
\
The goblin senses your distrust, and changes his tactics.\
\
'Please, wait! I'll make trade! Warlord sent me here for thieving, but I kept some of the shinies. You take, and you let me go, yes?'\
\
You agree to the deal, and cut the goblin loose. The goblin cackles gleefully and produces a red crystal from under his belt. He holds it out to you, and you allow him to place it in your hand.\
\
'Here! I took this from big hobgoblin lady. She not nice. You take, I go!'\
\
Something feels off about the crystal, besides the stink of goblin upon it. You think Ausma should see this.","Lair of the Frost-horde","Complete 'If You Want to Make a Hearty Egg Breakfast...'","You should return to Molkha.","Molkha has been sent to investigate a frost-drake nest in the Pit of Stonejaws.","Find information about Loknashra"},
[7828]={"Debes llevar a Lalia a la Puerta Norte de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Lalia te ha pedido que la ayudes a regresar a Bree sana y salva. Además, te ha pedido ayuda para encontrar la capa que perdió en algún lugar de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Debes protegerla mientras busca su capa y luego escoltarla fuera de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Te has encontrado con una joven hobbit muy asustada, Lalia, en las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Te ha pedido ayuda para regresar a Bree y reunirse con su padre, Bob, quien trabaja para Cebadilla Mantecona en El Poney Pisador.","Has escoltado a Lalia fuera de las Quebradas de los Túmulos con seguridad.","Lleva la capa de Lalia a Bob.","'¡Oh, qué alivio! Parece que conozco bien a mi hija. En efecto, fue tras ese \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q suyo. Bueno, tal vez haya aprendido la lección y no vuelva a hacer semejante tontería. Yo, desde luego, no volveré jamás a este lugar.\
\
'Espero poder sobrevivir a su veintena. Tal vez entonces desarrolle algo de sentido común hobbit. Tal vez...'","'¡Ojalá el señor Mantecona no contara historias como \\qEl Último Príncipe\\q!'","'¡Gracias por traer a mi Lalia de regreso a casa!'","Escolta a Lalia hasta un lugar seguro.","'¡Oh, por favor, ayuda a mi hija a regresar a Bree sana y salva! ¡Yo llegaré a tiempo!'","Bob puede encontrarse en el Camino del Bosque Viejo, entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Has ayudado a Lalia a regresar a casa. En agradecimiento, te ha dado su capa. Te ha pedido que se la lleves a su padre, Bob, el asistente de Cebadilla Mantecona, como prueba de que está a salvo. No tuviste corazón para decirle que Bob la estaba buscando dentro de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Paso Seguro de Lalia","'Vine aquí a buscar al \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q, como en las historias del señor Mantecona. ¡Iba a encontrarlo, y luego estaría con él para siempre y sería su princesa! ¡Pero no estaba aquí! ¡Solo hay esqueletos, huesos y muertos que caminan! ¡No está bien engañar así a los jóvenes hobbits!\
\
'Cuando estés con fuerzas para partir, ¿podrías ayudarme a regresar a casa en Bree? Antes no podía irme, pero ahora que tengo una compañía tan poderosa como tú, ¡estoy segura de que podrás llevarme a casa sana y salva!\
\
'¡Ah, y perdí mi capa! ¡Tengo que encontrarla, o papá me va a gritar terriblemente!'"},
[7829]={"La hija de Bob, Lalia, ha desaparecido, y Bob teme que haya ido en busca del \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q, un personaje de uno de los cuentos que Cebadilla Mantecona relata a los viajeros.","Has escoltado a Lalia fuera de las Quebradas de los Túmulos con seguridad.","Escolta a Lalia hasta un lugar seguro.","Habla con Lalia","<rgb=#FF0000>Lalia debe sobrevivir</rgb>","Lalia te ha pedido que la ayudes a regresar a Bree de manera segura. Además, te ha pedido ayuda para encontrar la capa que dejó caer en algún lugar de la Quebrada de los Túmulos. Debes protegerla mientras busca su capa y luego abandona la Quebrada de los Túmulos.","No lograste proteger a Lalia","Has encontrado a Lalia entre los Túmulos del Norte y el Pináculo de los Caídos, como se esperaba. Deberías hablar con la niña llorando.","Acércate a Lalia","'¡Qué alivio! Parece que conozco bien a mi hija. De hecho, <i>había</i> ido tras ese \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q suyo. Bueno, tal vez haya aprendido la lección y no sea tan tonta en el futuro. Sé que ciertamente nunca volveré aquí.\
\
'Espero poder sobrevivir a su adolescencia. Tal vez entonces adquiera un poco de sentido hobbit. Tal vez...'","Se esperaba que Lalia estuviera entre los Túmulos del Norte y el Pináculo de los Caídos, donde se dice que el \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q fue enterrado, y es exactamente allí donde la encontraste. Deberías acercarte a la niña llorando.","Paso Seguro de Lalia","'Vine aquí a buscar al \\qÚltimo Príncipe\\q, como en las historias del señor Mantecona. ¡Iba a encontrarlo, y luego estaría con él para siempre y sería su princesa! ¡Pero no estaba aquí! ¡Solo hay esqueletos, huesos y muertos que caminan! ¡No está bien engañar así a los jóvenes hobbits!\
\
'Cuando estés con fuerzas para partir, ¿podrías ayudarme a regresar a casa en Bree? Antes no podía irme, pero ahora que tengo una compañía tan poderosa como tú, ¡estoy segura de que podrás llevarme a casa sana y salva!\
\
'¡Ah, y perdí mi capa! ¡Tengo que encontrarla, o papá me va a gritar terriblemente!'"},
[7830]={"Muchos Montaraces han caído mientras defendían la ciudad de Angmar. Deberían ser honrados.","Honra a los Montaraces caídos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orchalwë se alegrará de saber que honraste a los Montaraces caídos.","'Han muerto tantos para proteger este lugar... Han hecho el máximo sacrificio para preservar ruinas, recuerdos, pedazos y jirones de una historia que se escapa cada día más.\
\
'Es por eso que debemos hacer todo lo posible para recordar, para preservar lo que queda, para honrar sus sacrificios.\
\
'Estas flores hace mucho que solo crecen aquí en Evendim. Tómalas y coloca una sobre cada uno de los caídos. De Evendim vinieron, y a Annúminas regresarán.'","Lamento de los caídos","Muchos Montaraces han caído defendiendo Annúminas de las fuerzas de Angmar.","'¿Cuántos hombres buenos más deben perecer? Y todo en nombre del poder...'","Habla con Orchalwë","Montaraces caídos honrados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7831]={"Carefully collect a sample of Trollstrife","Deliver the Trollstrife to Mílgamel at Haerondir","Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir in the eastern reaches of the Noman-lands.\
\
You have carefully gathered the Trollstrife and should now deliver it to Mílgamel at Haerondir.","You carefully gather the lichen and stash it in a pouch...","Trollstrife can be found on the sides of trees in the Noman-lands.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to gather Trollstrife and then meet her at Haerondir in the Noman-lands.","'Ah, what a strange lichen... it is both flaky and damp at once.\
\
'Those properties seem ideal for its use as a poison, but I wonder how it might be used in combination with other flora from these lands and from the lands of Ithilien.\
\
'I shall think on this for a time, ${PLAYER}. In the meantime, I have another task for you.'","As she prepares to depart for Haerondir, Mílgamel asks for your aid in finding a sample of Trollstrife - the mysterious lichen that you discovered during your adventures in Ithilien.","Land of Strife","'I am certain you have heard, ${PLAYER}, but this company shall soon depart.\
\
'I have secured passage alongside the Rangers to an old ruin known as Haerondir, but that is as far as I dare go into these lands.\
\
'If your journeys in the Wastes take you beyond the edges of the battered road eastward, I would be pleased if you could find for me a sample of Trollstrife. That is the name of the lichen we sought, and according to Worts and Weeds, it seems to grow on the trunks of the few trees that remain in the Wastes.\
\
'Even one sample will do, but please, do be careful! Do not handle it with your bare hands!\
\
'I hope your travels are safe, my friend, and I shall meet you at Haerondir.'"},
[7839]={"'I am surprised you failed this mission. You have never let me down before.'","'I have spied some horses corralled at the western end of Lang Rhuven. To the Easterlings, they are message-bearers, swift scouts, and swifter still to strike or evade in combat. What is more, I know these vile men are savage in the mistreatment of their steeds. Free these horses, and we hobble the Easterlings in all things.'","The horses are now free and safe from the Easterlings","'Well done ${PLAYER}! This deed will be felt sorely by the Easterlings.\
\
'While you were away, I was able to track the movement of foes near the Morannon. It seems they may already be adjusting their tactics.'","A horse has been defeated!","Return to Candúr","Find the horses","Horses can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should free the horses in Lang Rhuven.","The horses look reluctant but willing to follow you.","Lang Rhuven: The Escape","Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","The horses flee back into the encampment","Do not let every horse be defeated","You can tell by the scars, these horses have not been treated well.","Free the horses in Lang Rhuven","Freed the horses in Lang Rhuven.","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.","You must lead the horses through the encampment"},
[7840]={"You have defeated many of the tower-guards within the enemy encampment of Lang Rhuven. With their guard towers unmanned, you should be able to strike your foes again with ease.","Defeated Khundolar tower-guards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Khundolar tower-guards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The encampment of Lang Rhuven is heavily guarded. Perhaps you and your allies would be able to curb their vigilance by defeating some of the men who perch on the guard towers scattered throughout the camp. May your arrows hit their target, my friend!'","Defeated many Khundolar tower-guards at Lang Rhuven.","Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","Completado","Tower-guards can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should defeat tower-guards found in Lang Rhuven.","Lang Rhuven: The Guards"},
[7841]={"Candúr has been monitoring the Enemy in Lang Rhuven and believes that now is the time to attack the camp.","Destroyed trebuchets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Easterling supply tents and trebuchets can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should destroy supply tents and trebuchets found in Lang Rhuven.","'Lang Rhuven is unquestionably a threat. There are many more enemies gathered there than elsewhere within the Slag-hills or Dagorlad. You and your allies must enter the gap of Lang Rhuven and disrupt them as you may. Destroying their supply tents and trebuchets should do.'","Completado","Destroyed supply tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lang Rhuven: The Siege","Destroy supply tents in Lang Rhuven (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have caused a considerable amount of damage to the enemy structures at Lang Rhuven. The Easterling forces will certainly have a difficult time rebuilding after that incursion.","Destroy trebuchets in Lang Rhuven (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Caused much damage to the enemies at Lang Rhuven."},
[7842]={"Lang Rhuven: The War-leaders","Defeated Khatikhôl","Return to Candúr","'Yet again you return triumphant. You and your allies are no match for any foe. You have done well in aiding the Rangers, and I thank you for your efforts, however, our work is far from done here.'","Candúr has learned of the two leaders who control all forces in Lang Rhuven.","Defeat Khatikhôl","Khatikhôl and Dashat Khôz can be found in Lang Rhuven on the border of Dagorlad.\
\
You should defeat Khatikhôl and Dashat Khôz.","Defeat Dashat Khôz","Defeated Dashat Khôz","'It seems there are two Easterlings who control the forces in Lang Rhuven. Khatikhôl is a war-master and expert tactician. Dashat Khôz is learned in arts that seem other-worldly. Defeat these two before the battle is joined and you halve the might of all who follow them.'","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills."},
[7843]={"Return to Candúr","A war-party will be entering Lang Rhuven from the eastern end of the encampment.\
\
You should defeat the war-party before they get to the camp.","'Another victory! Well done! We have compromised and thwarted the Easterlings at Lang Rhuven at every turn. I, for one, no longer fear the last or the poison of their sting.'","Defeat the war-party entering Lang Rhuven","Do not let the war-party into Lang Rhuven","A war-party approaches Lang Rhuven from the east to reinforce the Easterlings there.","The war-party has been defeated!","You have let the war-party into Lang Rhuven!","Lang Rhuven: The War-party","'It seems we may have a slight problem. Your previous efforts in Lang Rhuven did not go unnoticed. Now a war-party has been spotted on the road east of Lang Rhuven; they must have been dispatched to reinforce the encampment. You and your allies must make haste to the edge of the eastern road in Lang Rhuven and prevent the war-party from joining up with the rest of the Easterling forces.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the eastern end of Lang Rhuven unguarded</rgb>","Stand your ground and defeat the war-party","You should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills."},
[7844]={"Defeated gredbyg and rats at Langraf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'One day, Langraf will be restored to its full glory.'","Langraf has fallen into disrepair and gredbyg have filled the tombs.","Talk to Waldeg","'Few outsiders have ever wandered the halls of Langraf.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Gredbyg and rats can be found at Langraf.\
\
Waldeg has asked you to venture within Langraf and clean out the gredbyg and rats found within.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear you have helped to clean the gredbyg and rats out of Langraf.","Defeat gredbyg and rats at Langraf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Langraf: Defilers of the Dead","'It is not enough to remember the fallen, we must honour them. Before the Enemy came to our lands, we kept Langraf pristine, but with the never-ending battles in the field, it has fallen into disrepair. Worse yet, it has become infested.\
\
'Head into Langraf and clean out the gredbyg and rats that you find lurking within. Our ancestors deserve better than we have given them.'"},
[7845]={"Pay your respects at the second tomb","Pay your respects at the third tomb","'Perhaps one day, someone may honour us in these same ways.'","Many noble warriors are buried within the halls of Langraf.","'Langraf is a sacred place for my people: treat it with care and respect.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","'The Rohirrim have forgotten and lost more knowledge about battle than we shall ever know. Great victories have been won that are little more than tattered memories. We are only here because of the sacrifices of those who came before.\
\
'Head into Langraf and honour the fallen who have fought the battles that we now take for granted. Find their tombs and kneel before them.'","Talk to Waldeg","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Langraf: Honouring the Ancients","You have paid your respects","Waldeg is at Snowbourn.\
\
Waldeg will be pleased to hear that you honoured his ancestors and remembered their sacrifice.","The tombs can be found within Langraf.\
\
Waldeg has asked you to venture into Langraf, find the tombs of his ancestors, and honour them by kneeling before them.","Pay your respects at the first tomb"},
[7846]={"Lanterns Aglow","'You are here to help with the preparations for tonight's feast? Ah! We shall make the night glow with lantern-light.\
\
'The lanterns line the path on the other side of this gate. When night falls, I would like you to light them for me.'","'The lanterns are lit? Very good, ${PLAYER}.'","'Have you finished lighting the lanterns along the path yet?'","There are lanterns along the path between Imlad Lalaith and Caras Galadhon. Wait for night fall, and then light them to help lead revellers to the feast.\
\
As part of the preparations for the evening feast, Galhíril would like you to light the lanterns that will lead the evening revellers to the banquet.","Maliriel has asked you to help her companions finish the prepartions for the upcoming banquet.","Talk to Galhíril at Imlad Lalaith","Galhíril is at Imlad Lalaith.\
\
You should return to Galhíril with your report.","'Anyone here could find their way here blindfolded, but the lanterns are an ancient tradition that brings us comfort in dark times.'","Lit lanterns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Light lanterns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7847]={"Deber de Despensa","Los platos no parecen estar más limpios que cuando los recogiste, pero tendrá que servir","Dentro de las mazmorras de Barad-dûr, una despensa repugnante alimenta a los numerosos siervos del Señor Oscuro.","Colocas los platos limpios sobre una mesa cercana","Los platos limpios pueden encontrarse en la Despensa Repugnante, en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Recoge platos sucios en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Inspecciona los platos limpios","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Los platos sucios pueden encontrarse por las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Se puede encontrar una tina de lavado en la Despensa Repugnante, en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Limpia los platos en la tina de lavado de la Despensa Repugnante","Platos sucios recogidos en las mazmorras de Barad-dûr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7849]={"Quickbeam has thought of how he next wishes to honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Quickbeam is ready to speak to you at Derndingle.","Lassemista enjoyed long talks with Treebeard. Quickbeam believes saying good-bye to Wellinghall will honour his memory.\
\
Wellinghall can be found in west Fangorn.","Quickbeam has remembered how he next wishes to honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Quickbeam is ready to speak to you at Derndingle.","'There is one more thing I can think of. Lassemista trusted Saruman, and I know he was deeply wounded by the betrayal. I have planted a seed for Lassemista at Orthanc. To show my sadness, please visit it and let Lassemista know I remember him with a tear.'","Say <rgb=#FF0000>bye</rgb> to Wellinghall","'I need time to remember what the next step is.'","One of Lassemista's favourite places was a great tree. Quickbeam believes bowing before it will honour his memory.\
\
The tree can be found in the north-east of Fangorn.","Speak to Quickbeam","<rgb=#FF0000>Bow</rgb> before the ancient tree","Quickbeam has planted a seed to his fallen friend Lassemista at Isengard. He wishes to honour the memory of his friend.","Quickbeam will wish to speak to you about Lassemista.\
\
Quickbeam is at Derndingle.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> at the small island","Lassemista's Seed is at Isengard","'On many occasions, Lassemista enjoyed long conversations with Treebeard. To next honour him, I think we should say good-bye to Wellinghall.'","'I left Lassemista's Seed at Isengard. It will grow and watch the tower, ensuring no evil will come to it again. Lassemista loved to walk the forest though, and I wish to honour his memory.'","Lassemista's Seed","<rgb=#FF0000>Bow</rgb> before the tree to honour Lassemista","Quickbeam and Lassemista used to watch the river from a small island. Quickbeam asked you to go there and have a look around.\
\
The island is in the river in the centre of Fangorn.","Find the ancient tree","'Lassemista was my closest friend. He loved the forest more than most others. I will miss him for a very long time.'","'I spent many hours with Lassemista watching the river that feeds the forest. There is a small island; having a good look around there feels right.'","Quickbeam needs to ponder what else would honour Lassemista's memory.\
\
Return to Quickbeam at Derndingle to hear what he has to say.","Shed a <rgb=#FF0000>tear</rgb> at Lassemista's Seed","Return to Quickbeam","Find the small island","Return to Quickbeam to hear what he has to say","Quickbeam ponders what to do next. Time passes...","Quickbeam wishes to honour Lassemista by showing he misses him with a single tear.\
\
Lassemista's seed has been planted at Isengard.","Find Wellinghall"},
[7850]={"'You... look different. Not like them. Those filthy scoundrels. I never thought life would be like this. When I first set out for the isles....\
\
'I've underestimated just how cruel and rough the life of a pirate is. Your life is constantly at risk and people walk all over you.\
\
'But I've a plan. They don't take kindly to deserters but I've a boat near the western coast. If I could get the necessary supplies to make her sea-worthy I might just be able to be free.'","Balidan has asked you to collect some spare parts for his escape. The parts can be found within Mâr Naphra's off-limits storage.","Collect pillaged rations (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pillaged rations collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have successfully collected everything Balidan needs to make his escape. Deliver them to the meeting point.\
\
Balidan is waiting on the coast south-west of Mâr Naphra.","Find spare oars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Meet with Balidan","Balidan expresses that he severely misjudged the life of a pirate. He desires your help in planning an escape.","'You made it, and you have the things! I'll finally be able to go home! I can't thank you enough, stranger. These are dark times indeed, but the light shines forth where it can!'","Spare oars found (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Last Chance Escape"},
[7851]={"'Debes de ser quien ofreció ayuda a Delum. Me ha dicho lo que pasó antes... antes de...\
\
'Al menos... Sabe que he sobrevivido.\
\
'Haré todo lo posible por ella. Por favor, déjame. Quiero estar en soledad.'","Los restos de los amigos de Delun han sido hallados.\
\
Deberías volver con ella en las afueras de Gond Orchal.","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Deberías empezar por Einion.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Einion","Habla con Muna","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Melwyn es la última persona que tienes que encontrar.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Melwyn","El espíritu se desvanece en la nada, abandonando su cólera","La mujer ensangrentada te mira en shock. Se encoge y se prepara para huir antes de darse cuenta de algo.\
\
'Tú... no eres un tumulario. ¿Has venido a rescatarnos? Por favor, encuentra a mis amigos. Mataron a Muna primero, y luego nos llevaron al resto al interior de los túmulos. Conseguí salir, pero... Einion, Curig, Melwyn... Están en alguna parte más al noroeste.\
\
'Por favor, si encuentras... lo que queda de ellos, quémalos. Mis heridas pueden esperar.'","Una brisa solemne silba por los túmulos","Puede que sea demasiado tarde para rescatar a la gente que está dentro de Gond Orchal, pero pueden ser salvados en la muerte.","La atmósfera angustiante se disipa inmediatamente","Delun te ha pedido que encuentres lo que queda de sus amigos y quemes sus cuerpos. Están en algún lugar al noroeste de la ubicación de Delun.\
\
Ahora debes buscar a Curig.","Encuentra y quema el cuerpo de Curig","Vuelve con Delun fuera de Gond Orchal","Una persona extraña mira en silencio el cuerpo inerte de Delun","Últimas voluntades","Has vuelto demasiado tarde.\
\
La extraña tiene algo que decirte."},
[7856]={"Minas Angos es una torre de Barad Gúlaran, al sur de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gúlaran y derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada, el emisario de los Duramano, dentro de Minas Angos. Brúnfair te ha recomendado que lleves aliados contigo.","Tras descubrir la voluntad de los Duramano de forjar una alianza, debes entrar en Minas Angos y derrotar a su emisario para impedir que combinen fuerzas con la Corona de Hierro.","'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y los Durmano. Nuestros exploradores nos han dicho que un emisario de los Duramano ha venido para tratar con Angmar.\
\
'Debes investigar el asunto. Ha habido muchos informes de enanos cerca de la torre de Minas Angos cerca de Barad Gúlaran. Debemos impedir que esta alianza ocurra, cueste lo que cueste.\
\
'Derrota al emisario, Laugi Lenguadorada, y vuelve a verme cuando la hazaña esté hecha. Si quieres tener éxito, deberías llevar aliados contigo.'","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnír, al norte de Barad Gúlaran.\
\
Tras derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada, deberías volver a ver a Brúnfair y hablarle de tu victoria.","'Laugi Lenguadorada debe ser derrotado. De lo contrario, la Corona de Hierro y los Duramano forjarán una temible alianza.'","Laugi Lenguadorada, emisario de los Duramano","'La caída del emisario de los Duramano seguro cortará de raíz la alianza entre estas dos fuerzas malignas. Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}.'","Entra en Minas Angos y derrota al emisario de los Duramano."},
[7857]={"'Entonces, Gathrok ha caído. Eso debería hacer que los trasgos vuelvan a dar un paso atrás en sus intentos de organizarse contra nosotros.'","Acaba con trasgos en Gamil Filik (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acaba con Gathrok","Trasgo derrotado en Gamil Filik (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Desde que la expedición de enanos entró en Moria, ha habido demasiados encuentros con trasgos.","Stíling se esconde a las afueras de Gamil Filik, en las VEtas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Stíling y decirle que has conseguido derrotar a Gathrok.","Habla con Stíling","'Creo que sería mejor para todos que el trasgo Gathrok no viviera mucho más tiempo...'","Gathrok ha sido derrotado","Anarquía entre los trasgos","Gathrok y sus trasgos se encuentran en Gamil Filik, al sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Stíling te ha pedido que derrotes a Gathrok, un jefe trasgo, y que debilites sus fuerzas.","'Bueno, ${PLAYER}, hasta ahora hemos tenido suerte, ya que los trasgos que infestan Khazad-dûm parecen estar terriblemente desorganizados y tener líderes incompetentes.\
\
'No obstante, no podemos bajar la guardia. Si no me equivoco, hay un líder en particular entre la tribu de trasgos cercana que ha sido lo suficientemente audaz como para organizar una incursión contra el Descenso Profundo, y creo que sería mejor que no viviera lo suficiente como para llevar a cabo su plan.\
\
'A ver si puedes debilitar las fuerzas trasgo en Gamil Filik y, de paso, ocuparte de su jefe'"},
[7858]={"'Hail, ${PLAYER}! Falasgon was right to send you to me. The Orcs of Dol Guldur mustering in the Mirk-eaves were well nigh destroyed, but a few survived and have holed up in the ruins of their encampments, attempting to regroup against us.\
\
'One such encampment is Durbúrz-stazg, which lies just to the north of Echad Sirion. While the encampment was severely damaged in our first assault, it may still only be entered through two gateways.\
\
'Go north and find the gateways into Durbúrz-stazg and determine which one is the least heavily guarded; it is upon that gate that we shall lean our assault.'","'Scout the gates of Durbúrz-stazg; we must determine the best way into the camp.'","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","'You met resistance at both gates? Tell me more.'","Scout the eastern gate of Durbúrz-stazg","The Elves of the Golden Host seek a way to cripple the Orcs of Durbúrz-stazg.","Lay of the Land","Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion.\
\
Aemeldir has asked you to scout the gates of Durbúrz-stazg to determine which is the least guarded.","Scout the southern gate of Durbúrz-stazg","Aemeldir is at Echad Sirion, south of Durbúrz-stazg.\
\
You should return to Aemeldir with the results of your patrol.","This gate is only lightly guarded","This gate is heavily guarded"},
[7860]={"'Lamentablemente, Ferndúr escapó. Es un enemigo terrible y representa una amenaza incluso para el poder de Rivendel. Debemos mantenernos vigilantes.\
\
'Regresa con el señor Elrond y cuéntale cómo nos fue contra el Señor Demacrado.'","Habla con Glorfindel","Habla con Elrond","'¡Partamos de inmediato, entonces!'","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Debes hablar con él acerca del enfrentamiento con Ferndúr el Virulento.","Dando Descanso a los Muertos Malvados","Has ayudado a Glorfindel a derrotar a Ferndúr y a sus esbirros","Elrond está en su biblioteca en el piso superior de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Glorfindel te pidió regresar con Elrond y darle un informe sobre el enfrentamiento con Ferndúr.","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Debes hablar con Glorfindel cuando puedas marchar contra Ferndúr y sus esbirros.","'Así que es tal como temía. Un Señor Demacrado ha llegado al Bosque de los Trolls siguiendo el rastro del Nazgûl y está alzando un ejército contra Rivendel.\
\
'El señor Elrond tiene razón. Debemos hacer frente a esta criatura de inmediato, y debo ser yo quien lo haga. Te pido que me acompañes para derrotar a los esbirros del Señor Demacrado... pero no intentes enfrentarte a Ferndúr en soledad, pues te destruiría.\
\
'Háblame cuando puedas partir.'","'Tras meditar largamente lo que me informaste sobre las zonas occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls, estoy convencido de que los siervos del Enemigo no fueron atraídos aquí por la breve presencia del Nazgûl que pasó hace poco, sino que responden a uno de los Señores Demacrados... burlas de los Magos creadas por Morgoth hace mucho tiempo.\
\
'Basándome en los poderes de este Gúrdring con el que te enfrentaste en Nan Tornaeth, creo que el Señor Demacrado es Ferndúr el Virulento, maestro de la pestilencia. Debe ser derrotado a toda costa, pero no puedo enviar a alguien como tú en solitario para enfrentarlo. Su poder es demasiado grande.\
\
'Solo tres dentro de este valle son lo bastante fuertes para oponerse a un Señor Demacrado, y ni Gandalf ni yo podemos partir ahora. Por tanto, te pido que hables con Glorfindel y le informes de lo que hemos descubierto. No tengo duda de que te acompañará contra este mal.'","Glorfindel está afuera de la Última Morada, en Rivendel, cerca de la cascada.\
\
Elrond te pidió hablar con Glorfindel y obtener su ayuda contra Ferndúr el Virulento.","'El señor Glorfindel tiene razón. El escape de Ferndúr significa que los Elfos de Rivendel deben mantenerse vigilantes. Con un mal tan grande suelto en el mundo, la seguridad de Rivendel se vuelve aún más importante.\
\
'Aun así, gracias por tu ayuda... por ahora, al menos, Ferndúr ha sido frenado.'","Elrond cree que podría haber uno de los temidos Señores Demacrados detrás de los males del Bosque de los Trolls.","Habla con Glorfindel para marchar contra Ferndúr y sus esbirros"},
[7861]={"'Los Elfos de Gwingris están en deuda contigo, ${PLAYER}. Gracias.'","Derrota a Zagâfum","'Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Tus esfuerzos serán recordados.\
\
'Por favor, cuéntame lo que has averiguado. Solo espero que nos hayamos librado de esta amenaza de una vez por todas.'","Habla con Lithuilas en Gwingris","Lithuilas está en Gwingris, al norte de Sâd Thareg.\
\
Deberíamos volver a ver a Lithuilas con las noticias de tu victoria.","'Parece que nuestro trabajo en Glâd Ereg todavía no está completo. Nuestros exploradores nos informan de que los trolls silvanos tienen un claro líder, que es quien organiza sus malvados planes contra el bosque.\
\
'No debemos permitir que esta abominación continúe. El líder de los trolls silvanos debe ser destruido. Reúne a tus compañeros y aventúrate hacia el bosque del sur una vez más. Allí encontrarás la cueva de Sâd Thareg, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Dentro de la cueva encontrarás todo tipo de trolls silvanos, sin duda. También encontrarás a su líder, Zagâfum. Derrota al líder de los trolls silvanos y vuelve a verme cuando la tarea haya sido completada.'","'Los trolls, aunque sean trolls silvanos, prefieren las cuevas al cielo abierto. Busca la cueva de Sâd Thareg en Glâd Ereg, al sur.\
\
'Es posible que los trolls hayan excavado su propia guarida intentando perturbar y corromper al bosque.'","Zagâfum, el líder de los trolls silvanos, se encuentra en la cueva de Sâd Thareg, al sur de Gwingris.\
\
Lithuilas te ha pedido que derrotes a Zagâfum.","El líder de los trolls silvanos ha sido descubierto en Glâd Ereg. Esta podría ser una oportunidad para terminar con su amenaza en el bosque de acebos de una vez por todas.","Líder de la madera malvada"},
[7862]={"Use the horn to draw Dargum's attention and defeat Grazadh","The Nink-hai threat looms ever present. Langfrith believes that the only solution will be to defeat the Nink-hai's commander.","The Nink-hai leader can be found at the end of the mountain pass in the mountains.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and defeat the leader of the tribe.","You have defeated Grazadh, but Dargum has escaped","'A scout has reported that the Nink-hai Orcs are plotting and scheming in the eastern mountain passes. There is but one course of action if we are ever to delay their treachery: to confront and defeat their leader.\
\
'You must breach the enemy camp, ${PLAYER}. Locate and overthrow the Nink-hai task-master. His defeat should throw the lackeys into a state of panic and chaos, granting us an opportunity to better prepare our defences before dealing with the rest.'","Leader of the Nink-hai","'It is regrettable that their leader was able to flee, but if this Dargum has truly fled from the Nink-hai encampment, the result is much the same to me. Without a task-master's commands, the remnants of their tribe will likely disband their plot and set out for easier prey.\
\
'Knowing that this danger has subsided, I must now concentrate entirely on the coming siege of Faldham. Praises upon you, ${PLAYER}. You are a worthy ally.'","Explore the Nink-hai camp along the mountain path east of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to infiltrate the Orc camp and discover the leader of the tribe.","Enter the Nink-hai camp and locate their leader","Langfrith awaits outside the mead hall of Faldham.\
\
Langfrith will want to hear of the events that transpired with the Nink-hai leader.","You have discovered the location of Dargum, the Nink-hai leader","Return to Langfrith and inform him of Dargum's escape","The horn has drawn Dargum's attention"},
[7865]={"'You did it! That is a job well done, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
You tell Isteron what the Orc said before the battle, and the lore-master shrugs.\
\
'I do not know what he was talking about, ${PLAYER}. Maybe he thought you were someone else? It does not matter now, I suppose.\
\
'Thank you for all your help! I do not need anything else right now, so you can just let yourself out. The southernmost exit from the Under-wall should leave you right near the camp my companions established, if you would like to help them as you have helped me.'","Find and defeat an Under-wall Captain in the Under-wall","'While you were away, I did some research, and I have determined from where these Orcs came. They are from Moria, deep beneath the Misty Mountains. According to conversations I overheard while examining the moss that grows down here in the Under-walls, they came to this place by following a trail of some kind.\
\
'I do not know what they were following, but it sounds like they skirted some \\qElf-woods.\\q That has to be the Golden Wood I have heard so much about! It is no wonder that they avoided it, but I am surprised that they have come this far from Moria in pursuit of their prey.\
\
'It is only right that these Orcs be sent back to Moria! If you find one of their leaders, challenge him to combat and defeat him to send a message to his underlings!'","Talk to Isteron","Leaders of the Moria Orcs can be found in the northernmost and southernmost side passages in the Under-wall.\
\
Isteron wants you to send a message to the Moria Orcs by challenging one of their leaders in battle.","'You led us on a pretty chase, ${RACE}! But now it's the end of the road for you, and me and my boys will bring you back to Moria in pieces!\
\
'You were right to abandon your Wizard on that bridge! You would have died with him if you had stayed and fought instead of running away and hiding in the Elf-woods. But now we've found you, and it's the end for you!'","Isteron is by the northernmost exit from the Under-wall.\
\
You have defeated a Moria Orc-leader and should return to tell Isteron of your success.","'Look for the leaders of the Moria Orcs in some of the side passages you explored here in the Under-wall, ${PLAYER}.'","Leaders from Moria","You have defeated the Under-wall Captain","Isteron wants you to defeat one of the leaders from Moria that leads the Orcs in the Under-wall."},
[7866]={"'Apreciamos mucho tus esfuerzos, ${PLAYER}.'","'Hay demasiados trasgos, si me preguntas a mí... pero bueno, uno ya sería demasiado. Si están tan organizados, debe de haber alguien que los dirija... alguien cuya autoridad teman.\
\
'Debemos mantenernos vigilantes, ${PLAYER}.","Encuentra y derrota a Farmak el Mejor Corredor","Líderes de las Profundidades","Los líderes trasgos Zagh, Dâgal y Farmak moran dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. La Ciudad de los Trasgos se encuentra al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Vighar Trotasendas te ha encomendado dar caza y derrotar a varios líderes en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Encuentra y derrota a Dâgal el Vigía","Habla con Vighar Trotasendas en el campamento de Glóin, fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Farmak el Mejor Corredor derrotado","Dâgal el Vigía derrotado","'Encuentra a los líderes trasgos en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Cuando te hayas encargado de ellos, vuelve conmigo. La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin.'","Zagh, Maestro de la Guardia, derrotado","Encuentra y derrota a Zagh, Maestro de la Guardia","Glóin recibió información desde Rivendel de que hay varios líderes en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Vighar Trotasendas, por orden de Glóin, ofrece recompensas por dar caza a estos líderes dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Vighar Trotasendas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Encontraste a los líderes trasgos por toda la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Dâgal vigilaba a los orcos de Angmar, Zagh recorría los túneles gritando órdenes a los guardias, y Farmak corría por los pasadizos buscando intrusos. Ahora que han sido derrotados, debes regresar con Vighar.","'Glóin me dice que has estado colaborando con él para descubrir por qué los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos se han vuelto tan audaces. Pensé que te gustaría saber que me informó de varios líderes dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos que deben ser encontrados y eliminados para debilitar la determinación de los trasgos.\
\
'No sé dónde podrás encontrarlos en las profundidades, pero cuando los halles, debes encargarte de ellos sin demora.\
\
'La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste de este campamento, y encontrarás a estos líderes trasgos por todo el lugar.'"},
[7869]={"'Esas criaturas inmundas se merecen la enfermedad que las consume, pero no voy a quedarme de brazos cruzados tolerando su presencia en nuestras minas por más tiempo. Entra en la Sala Decimosexta y asegúrate de que la limpieza haya comenzado.'","Guardianes, clamamaldiciones y orcos fúngicos explosivos pueden encontrarse en la Sala Decimosexta, al noreste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Odmar te envió a encontrar y destruir a los orcos que cree que lideran esta incursión enfermiza en la Sala Decimosexta.","Regresa con Odmar en el Refugio Sombrío","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","'Me corresponde supervisar la matanza de los líderes de este campamento asqueroso. La Sala Decimosexta fue en su día utilizada como vivienda y almacén por los enanos de Moria, ¡pero ahora es una plaga de orcos!\
\
'Bien, tengo intención de poner fin a este problema. Adéntrate en la Sala Decimosexta, al noreste de aquí, y elimina la corrupción de los guardianes, los clamamaldiciones y esos orcos particularmente repugnantes que estallan en esporas cuando te aproximas.\
\
'Haz todo esto y luego regresa conmigo cuando hayas terminado, pues me gustaría contar las muescas de tu arma. Este abatimiento que me invade se aliviará cuando vea pruebas de la caída de los orcos.'","'Tu arma luce mejor tras esta hazaña, ¿no es así? ¡Mira cómo resplandece de orgullo! Informaré a Mallas de que has hecho lo que te pedí. Tienes el agradecimiento y la buena voluntad de los enanos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}.'","Líderes de las huestes","Odmar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Has combatido valerosamente contra los orcos infectados de la Sala Decimosexta y has derrotado a muchos guardianes, clamamaldiciones y orcos portadores de terribles hongos. Ahora deberías informar a Odmar de que has cumplido sus órdenes."},
[7870]={"Defeat Nink-hai chieftains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Odda can be found near the road south of the Cuthstan.\
\
You have disrupted the Nink-hai chain of command, and Odda is awaiting your return.","Talk to Odda at his tent near the road","'The Nink-hai chieftains will rarely stray too far north. I would look about their tents to south, nearer to the river.\
\
'I will be watching you from here and await your safe return.'","The Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent.\
\
Odda has asked you to remove the chieftains who are atop the tribe's chain of command.","Leaders of the Nink-hai","Defeated Nink-hai chieftains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Odda has observed the movements of the Nink-hai Orc-tribe. The tribe has a number of dangerous chieftains that are at the head of the chain of command.","'Good. Your actions have surely sown confusion among the Nink-hai. The Orc-warriors will be lost without the orders handed down from their chieftains.'","'I have been watching the comings and goings of these Orcs for some time now. They broke off from a larger group dwelling in the Misty Mountains, and they now call themselves the Nink-hai.\
\
'The Nink-hai have a few chieftains which seem to give orders to the rest of the tribe. I must remain here to watch the path east to Stangard, but if you were able to deal with some of these chieftains, it should utterly disrupt the plans of the Nink-hai.'"},
[7871]={"'I am sorry I was not allowed to fight by your side, ${PLAYER}. Someday, the men loyal to my mother will show their loyalty to me, and I will be able to act the part of a true Thane, not some cowed boy-child.\
\
'I was inspired by your feats at Nîn-stazg. It was a pleasure to watch a free warrior do what was right.'","The Warleader of Nîn-stazg can be found deep within the Orc encampment of Nîn-stazg, south-east of Floodwend.\
\
You should defeat the Warleader of Nîn-stazg.","'Now my son is angry at me, and talking nonsense about battle and freedom. I do not appreciate this meddling, ${PLAYER}. I wish you would stay out of the affairs of Floodwend.\
\
'Aldor Harding sent you, and for that reason I do not set my guards to knock you out of town, but I must insist that you cease this meddling with my son.\
\
'He is only a boy!'","'You fight like none I have ever seen, ${PLAYER}. I wish to fight like you, someday, when I have put a few notches on my blade.'","'We are here only to protect Thane Radwig, at the bidding of Lady Etta.'","'The overseers of Nîn-stazg were an Orkish version of our Sergeants, but they must have a true leader -- a Thane, but in the dark fashion of Mordor.\
\
'He will be the most dangerous one of all. It is imperative that we remove their leader to slow their advance on the town of Floodwend!'","Leading Floodwend's Demise","Etta, mother of Thane Radwig, is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should speak with Etta.","Defeat Nîn-stazg's Warleader from Mordor","Nîn-stazg's war-leader poses a dire threat to the city of Floodwend and its young Thane.","Return to Radwig in Floodwend","Speak with Etta","Thane Radwig is in the Mead Hall of Floodwend.\
\
You should tell Thane Radwig that the Warleader has been slain, which should bring some peace of mind to the young Thane."},
[7872]={"Find and defeat Lanferth","Leading Through Fear","Talk to Idmar","'${PLAYER}, you have aided us well. Only one task remains...we must break their leadership. My men have heard talk of a brutal man named Lanferth, who dwells deep within Hordfierd. He leads the brigands on raids into Ost Celebrant and is notorious for making certain that he gets his cut of the loot by any means necessary.\
\
'We have heard whispers from his men recently that he has become very queer and often will no longer personally venture into Ost Celebrant. We have no idea why.\
\
'Journey to Hordfierd and defeat him. Without his leadership, the brigands will not find riches in Parth Celebrant. Go, and if he has anything of value, return it to us.'","Defeated Lanferth","'Defeat Lanferth, ${PLAYER}, then perhaps the rest of his men will depart this land.'","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should return to Idmar at once with news of your victory.","'Lanferth is no more? Good. These brigands should be thrust into chaos without his leadership, as vicious as it was.\
\
'Did you find anything of value among his keepings?'","The brigands are led by a man named Lanferth, and Idmar believes eliminating him may put an end to their invasion.","Lanferth's tent is located deep within Hordfierd.\
\
Idmar has asked you to defeat Lanferth, leader of the brigands."},
[7874]={"Rollo Boffin está en Casa del Bosque, al este de Alforzaburgo, en el camino de Cepeda.\
\
Dado que Longo Madriguerales no pudo ayudarte a descubrir la ubicación de Gerebert, Esilia te pidió que hablaras con Rollo Boffin. Dado que Rollo supervisa gran parte de la hierba para pipa que pasa por Casa del Bosque, y Gerebert se escondió en un carro que transportaba hojas hacia el este, puede que sepa algo sobre Gerebert.","'¿Esilia te envió a verme, verdad? ¡Vaya sorpresa! No parecía muy amiga mía después de que me casé con mi Alda, pero supongo que el tiempo lo cura todo, como se suele decir.\
\
'¿Así que buscas a un hobbit que se escondió en uno de los carros de hojas de Longo Madriguera? ¿Gerebert Tuk era su nombre? Bueno, es curioso que menciones eso, ya que yo también he perdido algo, y creo que puede estar relacionado.'","Longo Madriguerales no pudo ayudarte a descubrir qué ha sido de Gerebert Tuk, pero Esilia pensó en alguien más con quien podrías hablar.","'Rollo Boffin está en Casa del Bosque, que se encuentra al este de Alforzaburgo, en el camino de Cepeda. Puede que sepa lo que le pasó a Gerebert, ya que Rollo tiene muchos tratos con los carros de hojas que pasan por Casa del Bosque.'","Hojas en Casa del Bosque","'Verá, acabo de pensar en alguien más a quien podríamos preguntar. Mi prima Alda está casada con Rollo Boffin en Casa del Bosque. Algunos no consideraron que fuera un matrimonio sabio, yo incluida, pero parecen bastante felices.\
\
'Eso, sin embargo, es irrelevante. La importancia de Casa del Bosque es que gran parte de la hierba de pipa de las Tierras de los Tuk pasa por allí para otros puntos de la Comarca. Rollo supervisa gran parte de esa hierba de pipa.\
\
'Tal vez, dado que Gerebert se escondió en un carro de hojas que viajaba hacia el este, Rollo pueda saber algo sobre él. Debo decir que cuanto menos descubran, más ansiosa me pongo por él. ¡Rollo vive en Casa del Bosque, al este de Alforzaburgo en el camino de Cepeda!'"},
[7875]={"'Nada mal. Tampoco bueno, pero nada mal, especialmente para ${PLAYERNAME:un[m]|una[f]} principiante. Tienes algo de talento natural.'","'Habla con el 'Maestro de Pasatiempos' cercano para aprender lo básico y conseguir una caña de pescar básica gratuita. Luego, mientras estés junto a él, atrapa un pez para que pueda observar que tienes la técnica correcta.'","Madog te ha pedido demostrar tus habilidades para pescar.","'${PLAYERNAME:Otro pescador aficionado[m]|Otra pescadora aficionada[f]} que viene a ayudarnos a reforzar nuestras reservas de comida para el invierno. Bien ${PLAYERNAME:hallado[m]|hallada[f]}, soy Madog y este tipo a mi lado es Teilo. Estamos a cargo de llenar esos estantes con pescado seco que pasaste antes. Si quieres ayudarnos, atrapa tres peces pequeños desde el muelle aquí. Tienes que hacerlo en el muelle, donde podamos observar tu técnica, ¿de acuerdo?\
\
'Si necesitas aprender lo básico, habla con este autoproclamado 'Maestro de Pasatiempos' aquí al lado. Te enseñará lo esencial y te dará una caña de pescar básica.'","Habla con Madog","Madog te pidió atrapar un pez mientras estás de pie cerca del Maestro de Pasatiempos en Lhan Garan.\
\
Atrapa un pez.","¡Has atrapado un pez!","Ponte de pie cerca del Maestro de Pasatiempos en Lhan Garan y atrapa un pez.","Aprendiendo a Pescar en Lhan Garan"},
[7876]={"Alas curtidas de los dragonzuelos","Pieles de dragonzuelo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las alas de los dragonzuelos son resistentes y curtidas; con la preparación adecuada pueden dar lugar a una armadura robusta.","Recolecta pieles de dragonzuelo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta pieles de dragonzuelo","Las alas de los dragonzuelos son resistentes y curtidas; con la preparación adecuada pueden dar lugar a una armadura robusta.\
\
Deberías recolectar alas de dragonzuelo en el paso de Ram Dúath.","Lleva los cueros a Melthindir","'¡Gracias, ${PLAYER}! Esto será muy útil para forjar excelentes armaduras para los Montaraces.'","Melthindir está en Esteldín, vigilando fuera de la entrada este.\
\
Deberías llevar el cuero que recogiste a Melthindir.","Se pueden encontrar dragonzuelos en el valle occidental de Ram Dúath, al norte de Esteldín.\
\
Deberías recolectar alas de dragonzuelo en el paso de Ram Dúath."},
[7877]={"You have escaped from the Halls of Black Lore, but without Faeron. You must find him and discover if it was indeed Viznak you heard inside.","Leave No One Behind","Talk to Faeron","Éowyn quickly gathers bandages, splints, and disinfectant","Viznak and Faeron need your help!\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'.","'${PLAYER}! I lingered outside the Halls to see if Viznak escaped, but the merrevail were in close pursuit! I took out as many as I could and carried him here, but he is gravely injured. I do not know if more are coming. You must bring help! Hurry!'","You inform Rhadrog that Dolenthol will suffice as a medic and ask if he is ready to depart.\
\
'You told him? But, but... can we trust him with Viznak's secret?'\
\
You nod and assure Rhadrog that Dolenthol is trustworthy.\
\
'Good enough. We must leave at once!'","'Now that the crisis is averted, I will return my focus to the Halls of Black Lore. It is undoubtedly in the best interests of the Free Peoples that everything inside is removed from the world. However, we witnessed Lhaereth adding the recipe for her perfected plague to the archive.\
\
'Do you know what a boon it would be to understand how it is made? Our scholars can study it, develop a cure, possibly even find a way to counteract it before it is even released! We must find a safe way inside the archive, and we must find that plague recipe!\
\
'I will put all of my efforts into this task, but caution requires patience. I will find a way to contact you when the time is right, and then we will return to the Halls of Black Lore.'","Talk to Rhadrog to begin 'Instance: Viznak Lives'","'You must search for Faeron! I will stay here in case he comes back. He must be somewhere in the Circle of Madness!'","Talk to Viznak","Faeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are in quick pursuit.\
\
You should return to the Barad Elenath and inform Rhadrog!","Faeron has returned to Barad Elenath, the Stargazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Faeron has rescued Viznak, but the merrevail are hot on their heels!\
\
You should inform Dolenthol!","You quickly tell Rhadrog that Faeron is nearby with a gravely-wounded Viznak.\
\
'They're alive! We must go at once, but I admit I know only the basics of field medicine. We need a proper medic!'","Faeron did not return to the Stargazers' Spire with the others, so he must still be somewhere in the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should find Faeron!","'What is wrong, ${PLAYER}? Is this about your friend Viznak? Who is he?'\
\
You avoid answering the question outright, but you tell Éowyn that Viznak is wounded and Faeron needs help.\
\
'Of course I will help! I should be able to patch him up so we can get him to safety.'","Talk to Rhadrog","'Quickly! They may be under attack!'","Dolenthol is ready to help Faeron and Viznak.\
\
You should let Rhadrog know you are ready to go.","'Hai, ${PLAYER}! How's my favourite bodyguard?'\
\
Viznak is not quite his usual self due to his injuries, but he seems chipper enough. You ask him how he is feeling.\
\
'Viznak won't let some bat bites slow him down, no way! Not when my bodyguards need me! I'll stay here with Faeron and Rhadrog until Blight Lady goes away. Stupid Blight Lady. She is the worst!\
\
'You go inside, I'm sure Faeron wants to order you around some more! Haha! I'll stay out here, out of sight. Pretty sure the other Rangers aren't so nice to goblins.'","Viznak has survived the attack, and is now resting outside Barad Elenath.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Find Faeron","Talk to Dolenthol"},
[7878]={"Bingo te sonríe con una expresión de disculpa","Derrota a los sapos de las colinas salvajes en el Pantano de la Rana (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Creo que hemos dado esquinazo a esos hobbits entrometidos, ${PLAYER}, pero mi elección de ruta alternativa puede no ser la ideal. Verás, ¡no soporto a los sapos y las ranas! ¡Su sola visión me llena de temor y me deja completamente paralizado!\
\
'¡No, no lo digas! Pensé que el nombre de Pantano de la Rana era solo un nombre tonto. ¡No sabía que sería el hogar de tantas criaturas de ese tipo! ¡Esos malditos croadores viscosos!\
\
'¿Podrías derrotar a algunos de los sapos de las colinas salvajes que se interponen en nuestro camino? Solo los suficientes para que pueda volver al camino. ¡Te lo agradecería muchísimo!'","Encuentra a Bingo en las afueras de Bolgovado y entrégale su otra bolsa","Encuentra a Bingo en Delagua y entrégale su bastón","Bingo te ha dicho que continuaría hacia Delagua mientras tú recuperabas su bastón.","Bingo te ha dicho que olvidó su otra bolsa y te ha pedido que regreses a su agujero hobbit para recuperarla.","Bingo ha decidido que la primera parada de su viaje será el cruce de caminos del Cruce, al este de Cavada Grande.","'He estudiado bastante el mapa y creo que deberíamos salir de Cavada Grande por el camino del este, en dirección al Cruce y Bolgovado. Caminemos hasta el cruce de caminos, en la ciudad del Cruce, y luego decidiremos nuestro próximo rumbo.'","'¡Ahí estás, ! ¡Y has recuperado la bolsa que me dejé! Muchas gracias, ${PLAYER:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! ¿Sabes por qué esta bolsa es tan importante para mí? Es porque contiene mi pergamino, mi pluma y varias botellas de tinta. Tengo la intención de escribir sobre mi viaje, manteniendo un registro de todo lo que nos suceda en el camino. ¡Quiero documentar mi aventura para no olvidarla jamás!\
\
'Pensé que sería fácil dejar mi hogar, . Te lo dije cuando salimos de Cavada Grande, ¿no? Pero parece que una parte de mí ha estado arrastrando los pies: primero dejé mi bastón, luego desarrollé un miedo a los sapos que nunca había tenido antes, y luego descubrí que había dejado atrás mi bolsa y mis útiles de escritura. Al igual que el joven Wilibaldo aquí presente, con el agujero en su barco, ¡me está resultando más difícil dejar mi hogar de lo que esperaba!\
\
'¡Pero no me rendiré mientras te tenga cerca para animarme, ${PLAYER:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! ¡La aventura nos espera!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Una multitud de Boffins' (Nivel recomendado: 16)</rgb>","'Ah, ahí estás, ${PLAYERNAME:mi compañero[m]|mi compañera[f]} de viaje! ¡Y has traído mi bastón! Muy bien. ¡Sin duda me será de gran ayuda para los millas que nos esperan por delante!\
\
'No entré en la posada del Dragón Verde solo por esta cerveza, , aunque es bastante buena y deberías probarla. No, es que me seguían por la ciudad un montón de hobbits entrometidos, y entré aquí para despistarlos. Creo que lo mejor sería salir de aquí sin llamar la atención y atravesar el pantano alrededor de los Ranales para poder irnos sin que nos molesten.\
\
'¡Nos vemos en el Pantano de la Rana!'","El cenagoso Pantano de la Rana se encuentra al este y al norte de Delagua.\
\
Bingo te ha sugerido que tomes un desvío por el Pantano de la Rana para evitar a los hobbits entrometidos que lo persiguen.","Has recuperado el bastón de Bingo, y ahora deberías llevárselo a Delagua","Viaja hasta el Cruce y habla con Bingo","Bingo dejó su bastón apoyado contra el muro exterior de su agujero hobbit, y te ha pedido que vuelvas a buscarlo.","'No vas a creértelo, ${PLAYER}, pero he olvidado algo más que quería traer conmigo. Traje una de las bolsas que tenía pensado traer, pero olvidé la otra. ¿Podrías volver a mi casa y traérmela?\
\
'No puedo prescindir de esta otra bolsa. De hecho, ¡contiene la razón de mi viaje!'","'Creo que he olvidado algo, ${PLAYER}. He pasado los últimos minutos tratando de decidir qué es lo que me inquietaba, y creo que por fin lo he averiguado. ¡Mi bastón! Lo dejé apoyado contra el muro exterior de mi agujero hobbit, y no lo recogí cuando partimos.\
\
'¿Te importaría volver a mi agujero y recuperar mi bastón? Pensé que sería fácil partir, ¡y lo ha sido! Fácil partir sin mi bastón, pero ya lo echo de menos y no puedo seguir mucho más tiempo sin él. Espero que no pienses que soy un tonto por haberlo dejado atrás, pero así ha sido.\
\
'Continuaré hacia Delagua mientras tú vas a buscarlo, para no retrasar demasiado el viaje. ¡Me reuniré pronto contigo en el centro de Delagua!'","Has recuperado la otra bolsa de Bingo, y ahora deberías llevársela a Bolgovado","Vuelve al agujero hobbit de Bingo y recupera su bastón","'No entré en la posada del Dragón Verde solo por esta cerveza, ${PLAYER}, aunque es bastante buena y deberías probarla. No, es que me seguían por la ciudad un montón de hobbits entrometidos, y entré aquí para despistarlos. Creo que lo mejor sería salir de aquí sin llamar la atención y atravesar el pantano alrededor de los Ranales para poder irnos sin que nos molesten.\
\
'¡Nos vemos en el Pantano de la Rana!'","'¿Podrías derrotar a algunos de los sapos de las colinas salvajes que se interponen en nuestro camino? Solo los suficientes para que pueda volver al camino. ¡Te lo agradecería muchísimo!'","'¡Por fin ha llegado el día, ! Mi viaje comienza, y quiero que me acompañes, ¡si no te opones a esta aventura! No estás obligado a ir más lejos de lo que quieras, y si decides marcharte en algún momento no te juzgaré ni pensaré mal de ti por esa decisión... ¡pero espero que compartas mi viaje, sin importar las millas que caminemos!\
\
'¿Sabes una cosa, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}? Pensé que sería más difícil empezar, pero parece que partir es fácil después de todo. Pensé que sería más difícil despedirme de mi hogar, ¡pero la idea de una aventura así llena mi corazón de emoción suficiente para impulsar mis pies sin ningún arrepentimiento!\
\
'He estudiado bastante el mapa y creo que deberíamos salir de Cavada Grande por el camino del este, dirigiéndonos al Cruce y a Bolgovado. Caminemos hasta el cruce de caminos, en la ciudad del Cruce, y luego decidiremos nuestro próximo rumbo.'","Sapos salvajes de las colinas derrotados en el Pantano de la Rana (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vuelve al agujero hobbit de Bingo y recupera su otra bolsa","Bingo tiene miedo de las ranas y los sapos, y te ha pedido que derrotes a suficientes sapos de las colinas salvajes que plagan el Pantano de la Rana para que pueda regresar al camino.","'No te lo vas a creer, ${PLAYER}, pero he olvidado algo más que quería traer conmigo. Traje una de las bolsas, pero olvidé otra que necesito. ¿Podrías volver a mi casa y traérmela?\
\
'No puedo prescindir de esta otra bolsa. De hecho, ¡contiene la razón de mi viaje!\
\
'Has derrotado suficientes sapos como para que pueda volver al camino, y continuaré el viaje mientras tú vas a buscar mi otra bolsa. Me reuniré contigo en las afueras de Bolgovado, ¡si estás de acuerdo!'","La última vez que viste a Bingo, estaba paralizado por el miedo en la parte más occidental del Pantano de la Rana.","'¿Sabes algo sobre el señor Bingo Boffin? Mis amigos y yo lo vimos por la ciudad, ¡pero nos dio esquinazo y no le encontramos! ¡Dicen que se va de aventuras, lo cual nos parece muy peculiar!'","Bingo está listo para emprender finalmente su viaje, y quiere que lo acompañes.","Bingo te ha dicho que se reuniría contigo en las afueras de Bolgovado una vez que recuperaras la otra bolsa que accidentalmente se dejó en casa.","Partir no es fácil","Habla con Bingo en el Pantano de la Rana","'¿Te importaría volver a mi agujero y recuperar mi bastón? Pensé que sería fácil partir, ¡y lo ha sido! Fácil partir sin mi bastón, pero ya lo echo de menos y no puedo seguir mucho más tiempo sin él.\
\
'Continuaré hacia Delagua mientras tú vas a buscarlo, para no retrasar demasiado el viaje. ¡Me reuniré contigo en el centro de Delagua dentro de poco!'"},
[7879]={"Bregar está en Duillond, al norte de Celondim.\
\
Toronn te ha pedido que intentes convencer a Bregar de que lo acompañe al Oeste.","Saliendo de la Tierra Media","'Mi hermano desea dejar la Tierra Media, pero creo que es momento de hacer frente a la Sombra que crece en el Este. Con tu ayuda, quizá Toronn entre en razón.\
\
Esta Tierra Media que amamos pronto enfrentará un gran peligro, y estamos obligados a defenderla. No puedo zarpar al Oeste todavía.'","'Mi hermano y yo hemos vivido mucho tiempo en estas costas y hemos visto mucho en ese tiempo. Ahora ha llegado el momento de dejar este lugar y zarpar hacia el Oeste.\
\
Sin embargo, mi hermano no ve con claridad y desea quedarse aquí. Siempre hemos vivido juntos, y no podría imaginar un día de mi vida sin su compañía y consejo. Él es el lazo que me une a esta Tierra Media. Mientras él quiera quedarse, me veo obligado a esperarle.\
\
Si puedes, ve a Duillond y trata de convencer a Bregar de que se reúna conmigo aquí en Celondim. Es hora de comenzar nuestro viaje. El refugio está al norte, junto al camino.'","'Por favor, convence a Bregar de que debe dejar este lugar, sin importar sus sentimientos hacia él.'","Toronn quiere dejar la Tierra Media y viajar al Oeste, a las Tierras Imperecederas, pero no se irá mientras su hermano, Bregar, se niegue a partir."},
[7881]={"El enano Svanr se encuentra en la escalera occidental de Nud-melek, sobre Khadar-zarâm.\
\
Deberías hablar con Svanr.","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Qué oportuno encuentro; veo que tú también deseas atravesar Nud-melek para alcanzar la agradable luz del sol más allá. Me encanta tener compañía en mis viajes.'","Habla con Svanr en Nud-melek","'Esta cabra te llevará a Nud-melek, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}.'","'Has hecho mucho por nosotros, ${CLASS:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} , ¡y te estamos agradecidos! Pero veo que estás ansioso por continuar tu peregrinaje por Khazad-dûm.\
\
'Como muestra de mi gratitud, esta cabra te llevará a Nud-melek y te dejará en la escalera sobre Khadar-zarâm. ¡Nud-melek es la última sala antes de alcanzar la luz del Valle!'","¡Nud-melek te espera! La última sala de Moria antes de alcanzar la luz del sol del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío se alza ante ti en tu camino por Khazad-dûm.","Abandonar las profundidades"},
[7882]={"Saliendo de las minas","Carro destruido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Encontraste evidencia de movimiento enemigo hacia la puerta este mientras estabas fuera? Eso no es una buena señal.\
\
'Lamentablemente, esta gran sala está tan contaminada por todo tipo de cosas. ¿Qué deberíamos hacer?'","Dile a Svanr lo que encontraste","Las orcas parecen haber estado arrastrando carros de suministros a sus campamentos; parece que podrían estar reuniendo provisiones para una ofensiva importante.","Svanr se encuentra cerca de Sudulthurkh, en el norte de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes decirle a Svanr que has destruido varios carros de los goblins en Nud-melek, dificultando su salida de las minas.","Destruye los carros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los carros de la mina se encuentran en Nud-melek, en el cruce norte de Sudulthurkh.\
\
Las fuerzas de Mazog están arrastrando carros de mina llenos de suministros a través de Nud-melek."},
[7883]={"Voracious leeches can be found in the waters of Dath Nethryn.\
\
You should defeat voracious leeches.","The Conquest of Gorgoroth has encountered a particularly dangerous species of leeches and requests an adventurer's aid.","Leech Hunt","Examined bubbling water (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat voracious leeches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated voracious leeches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A bounty notice is pinned to the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'An extremely dangerous species of leech has been discovered in the swamps of Dath Nethryn. The Conquest of Gorgoroth requests an adventurer to travel to Lhingris and exterminate them. They are known to lurk beneath the water's surface and will attack if the water is disturbed.'","Examine bubbling water (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[7884]={"Find the missing sword","'You found my sword! I suppose there are some in this town who have a little skill, at the least.'","Found the missing sword","Téothic is in Aldburg, to the west of the hills.\
\
You found Téothic's heirloom sword and should return it to him at once.","Téothic hired a villager to kill a boar for him and gave the villager a family sword to do so. When the villager arrived at the location, he was overcome with dread, dropped the sword, and fled.","Left for Dread","Téothic's sword may be found in the hills east of Aldburg.\
\
Téothic has asked you to recover his sword, an old family heirloom, which was dropped by the hunter that he hired.","'It is hard to find good help these days. I hired a man to kill a boar for me...and I even provided him the weapon to do so. So, what did he do when he found the boar? He was frightened, dropped the sword, and ran away.\
\
'I no longer care about the boar. I simply want the sword back. It is an old family heirloom.\
\
'I need someone trustworthy and brave to retrieve it for me. Will you do this?'","Talk to Téothic"},
[7885]={"DNT - Players will not see","Board up homes in Entwade with wood planks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Traveller, would you do me a favour?\
\
'Thane Edric has asked that the homes of those who departed today be boarded up to protect them from any assaults that our foes might launch. I would complete this task myself, but I -- and I am certain many others -- would like to prepare the defences for the coming siege.\
\
'If you would aid us, I have already set out the planks near the homes that need to be boarded up, so all you have to do is hammer them into place. This would save us a great deal of time, friend.'","Thane Edric and his men have turned their attention to protecting Entwade now that the people have fled to safety in Aldburg.","Left in Our Care","Talk to Gifel","Gifel can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade at one of the tables.\
\
You have finished boarding up the homes of Entwade, and should now return to Gifel.","Planks can be found outside several homes in Entwade.\
\
Gifel has asked that you take some of the pressure off of Edric's men by boarding up some of the houses.","'Thank you for taking the time to do this, ${PLAYER}. You bought our men more time to prepare for the coming siege in doing so.\
\
'When this war has finally ended and our people can return, they can rest easy knowing that our foes did not invade their homes to any vile end.'"},
[7886]={"Talk to Léothred in Framsburg","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Léothred can be found in Framsburg.\
\
You should talk to Léothred in Framsburg.","Talk to Léothred elsewhere in Framsburg","'We learned quite a lot upon our first day at Framsburg. I do say, we shall learn even more tomorrow! Until then I will write down my findings and get some well-deserved rest. I suggest you do the same.'","Framsburg can be found in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should explore Framsburg.","Explore Framsburg","Legacy in the Mist","'Lóthar’s grandson Bóra succeeded him, and during Bóra's rule, King Thorin I of the Longbeards was slain by Orcs in Ered Mithrin. This sparked the Fifth War of Dwarves and Orcs. The Éothéod found themselves pulled into the fighting that raged in the mountains around them, for the Orcs threatened them as well. This unrest lasted through Bóra’s rule and that of his son Maera, ending at last in the time of Théodric, Maera’s son.'","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","Establish an encampment in Misthallow near Framsburg","Travel to Hlithseld to rest","'Grieving, Lóthar took in his one-year-old grandson, Bóra, and raised him as his own. During this time, a change befell the Ai-thúda. Due to close contact with both the dwarves and the Hól-budlan, their language underwent a series of changes, so that by the end of Lord Lóthar’s rule, it mostly resembled the later tongue of my people.\
\
'Framabárg became Framsburg in their language; Hól-budla became holbytla, and their own name of Ai-thúda now was spoken as Éothéod. It also became tradition, after the fashion of Frumgar long ago, for the lords to name their heirs with words that meant lord or some variant thereof.'","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should establish the camp of Hlithseld with Léothred.","'Lord Théodric was in turn succeeded by his son Haldend, a grim and rude-mannered man who urged his father to break the Ban of Thíudric and enter Gundabad. He yearned for the glory he had found fighting the Orcs, and at the age of fifty, only two years into his reign, he foolishly chose to attempt to ride a mearh.'","This rocky promontory is blanketed with old ruins","'Haldend was no more fortunate than Gundric and Gisilhári. The steed he chose kicked him in the head, cracking his skull. He survived, but the wound robbed him of his wits, leaving him unable to speak more than a few words or lift a sword.'","'I have learned much from our time in Misthallow thus far, ${PLAYER}. Now comes the time to make the trek to the great keep of my people's past. It is a relic and a keeper of memories both. There we will most certainly uncover many a hidden secret, and reaffirm many of the stories of old. Come, let us travel and establish a safe encampment near Framsburg. I would imagine that we will stay there to study the keep for quite some time.'","'At last, we reach Framsburg! Now where to begin? Ah yes, Lóthar.\
\
'Now it was Lóthar’s son Gundric who brought the most grief to his father’s rule, for he dared seek to ride one of the mearas. Like his longfather Gisilhári he failed, perishing beneath the angry hooves when the beast trampled him.'","'This encampment will do nicely. I thank you for your help. Framsburg is but a bridge away, not far at all!\
\
'Yes, I did call this keep Fasthálla earlier. I do apologize. The keep was renamed Framsburg after the great Fram!\
\
'Now then, should we begin studying the ruins?'","Hlithseld is located in the north of Misthallow.\
\
You should travel to Hlithseld and rest.","Framsburg can be found in Misthallow.\
\
You should learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred.","'With the Éothéod’s aid, the Longbeards once again drove the last Orcs back to Gundabad. Théodric would not break his namesake Thíudric’s ban upon entering the Mountain-home though. His reluctance played a part in King Glóin’s decision not to enter Gundabad either.'","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, seeks to travel to the great fortress that his people built in Misthallow.","Learn the history of the Rohirrim with Léothred","Hlithseld has been established!"},
[7887]={"'Were it not for you, I fear Malthellim would have slain any who defied him.\
\
'I do not understand how he could align himself with such vile men - a new king is not worth the deaths of your country and kin.\
\
'We can only count ourselves lucky that more of the disillusioned folk in Ost Anglebed did not come to his aid.'","Legacy of Strife","'I have seen enough, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'We must go to the Steward at once and convince him to do something before our people turn on each other. Each day has brought more and more rumours of the supposed greatness of these Heirs, but it is clear that they mean naught but harm for Gondor. The people are divided, and I see them look with such disdain at their fellows... I fear this conflict shall soon come to blows.\
\
'And this treachery in Ost Anglebed... who could be behind it? We must find out before they can weaken us enough for the Enemy to overcome our defences.\
\
'Let us go, ${PLAYER}!'","'Let us speak with the Steward at once, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to Nimithil","Concerned by the growing influence of the Heirs of Castamir in Lebennin, Nimithil hopes to warn Steward Malthellim of treachery within Ost Anglebed and prevent her people from splintering.","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to accompany her in speaking to the Steward of Ost Anglebed of her worries about the Heirs of Castamir and their influence on her people.","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have survived Malthellim's betrayal and should now speak to Nimithil about what is to be done next."},
[7894]={"Completa La Batalla por Aughaire","'Hay mucho por hacer, si alguna vez queremos derrotar la sombra siempre creciente de Angmar.'\
\
<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF00FF>Completa diez misiones e instancias para ayudar a aquellos en Angmar.\
\
Completar esta misión desbloqueará Angmar legendario: Derrotar a la Sombra (Avanzado), y puede ser repetida semanalmente. Esta misión será eliminada en el tiempo de reinicio semanal, y por lo tanto debe ser completada semanalmente hasta esa hora.</rgb>","Completa Bogbereth","Completa cualquier instancia de Helegrod","Completa el Emisario de la Ciudad de los trasgos","Completa La Batalla en el Rammas Deluon","Completa Carn Dûm","<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Completa La Batalla de Rhunendin","Completa el Emisario de los Duramano","Completa cualquier instancia de Fornost","Completa Barad Gularan","Angmar legendario: Derrotar a la Sombra","Completa cualquier instancia de Annúminas","Completa Urugarth","Completa el Emisario de la Mano blanca","Completa el Emisario de los Trév Duvárdain","Completa la Posada de los Abandonados","Completa Ferndúr el Virulento","Completa cualquier instancia del Gran Túmulo","Completa La Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu","Completa Los salones de la Noche"},
[7896]={"<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.","Completa las misiones legendarias de Angmar en Barad Gularan, Carn Dûm o Urugarth para obtener una recompensa adicional.","<rgb=#00e4ff>Completa misiones legendarias en las mazmorras de comunidad en Angmar</rgb> (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmar legendario: Recompensa de comunidad"},
[7910]={"<rgb=#00e4ff>Completa 'Angmar legendario: La grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu'</rgb> (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Angmar legendario: Recompensa de incursión","Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.","Completa la misión 'Angmar legendario: La Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu' varias veces para obtener una recompensa adicional."},
[7923]={"Completa Ost Dunhoth - Ala de la Enfermedad y el Veneno","Completa Ost Dunhoth - Ala de Gortheron","Completa Altapiedra","Completa Sammath Gûl","Completa La Batalla en la Torre","Completa Sâri-surma","Completa la Sala de Armas de Dol Guldur","Completa Templo Perdido","<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Completa las Mazmorras de Dol Guldur","Completa Protectores de Thangúlhad","Bosque Negro Legendario: Rompiendo la Oscura Hechicería","Completa Barad Guldur","'Hay mucho por hacer, si alguna vez queremos recuperar el Bosque Negro.'\
\
<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Completa Recintos de Huargos de Dol Guldur","Completa Ost Dunhoth - Ala de las Heridas y el Miedo","Completa Forzar la Puerta del Nigromante","<rgb=#FF00FF>Completa nueve misiones e instancias para ayudar a los habitantes del Bosque Negro.\
\
Completar esta misión desbloqueará Bosque Negro Legendario: Rompiendo la Oscura Hechicería (Avanzado), y se puede repetir semanalmente. Esta misión se eliminará en el momento de reinicio semanal, por lo que debe completarse semanalmente antes de ese momento.</rgb>","Completa Ataque contra Dannenglor","Completa Asalto a la Guarida de los Espectros del Anillo","Completa La Granja de Cotonorte"},
[7959]={"Completa La Batalla de la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Completa Las Forjas de Khazad-dûm","Completa La Gran Escalera","Completa El Tesoro Olvidado","Completa Fulz-zahar","Completa Filikul","Completa Tumun-ghâr","'Hay mucho por hacer, si alguna vez queremos recuperar Moria.'\
\
<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","<rgb=#00e4ff>Esta misión es para servidores legendarios.</rgb>","Completa La Batalla de la Vía de los Herreros","Completa La Batalla de Lórien","Completa Skûmfil","Completa La Fauce Vil","Completa La Escuela en Tham Mírdain","Completa Excavaciones Tenebrosas","Completa La Batalla de la Vía Profunda","Completa Las Ruedas de Agua: Nalâ-dûm","Completa Mekeb-faham","<rgb=#FF00FF>Completa doce misiones e instancias para ayudar a los habitantes de Moria.\
\
Completar esta misión desbloqueará Moria Legendaria: Venciendo la Profundidad (Avanzado), y se puede repetir semanalmente. Esta misión se eliminará en el momento de reinicio semanal, por lo que debe completarse semanalmente antes de ese momento.</rgb>","Moria Legendaria: Venciendo lo Profundo","Completa Las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar","Completa los Salones de Artesanía","Completa Fil Gashan","Completa Bult-kâr","Completa La Sala Decimosexta","Completa Sejer-tharâkh","Completa La Biblioteca en Tham Mírdain","Completa Dâr Narbugud"},
[7961]={"No ganaste la batalla en treinta minutos","Rilhathel está decidida a cantar canciones sobre tus esfuerzos en defensa de Lórien y te ha planteado un desafío verdaderamente legendario, además de simplemente rechazar a los orcos.","'Este no será un desafío fácil, ${PLAYER}. Solo un héroe verdaderamente legendario podrá derrotar a Narshpug y a Grakâmâb, evitar que Belvagor sufra heridas graves y ganar la batalla, todo en menos de treinta minutos.'","'He ideado numerosos desafíos para ti, ${PLAYER}, pero este será sin duda el más difícil —y el más gratificante— de todos.\
\
En la próxima batalla, deberás derrotar tanto a Narshpug como a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo, impedir que Belvagor sufra ninguna herida y ganar la batalla con éxito... todo ello en menos de media hora.\
\
Los héroes menos capaces podrán completar algunas partes de este desafío por separado, pero solo los más grandes héroes podrán lograrlo todo a la vez. ¡Espero con interés comprobar que eres capaz de hacerlo, ${PLAYER}!'","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también derrotar a Narshpug y a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo de batalla, evitar que Belvagor sufra heridas graves y hacerlo todo en treinta minutos.","Grakâmâb derrotado","Habla con Rilhathel en Caras Galadhon","'Apenas puedo creerlo, ${PLAYER}, ¡pero has completado mi desafío legendario! ¡Esto sí que ha sido una hazaña digna de las canciones de los juglares!\
\
Acepta esta recompensa y siéntete satisfecho sabiendo que la has ganado con una demostración verdaderamente espectacular de habilidad.'","Debes completar el desafío más legendario de Rilhathel durante la Batalla de Lórien","Belvagor ha resultado herido","Gana la batalla en treinta minutos","Desafío legendario del Centinela","Rilhathel te ha pedido no solo ganar la batalla por Lórien, sino también derrotar a Narshpug y a Grakâmâb antes de que abandonen el campo de batalla, evitar que Belvagor sufra cualquier herida y hacerlo todo en treinta minutos.","Evita que Belvagor sufra heridas graves","Derrota a Narshpug","Narshpug derrotado","Derrota a Grakâmâb","Rilhathel se encuentra en Caras Galadhon esperando saber si has completado su desafío legendario con éxito.","Completa con éxito la Batalla de Lórien"},
[7962]={"Ocio Perdido en Radlaw","'¡Hola! No te preocupes por mí. Solo he perdido el mejor lugar para leer mis libros. Solía contemplar la quieta corriente del Aguaestancada y reflexionar con calma, hasta que esos rufianes de Radlaw se mudaron allí.\
\
'Ahora me he resignado a leer bajo este poste. De hecho, me preguntaba si podrías ayudarme, tuve que abandonar mi lugar con prisa y en el desorden perdí uno de mis libros favoritos.\
\
'¿Podrías encontrarlo por mí? Ah, y si no te molesta... enséñales una lección a esos rufianes mientras estás allí\
\
'Radlaw está al norte. Debería ser fácil de encontrar, ya que linda con el Aguaestancada.'","Has encontrado el tomo perdido de Rhawn Torlan.\
\
Deberías llevárselo de vuelta a Rhawn Torlan en Clegur.","Derrota Rufianes en Radlaw (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rhawn necesita ayuda para encontrar su tomo perdido. Debería estar en Radlaw, en un lugar con vista al Aguaestancada.","Has encontrado el libro de Rhawn","'¡Ah, sí! ¡Ese es! ¡El Sendero de la Luz! Este es un libro bastante raro y estoy muy agradecido de que hayas podido encontrarlo.\
\
'¿Quizá conozcas esta historia? Es un relato de poderosos guerreros venidos de más allá del centelleante cielo nocturno, derrotando al mal allí donde se oculta. Empuñan espadas de luz deslumbrante. Es bastante inverosímil, pero las aventuras que viven estos guerreros son realmente fascinantes.\
\
'Quizá no. No es una historia que lea cualquiera. Una leyenda rara, una vez más.'","'Radlaw se encuentra al norte, ahora ve y dales una lección'","Rufianes en Radlaw derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rhawn Torlan ha perdido su lugar favorito para contemplar el Aguaestancada.","Encuentra el libro de Rhawn","Habla con Rhawn Torlan"},
[7963]={"'¡Gracias por traer ese paquete de lembas!'","El lembas es el legendario pan de viaje de Lórien, y un alimento básico para aquellos que realizan largas guardias.","'¡Muchas gracias por llevar el lembas a los guardias!'","Lleva el paquete de lembas a Losdirith","'¡Muchas gracias por este lembas, ${PLAYER}! A veces las horas pasan en tedio, y esto me dará la fuerza para mantener mi vigilancia sin quejarme.'","'No me has traído nada.'","'No se necesita mucho lembas para dar la fuerza para continuar.'","'¡Gracias de nuevo por ese lembas, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}!'","'Vigilar las puertas de Caras Galadhon da hambre, ${PLAYER}, y a menudo es una tarea ingrata.\
\
'He preparado paquetes de lembas para que los lleves a los guardias en las diversas puertas de la ciudad: a Losdirith en la puerta del jardín de la Dama Galadriel y a Minathlang en la entrada de la ciudad.\
\
'Espero que el lembas restaure la fuerza de los guardias y les haga saber que su servicio es apreciado por todos nosotros.'","Lembas para las Puertas","Basdan está en Telain Bangad en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Has entregado los paquetes de lembas a los guardias y ahora deberías regresar a Basdan.","Lleva el paquete de lembas a Minathlang","'Los guardias de Caras Galadhon deberían recibir más reconocimiento por su servicio.'","'¿Has entregado el lembas a los guardias, ${PLAYER}? ¡Muy bien! Toma esto por tu esfuerzo y sabe que les has hecho sentir que su servicio es apreciado, como seguramente lo es por todos los miembros de la ciudad.'","'¡No he olvidado el lembas que me trajiste, ${PLAYER}!'","Losdirith se encuentra en la entrada del jardín de la Dama Galadriel. Minathlang se encuentra en la entrada de la ciudad.\
\
Basdan te ha dado paquetes de lembas para que los lleves a los guardias en las diversas puertas de la ciudad.","'¡Gracias por esto, ${PLAYER}! Disfrutaré enormemente de este lembas a medida que pasen las horas.'","'Lleva esos paquetes de lembas a Losdirith en la puerta del jardín de la Dama Galadriel y a Minathlang en la entrada de la ciudad.'","Habla con Basdan en Telain Bangad"},
[7965]={"Conmovido por los relatos de la batalla perdida de los enanos, Arnod desea ahora honrar la memoria de los enanos caídos.","'Siento que hemos hecho un buen trabajo hoy, ${PLAYER}. Nuestros antepasados estarían orgullosos. Los hemos honrado como deberíamos haberlo hecho hace mucho tiempo.'","'Ve a Tharâkh Bazân y cuenta la historia de la batalla olvidada.'","Hay tres lugares en Tharâkh Bazân donde Arnod desea que cuentes la <rgb=#FF0000>historia</rgb> de las batallas: una estatua al norte, una fuente al sur y una estatua central.\
\
Arnod quiere que honres a los enanos caídos de Moria contando la historia de la antigua batalla perdida en los monumentos que los enanos construyeron en Tharâkh Bazân.","Has honrado a los caídos con la historia de su antigua batalla","Arnod está en el extremo este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Arnod querrá saber que has honrado a los antiguos contando la historia de su derrota.","'Quiero restaurar la gloria que creo que hemos perdido al negar nuestra historia. Es hora de contar las historias de las batallas pasadas en Khazad-dûm. No a mis compañeros enanos, porque no las apreciarían; para honrar verdaderamente a los caídos, debemos contar nuestra historia a esas figuras legendarias. Por supuesto, esto no es realmente posible, pero aún podemos honrar su memoria de otra manera.\
\
'Ve a los jardines y colócate frente a las estatuas que se encuentran en el centro, al norte y frente a la fuente del sur. Allí, cuenta la <rgb=#FF0000>historia</rgb> de la gran batalla.\
\
'Los que cayeron murieron en batalla y con honor. Deberían ser recordados para siempre por su valor.'","Para que no olvidemos","'Es bueno que hayas honrado el valor de nuestros antepasados.'","De pie frente a la estatua del norte","De pie frente a la fuente del sur","Cuenta la historia de la antigua batalla","Habla con Arnod en Tharâkh Bazân","De pie frente a la estatua central"},
[7966]={"Completed 'The Harrowing of Morgul'","Complete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty","Complete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.","'With Shaktur and Dargásh defeated, we can now press on deeper into Minas Morgul. We can also provide secure supply lines and further reinforcements to the Rangers who have already climbed higher into the city.\
\
'Your work has allowed us to gain a foothold in this dreadful city, and we cannot thank you enough.'","'We must defeat both Shaktur and Dargásh in Zhar Dushgoi if the Rangers are to move further into the city!'","Let Them Fight","With the defeat of both Shaktur and Dargásh in Zhar Dushgoi, the Rangers are able to reach deeper into Minas Morgul.\
\
You should speak to Damrod and inform him of your victory.","'The battle between the Orcs has begun, and an opportunity has presented itself. The captains of both armies have made themselves known. If we are able to defeat both of them, the Orcs will be leaderless and collapse into an unruly, undisciplined mob! We will then be able to move further into Minas Morgul.\
\
'Now that we have identified the captains of the two clashing armies, Shaktur and Dargásh, we should set our plan into motion. Good luck out there, ${PLAYER}. The Rangers of Ithilien are with you!'","Talk to Damrod","Damrod has asked that you enter the fray between Gothmog and Ugrukhôr's forces and defeat each army's captain."},
[7967]={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Gudule's Home","Langhár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.\
\
If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.","'Excellent roaring, ${PLAYER}! If I did not know better, I would think you were secretly a Beorning yourself! But of course that cannot be.'","Cowardly goblins are lurking in the forest near the homes of Woodmen. They wait patiently for their chance to break in and steal whatever they can.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Hodver's Home","Let Them Hear Your Roar","<rgb=#FF00FF>Roar</rgb> at a cowardly goblin at Evrul's Home","'I smell more goblins here, ${PLAYER}. They must be waiting for the homes to be emptied, so they can break in and take anything that isn't nailed down! Find them, and we will show them how mighty we are! We will give them a big Beorning <rgb=#FF00FF>ROAR</rgb> and send them fleeing!'","The goblin flees in fear!","Cowardly goblins can be found in the forest near the Woodmen homes.\
\
Find them and <rgb=#FF00FF>roar</rgb> at them!","Habla con Langhár"},
[7968]={"'The Wargs must meet their end, ${PLAYER}. Go now to Draugdegil, to the north-east and remove their threat.'","The goblins of Dol Guldur feed their Warg companions foul meats to make them stronger and more vicious.","Talk to Maerwen at Helethir","Complete Maerwen's task","The Wargs and the foul meats they are fed with can be found at Draugdegil, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Maerwen has asked you to defeat the Wargs of Draugdegil, after tricking them into eating all of the goblins' foul meats.","'I have not seen such valour in many years ${PLAYER}, well done!'","Completed Maerwen's task","'It seems the Wargs in Draugdegil have acquired the taste for raw flesh... the beasts become ravenous and fey.\
\
'Enter into Draugdegil and defeat the goblin-leader Athgrat and the Warg-matron Kranklob, but make sure to deal with all the Wargs after exhausting their stores of meat!\
\
'Travel north-east to Draugdegil and make sure you have slain the Wargs after goading them into consuming their specially-prepared meat, and you will be greatly rewarded, ${CLASS}.'","Let Them Hunger","Maerwen is at Helethir, south-west of Dol Guldur.\
\
You should return to Maerwen for your reward.","'News of your success travels before you! I have not seen such valour in many years, ${PLAYER}... well done!'"},
[7970]={"'Thank you for all you have done, ${PLAYER}. I see now how wrong I was to trust the words of strangers over those of my grandfather. I will endeavour to be more like him....'","Track the half-orc emissary to make sure he is not causing trouble","'Elain will find Guto and bring him back in good time, but at the moment I am more worried about that emissary who stormed back to his camp.\
\
'Will you track him, ${PLAYER}, and warn us if you see signs of retribution for our insult? We can escape to the hills if we have warning.\
\
'That man did not speak of war against us, and I cannot see what they could gain from it, but I am worried nonetheless.'","The emissary of Isengard has left you with an uneasy feeling. You should track him and see if the White Hand encampment shows any signs of rallying for retribution at the Stag-clan's refusal to join them.","The half-orc emissary retreated southwards towards the White Hand encampment, probably following the road.\
\
You should follow the emissary and make sure that he does not plan to attack Lhan Tarren after being insulted by Riagán.","Hurry back! Lhan Tarren may have been attacked already, while you searched for the wrong foe....","It can only be hoped that Guto and Elain are safe at least, since they were not there during the attack.\
\
You should seek them in Lhan Tarren and try to help recover from the attack by the White Hand.","Speak with Guto","'I thought I heard the pitter-patter of nosy feet upon the road behind me. What do you want, ${PLAYER}? Are you here to make sure that I am not causing any trouble?\
\
'Your friends in Lhan Tarren are the trouble-makers, not I, and the White Hand is swift and just to slap away its foes.\
\
'Oh, have you not heard? You came the wrong way if you wanted to pick a fight with Isengard. The act of retribution is behind you, not ahead. Hurry home to your friends, ${PLAYER}! Ha!'","Guto is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should speak with Guto.","Lhan Tarren was attacked! Help the Stag-clan (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Let Us Follow Them"},
[7971]={"Many people should see you from here!","Talk to Tâlugar","Fly a kite near the southern cove","Fly a kite atop the eastern bridge","'Ah, you return! I saw you flying your kite from here! You have excellent form. Here is your reward, as promised.'","Fly a kite on the southern beach","Per Tâlugar's request, you have flown a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own. You should return to Tâlugar on the south side of Furtherholm's harbour to collect your reward.","'Fair winds to you, my friend! Have you ever flown a kite before?\
\
'Watch them soar through the sky like a great bird! Feel the wind tug at your string; harness the very air for your personal enjoyment! ...Oh, you are already familiar? My humble apologies. Well, then you must already know of the glorious wonder kites offer! Do you need another? There is nothing like having a new kite to make all of your friends envy you.\
\
'I am Tâlugar and I come from the famous city of Umbar Baharbêl, bringing beautiful kites from the furthest reaches of Middle-earth to trade for a small amount of coin. These kites are of the finest quality! ...You will think about it? That is all I could ever ask for, of course. No, I take that back. There is one thing I would ask of you.\
\
'Since you are already familiar with kites, I will offer you payment if you let loose your favourite kite and let it kiss the sky in front of the good people visiting this island. Let them see the fun you have as your kite navigates the winds like a ship soaring in the heavens! If they see how much fun it is, they will surely flock to me to purchase one of their own!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Tâlugar has come to Furtherholm from Umbar Baharbêl to sell kites to the visitors.","Let's Go Fly a Kite","Tâlugar has asked you to fly a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own.","Fly a kite on the sand in front of the inn","Fly a kite at the west end of the harbour","People here don't seem to notice your kite","Was that kite-envy you just saw?","Do the people here appreciate your kite?","People here seem impressed with your kite!"},
[7972]={"¡Tomemos la Cuernavilla!","Théoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg.\
\
You should witness the end of the siege on Helm's Deep.","You have been given a map to guide you to Théoden's side.\
\
You should read the map and go to Théoden at once.","Habla con Théoden","Théoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg.\
\
You should speak with Théoden.","Use the map to rally to Théoden's summons","Witness the last stand.","'We have done it! Rohan is safe at last -- for a while, that is.\
\
'Many heroes fought and died this night, but many survived as well. You have shown legendary strength and loyalty to my peoples, ${PLAYER}, and fought with the zeal of Helm Hammerhand himself.\
\
'I honour you, friend to the Helmingas and Eorlingas alike.'","'The battle is almost over, ${PLAYER}! You have aided us in the defence of Rohan, and we are about to make our last stand.\
\
'Do you wish to see what may be the last ride of the Rohirrim? This war ends...now.'","Witness the last stand of the Rohirrim","You have received a summons to participate in the last stand of the Rohirrim at Helm's Deep.\
\
Many have survived the long night, and it is time to ride out and throw down the enemies that now fill the vale."},
[7974]={"Léothred can be found at Hlithseld.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.","Agátur hands you a letter.\
\
'Léothred wanted me to give this to you when I saw you next.'\
\
The letter is brief:\
\
'${PLAYER}, I am still in Misthallow and wish to talk with you, as soon as you are able.\
\
'Léothred.'","A letter has arrived from Léothred, the Rohirric historian.","'Ah, you got my letter.'","Talk to Léothred at Hlithseld","Letter From Léothred"},
[7975]={"Collect corsair orders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected corsair orders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what the corsair captain of Makham Mijann is planning.","Bruidis can be found in the village of Tadrent.\
\
You should bring the corsair orders to Bruidis so that she can look through the information you've gathered.","Corsair orders can be found on the bodies of corsair footmen throughout Belfalas.\
\
Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what Captain Tabadam of Makham Mijann is planning.","Letters of the Enemy","Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what the corsair captain of Makham Mijann is planning.\
\
The first corsair order reads as followed:\
\
'You are ordered to ambush passing carts for supplies. Bring the supplies to the river for shipment downstream. Do not, I repeat do not enter Tadrent. A confrontation would cost us more time than we can afford. We will put Tadrent to the sword once this business is done.'\
\
Captain Tabadam","Collect corsair orders","'Wonderful work, ${PLAYER}. These corsair orders look to have all the information we need.'\
\
Bruidis ruffles through the orders, reading them intently.\
\
'If I am to understand this correctly, they are stealing supplies and re-routing them to Edhellond. Why, that is the abandoned Elf port, not dissimilar to the Grey Havens many a traveller has spoken fondly of.\
\
'There is much to do. We must act swiftly!'","Bring the corsair orders to Bruidis in Tadrent","Collected corsair orders"},
[7976]={"Find the last sleeping Ent","'You are a peculiar little creature, hm, you are. I felt... hoom... the shadows disappear. The light shines where my old, what is the word? Ta-rum. My old friend, he grew quite terrible here, quite sad. Quite wrong.\
\
'You freed him from his prison. I could not come in, or I would have rotted with the others. I slept at the edge of shadows, and I could not help, but you let the light in, by yourself!'","You come to an Ent standing at the edge of a fair meadow, soaking up the sunlight that flows off the ridge.","Greenroot is awake now! At last, one Ent in Fangorn has felt some change.","Letting the Light In","Talk to Greenroot","Trees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.","Trees that block the light can be found throughout the Black Heart of Fangorn.\
\
Trees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.","Let light in (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The shadows have long kept the foliage so hatefully dense that it blocked all light into the Black Heart. It is time to push back the leaves to let the light shine in once more. There is hope for this place yet!","Greenroot has appeared behind you while you let the light in.\
\
You should speak with Greenroot.","Clear foliage to allow light in (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clear foliage to allow light in","You should press further into Fangorn, towards the sunlight you see in the distance to the south-west of this grove."},
[7980]={"'¡Miau! ¡Hola, soy Tens! Aunque escribo despacio debido a mis patas peludas, puedo ayudarte a completar la serie de misiones Épicas. Si completas esta misión, se marcará que has completado el Libro I de la serie Épica.'","Sube de nivel: Libro I","Completar esta misión marcará a tu personaje como habiendo completado todas las misiones del Libro I de la serie Épica.","'¡Muy bien! Cuando completes esta misión, se marcará que has completado el Libro I de la serie Épica. ¡Diviértete!'"},
[7981]={"Completar esta misión marcará a tu personaje como habiendo completado todas las misiones del Libro II de la serie Épica.","'¡Miau! ¿De vuelta tan pronto? Bueno, puedo completar el Libro II de la serie de misiones Épicas para ti ahora, si quieres. Solo háblame de nuevo.","Sube de nivel: Libro II","'¡Muy bien! Cuando completes esta misión, se marcará que has completado el Libro II de la serie Épica. ¡Diviértete!'"},
[7982]={"'¡Ya que lo pediste tan amablemente, cuando completes esta misión se marcará que has completado el Libro III de la serie Épica. ¡Diviértete y ten cuidado!'","'¡Miau! ¿De vuelta tan pronto? Bueno, ahora estás en el Libro III de la serie de misiones Épicas. ¿Quieres que lo complete ahora para ti? Solo háblame de nuevo y te marcaré adecuadamente.","Completar esta misión marcará a tu personaje como habiendo completado todas las misiones del Libro III de la serie Épica.","Sube de nivel: Libro III"},
[7983]={"'¡Miau! ¿Ya estás en el Libro IV de la serie de misiones Épicas? Vaya, tantas buenas misiones y aventuras. Ojalá mis patas peludas me permitieran crear contenido tan emocionante como eso, pero solo soy un humilde gato que escribe despacio.\
\
Bueno, al menos puedo ayudarte. ¡Solo háblame de nuevo!'","Sube de nivel: Libro IV","'¡Cuando completes esta misión, se marcará que has completado el Libro IV de la serie Épica. ¡Disfruta!'","Completar esta misión marcará a tu personaje como habiendo completado todas las misiones del Libro IV de la serie Épica."},
[7984]={"Level Up: Book IX","'Completion of Book IX coming up!\
\
Oh, and if I were you, I would hold on to something... you are in for a bit of a bumpy ride....'","'Meow! Oh, you are up to Book IX. This was where you learned that the dottering old fool Sara Roblecorazón was really Amarthiel in disguise. Very exciting!\
\
But none of that for you! You'll be flagged as having completed Book IX if you speak to me again.","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book IX of the Epic quest series."},
[7985]={"Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book V of the Epic quest series.","'Meow! Goodness, you are up to Book V of the Epic quest series. That is a very good series of quests, if you ask me. All those bits with Skorgrím and the Dourhands, and then you end with a Dragon. Terribly exciting!\
\
Oh well, you'll be able to skip all that once you complete this quest.","'Here we go! When you complete this quest you'll be flagged as having completed Book V of the Epic.'","Level Up: Book V"},
[7986]={"Level Up: Book VI","'Well, you know how this works by now. Complete this quest and you'll have Book VI of the Epic quest completed.'","'Meow! Well, well, you are up to Book 6 of the Epic quest series. I wonder, are you getting tired of speaking to me yet? No? Well good! Because there so much left to the Epic quest after this book.\
\
But that's for later. For now, if you want to complete Book 6 of the Epic quest, you'll be all set once you complete this quest.","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book VI of the Epic quest series."},
[7987]={"'Meow! I just realized, you are talking to me. I'm a cat! How is that possible? That's just strange... Oh well, would you like to be flagged as having completed Book VII of the Epic quest series? If so, speak to me again!","'Do I even need to tell you how this works? Oh well, just in case you weren't paying attention. Completion of this quest will flag you has having completed Book VII of the Epic quest.'","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book VII of the Epic quest series.","Level Up: Book VII"},
[7988]={"Tens yawns.\
'Hrm? Oh yes, you can complete the quest now.'","Level Up: Book VIII","'Meow! You know sometimes I dream that I'm something called a \\qSystems Designer\\q and that I make jokes about Sauron destroying things. Isn't that strange?\
\
You probably don't care about that though, you just want me to complete Book VIII of the Epic. Well speak to me again and I shall do so!","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book VIII of the Epic quest series."},
[7989]={"'Meow! Welcome back. I think that last quest took a lot out of you, but you don't look too worse for the wear. Too bad the same can't be said for your equipment!\
\
Anyway, it looks like you want to complete Book X now. That whole business with Mordrambor is interesting, isn't it? Well, I thought so at least, you'll be skipping over all that, so you won't get a chance to read it.","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book X of the Epic quest series.","'Book X completion coming right up!'","Level Up: Book X"},
[7990]={"'Wha? Huh? Another book? How many of these books are there? For goodness sake, I'm never going to get any sleep!\
\
'Well let's get this over with. Speak to me again if you want to complete Book XI.'","'Book XI completion coming right up! Now leave me be!'","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book XI of the Epic quest series.","Level Up: Book XI"},
[7991]={"'Book XII completion coming right up! Enjoy!'","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book XII of the Epic quest series.","'Wow, yet another book to help you through. That Standing Stone Games, they keep adding more and more content for you, the beloved player. They must be saints, I tell you. Their selflessness really is something for others to learn from, don't you think?\
\
'OK, enough of me prattling on, time to get down to business!'","Level Up: Book XII"},
[7992]={"Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book XIII of the Epic quest series.","'Book XIII completion coming right up! Enjoy!'","'Wow, yet another book to help you through. That Standing Stone Games, they keep adding more and more content for you, the beloved player. They must be saints, I tell you. Their selflessness really is something for others to learn from, don't you think?\
\
'OK, enough of me prattling on, time to get down to business!'","Level Up: Book XIII"},
[7993]={"Level Up: Book XIV","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book XIV of the Epic quest series.","'Wow, yet another book to help you through. That Standing Stone Games, they keep adding more and more content for you, the beloved player. They must be saints, I tell you. Their selflessness really is something for others to learn from, don't you think?\
\
