[7995]={"Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book I of the Mines of Moria Epic quest series.","Level Up: Mines of Moria - Book I","'Would you look at this. I'm helping you complete Mines of Moria content now too! I'm a multi- purpose cat, I am. Oh, and look at this, I have a bunch of Item Advancement stuff to give you. That's so cool.\
\
'Alrighty, let's do this, eh?'","'Book I of the Mines of Moria coming right up! Enjoy!'"},
[7998]={"Level Up: Volume II: Book I","'Alright, when you complete this quest you'll be flagged as having completed Book I of the Epic. Have fun!'","'Meow! Hello, I'm Elevensies! Although I type slowly, due to my furry paws, I can help you complete the Epic quest series. If you complete this quest, you'll be flagged as having completed Book I of the Epic series.","Completion of this quest will flag your character has having completed all the quests in Book I of the Epic quest series for Volume II."},
